<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1SA" style="id">- Zigua Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Samwilu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Chitabu cha nkongo cha Samwilu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Samwilu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Samw</para>
  <para style="mt1">Chitabu cha nkongo cha Samwilu</para>
  <para style="mt2">ULONGOZI</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha nkongo cha Samwilu. Hahana mntu amanyize yudya awandike ichitabu cha nkongo na cha kaidi cha Samwilu. Mta kuwandika halagise mwe ichitabu chino, mna Daudi hegu vyadahika kujinka aho na saivyo hadahile kulagisa mawandiko matuhu yakulanga wikazi wa Sauli na Samwilu. Kwaviya yadya yendile yamzunguluke umta kuwandika hegu wata kuwandika ivitabu vino, hata ivyo havimanyike umo vyawandikagwa naho ni kuhi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yemndani mwe chitabu cha nkongo cha Samwilu 1. Sula ya 1-3 yalonga ukwelekwa na mwitango wa kutendwa muwoni Samwilu. 2. Sula ya 4-7 yatamwila ivyo Wafilisiti watahile Idishanduku dya Chohile kulawa kwa Waizulaeli na ivyo diwegaile file mwe isi ya Wafilisiti umo wakatenda nadyo. 3. Sula ya 8-15 yachigambila ivyo vilaile umo Waizulaeli wakalombeza seuta na Samwilu niyo amhaka mavuta Sauli saviya seuta ywa nkongo, na vikaheza nyumani ivyo Zumbe amlemele Sauli. 4. Mwe isula ya 16-31 chasoma ivyo Samwilu amhakile mavuta Daudi atende seuta ywa kaidi kwa Waizulaeli na ivyo Sauli ajezize kubula mo udumo wo wikazi wakwe akaunga amkome Daudi.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1SA 1" />
  <para style="s">Elikana na wantu we kaya yakwe uko Shilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 1:1" />15 Kwendaga na mntu yumwenga kulaila mwe idikabila dya Efulaimu akwitangwa Elikana uko komzi wa Lama, kweisi ya amagulu ya Efulaimu. Uyo endaga mwana ywa Yelohamu, mwezukulu ywa Elihu, mwekaya ya Tohu molukolo lwa Sufu. <verse eid="1SA 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 1:2" />Elikana endaga na wavyele waidi, mvyele uyumwenga naketangwa Hana, na mvyele umtuhu naketangwa Penina. Penina endaga na wana, mna Hana hendaga na wana. <verse eid="1SA 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 1:3" />Chila mhilimo Elikana nendile akatamba kulaila komzi wakwe wa Lama akwela aita chani akamvikile Zumbe Chohile mta udahi wose na kumlaviza ntambiko uko Shilo. Uko wana waidi wa Eli, Hofini na Finehasi, wendaga walavyantambiko wa Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="1SA 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 1:4" />Chila nkanana Elikana akalavya ntambiko, nakamwinka unde dimwenga dye ntambiko mkaziwe Penina, iviya nendile akawenka wanawe wa chiche na wachilume unde dimwedimwe. <verse eid="1SA 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 1:5" />Mna Elikana nendile akamwinka mkaziwe Hana unde dikulise kwaviya nakamungisa. Kwaviya Zumbe Chohile nendile kamfunga icheleko. <verse eid="1SA 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 1:6" />Mna Penina nendile akamchokoza na kumjela maya vitendese na kumsezenga mchemi yakwe kwaviya Zumbe Chohile hamwinkile cheleko. <verse eid="1SA 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 1:7" />Mbuli izo nendile zikajendeleza chila mhilimo. Chila nkanana Hana akaita kwenyumba ya Zumbe, mchemi yakwe Penina nendile akamjela maya Hana. Ivyo Hana nakaila na kufika kudya chintu chochose. <verse eid="1SA 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 1:8" />Elikana mgosiwe dya Hana nendile akamuza, “Hana kwambwani waila? Kwambwani hukudya? Kwambwani una chinyulu? Togola miye sikuwagila kwako kujinka wana chilume mlongo?”<verse eid="1SA 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hana na Eli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 1:9" />Zuwa dimwenga weze wajike kudya na kunywa uko Shilo kwenyumba ya Zumbe Chohile, Hana niyo achimala. Chipindi icho mlavyantambiko Eli nakekala mwe fumbi hankanda ho lwivi lwe inyumba ya Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="1SA 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 1:10" />Hana nendile ana chinyulu vitendese. Na umo akamlombeza Zumbe Chohile nakaila kwa usungu. <verse eid="1SA 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 1:11" />Hana niyo aika nazili akagamba, “Weye Zumbe mta nguvu zose, unikaule miye mndima ywako! Kaula izinkunto zangu, unikumbuke usekunijala! Uneva unaninka mwana ywa chilume, nelisa mwana uyo nahwinke weye Zumbe Chohile atende ywako mazuwa yose yo wikazi wakwe, naho hajeze kuwegula izifili zakwe.” Uwazwa 6:4-7.<verse eid="1SA 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 1:12" />Hana kajendeleza kumlombeza Zumbe Chohile, na mlavyantambiko Eli nendie akamsinya mwemilomo yakwe. <verse eid="1SA 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 1:13" />Hana nendile akalombeza chimoyomoyo, mna milomo yakwe naikavinavina, mna icho nakalonga hachivike. Eli niyo afanyanya kugamba Hana kakolwa. <verse eid="1SA 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 1:14" />Ivyo, Eli niyo amuza Hana, “Nojendeleze kukolwa kubula ini?” Ukozi wako leka.<verse eid="1SA 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 1:15" />Hana niyo ahitula, “Sivyo ivyo sekulu ywangu, miye ni mvyele mta nkunto zilozize. Miye sinywele divai hegu mpombe, mna nalavyanya kwa Zumbe Chohile yadya ye mo moyo wangu. <verse eid="1SA 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 1:16" />Usekunifanyanya kugamba miye ni mvyele sikuwagila chintu. Nahalombeza ivyo kwaviya nina chinyulu changu na nkunto.”<verse eid="1SA 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 1:17" />Eli niyo amhitula, “Hita kwa utondowazi, naho Chohile ywa Izulaeli akwinke chiya umlombeze.”<verse eid="1SA 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 1:18" />Hana niyo agamba, “Nakulombeza, unifanyanyize yedi miye mndima ywako.” Vikaheza Hana niyo ahalawa, akudya nkande, hena chinyulu vituhu.<verse eid="1SA 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwelekwa na kusentwa kwa Samwilu kwa Chohile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 1:19" />Zuwa ditimile mtondo, Elikana na wantu we ikaya yakwe wasunguza kwinuka chilochilo, weze waheze kumvikila Zumbe Chohile niyo wauya kukaya kwawo uko Lama. Elikana niyo agona na mkaziwe Hana na Zumbe Chohile niyo ahitula amalombezo ya Hana. <verse eid="1SA 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 1:20" />Ivyo Hana niyo atenda msoka, na kwefungula mwana chilume, Hana niyo amwitanga umwana uyo Samwilu. Kwaviya kagamba, “Simlombeza kwa Zumbe Chohile.”<verse eid="1SA 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 1:21" />Elikana na wantu wose we ikaya yakwe niyo wakwela vituhu uko Shilo wakumlaviza ntambiko Zumbe Chohile ya chila mhilimo na kuchintiza nazili. <verse eid="1SA 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 1:22" />Mna Hana hakweile uko, kwaviya kamgamba vino mgosiwe, “Nnamlekeza umwana ukonka, nanimwigale kwenyumba ya Zumbe Chohile na kumsenta ekale uko mazuwa yose yo wikazi wakwe.”<verse eid="1SA 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 1:23" />Elikana niyo amhitulua Hana, “Damanya diya dikukuwagila. Goja kubula aho nomlekeze ukonka. Zumbe Chohile aichintize inazili yako.” Ivyo Hana niyo asigala hakaya ajendeleza kumlela mwanawe kubula aho amlekeze ukonka.<verse eid="1SA 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 1:24" />Eze amlekeze ukonka, Hana niyo amwigala uyo umwana akatenda achei mdodo hamwenga na njeku ina mihilimo mitatu, juniya dya unga na kabuyu ka divai. Hana niyo amwingiza umwana kwenyumba ya Zumbe Chohile uko Shilo. <verse eid="1SA 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 1:25" />Weze waheze kuchinja idya injeku, niyo wamwigala umwana kwa Eli, mlavyantambiko. <verse eid="1SA 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 1:26" />Hana niyo amgamba Eli, “Sekulu ywangu, saviya Zumbe akukutenda wikale, togola wanikumbuka? Miye ni yudya mvyele endaga kachimala hajihi hako akamlombeza Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="1SA 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 1:27" />Simlombeza Zumbe Chohile aninke yuno mwana, naye kaninka chiya nimlombeze. <verse eid="1SA 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 1:28" />Elo, miye namwinka Zumbe Chohile yuno mwana. Mazuwa yose yo wikazi wakwe natende kasentwa kwa Zumbe Chohile.” Vikaheza uko, niyo wamvikila Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="1SA 1:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1SA 2" />
  <para style="s">Malombezo ya Hana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 2:1" />Vikaheza Hana niyo alombeza akagamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:1">“Moyo wangu wamtogola Zumbe Chohile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:1">Namtunya Zumbe Chohile uyo ni nguvu wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:1">Nawaseka wankondo wangu, nabweda kunikombola.<verse eid="1SA 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 2:2" />Hahana mkuka saviya Zumbe Chohile, naho hahana akuligana na weye, hahana mwamizi saviya weye Zumbe Chohile ywetu.<verse eid="1SA 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 2:3" />Msekweduvya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:3">Msekuleka milomo yenyu ilonge kwa ubezi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:3">Kwaviya Zumbe Chohile nuyo amanyize.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:3">Uyo ahima ntendwa zose.<verse eid="1SA 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 2:4" />Uta wa wakankalu uvunika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:4">Mna wadya wasokezi wajendeleza kudindimala.<verse eid="1SA 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 2:5" />Wadya walozole mwe nkongo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:5">haluse walimiza chani wasume.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:5">Mna wadya wendile na gumbo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:5">haluse hawana gumbo naho.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:5">Mvyele yudya endile hakweleka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:5">kefungula wana walozize.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:5">Mna mvyele mta wana walozize, haluse hana wana.<verse eid="1SA 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 2:6" />Zumbe Chohile akoma naho auyusa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:6">uyo awaseleza kubula mwe bome hedina uhelo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:6">na kuwavuza naho.<verse eid="1SA 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 2:7" />Zumbe awatenda watuhu watende wachiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:7">watuhu nawo watenda wagoli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:7">watuhu wanyanyahale na wantu watuhu awakweza.<verse eid="1SA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 2:8" />Awenula wachiwa kulaila mwe malumbi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:8">naho awenula wakunga wambizi kulaila mwe maivu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:8">na kuwasika hamwenga na wakulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:8">na kuwaika wekale mwe vigoda vikwikalwa ni wakulu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1SA 2:8" />
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:8">Kwaviya mwegamo weisi ni wa Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:8">mlanga mwakwe kaika isi.<verse eid="1SA 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 2:9" />Nawadime wakanuni wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:9">Mna wantu wehiye nawagile kwechiza.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1SA 2:9" />
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:9">Kwaviya mntu hakuchumilwa kwa nguvu zakwe.<verse eid="1SA 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 2:10" />Wadya wakumwihiwa Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:10">nawakomwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:10">kulaila kwembingu nalulume saviya mbaula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:10">Zumbe Chohile nawakantile wantu wose we isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:10">namwinke nguvu seuta ywakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 2:10">iviya najenyeze nguvu za mntu ywakwe asagule.”<verse eid="1SA 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 2:11" />Vikaheza Elikana auya kukaya Lama, mna umbwanga Samwilu kasigala uko Shilo akamsankanila Zumbe Chohile akalongozwa ni Eli, mlavyantambiko.<verse eid="1SA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wana wa chilume wa Eli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 2:12" />Wana wa chilume wa Eli wendaga waihisa, hawamtunyize Zumbe Chohile, <verse eid="1SA 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 2:13" />hegu mwe ivintu wantu waungigwe wawenke walavyambiko. Chila nkanana mntu akatenda amlaviza ntambiko yakwe, mndima ywa mlavyantambiko nendile akeza na mti una mpanda ntatu mo mkono umo inyama ikatipwilika. <verse eid="1SA 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 2:14" />Mndima uyo ywa mlavyantambiko nendile akatunga uwo umti mwe nyungu ikutipwilisa inyama, chihendo chochose che inyama nachitungwe na kulavigwa numti uwo yatenda yamlavyantambiko. Vino nivyo wawadamanyize Waizulaeli wose wendile wakaita uko Shilo. <verse eid="1SA 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 2:15" />Ukaleka ivyo, mavuta heyenati kokwa, mdima ywa mlavyantambiko nakeza na kumgambila yudya mntu akulavya ntambiko, “Mlavize mlavyantambiko nyama ya koka kwaviya hakuhokela nyama yako ukutipwilisa, mna ahokela nyama mbisi du.”<verse eid="1SA 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 2:16" />Uneva mntu uyo anagamba, “Goja nnde koka amavuta vikaheza noguhe chochose ukunga.” Mndima uyo ywa mlavyantambiko namhitule, “Bule, ninka ivino haluse, uneva hukuninka nakuhoka.”<verse eid="1SA 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 2:17" />Masa ayo ya wadya wabwanga wana wa Eli yakulisaga kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile. Kwaviya wabwanga awo wabela amalavyo ya Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="1SA 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samwilu uko Shilo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 2:18" />Mwa amazuwa ayo yose, Samwilu kajendeleleza kumsankanila Zumbe Chohile, akatenda kavala kasuche keng'aile kakugubika mwe chifuwa. <verse eid="1SA 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 2:19" />Chila mhilimo mami yakwe nakamsumila nkazu ndodo Samwilu na kumwigaila umo akaita hamwenga na mgosiwe kulavya ntambiko ya chila mhilimo. <verse eid="1SA 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 2:20" />Eli kawajimbika Elikana na mkaziwe, akagamba, “Zumbe Chohile akwinke wana watuhu mwa yuno mvyele chani waguhe hantu ha yudya amlavize kwa Zumbe Chohile.” Vikaheza, Elikana na mkaziwe wauya kaya. <verse eid="1SA 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 2:21" />Zumbe Chohile niyo amwonela mbazi Hana, naye niyo efungula wana watuhu washano, watatu wachilume waidi wachiche. Mbwanga Samwilu kakula na kujendeleza kumsankanila Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="1SA 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eli na wanawe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 2:22" />Chipindi icho, Eli endaga kadalahalisa. Eze eva mbuli zose wanawe we chilume nawakawadamanyiza Waizulaeli, naivyo wakugona na wavyele wakusankana mwe nchili ye Idihema Dikukile. <verse eid="1SA 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 2:23" />Ivyo niyo awauza, “Kwambwani mwadamanya mbuli sazino? Siva mbuli kwa wantu wose kugamba mwadamanya mbuli zihiye. <verse eid="1SA 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 2:24" />Wanangu msekutenda ivyo, kwaviya mbuli hwiva kulaila kwa wantu wa Zumbe Chohile ziha. <verse eid="1SA 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 2:25" />Uneva mntu anamkola masa mnyawe, mntu mtuhu adaha kumlombezeza kwa Chohile, chani amlekeile. Mna mntu anakola masa kwa Zumbe Chohile ni yuhi akunga amlombezeze chani alekeilwe?” Mna awana awo hawamwetegeleze tati yawo, kwaviya Zumbe Chohile mwenye nakaunga awakome. <verse eid="1SA 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 2:26" />Mbwanga Samwilu kajendeleza kukula, kaungiswa ni Zumbe Chohile na wantu.<verse eid="1SA 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uwoni mwa awantu we ikaya ya Eli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 2:27" />Zuwa dimwenga, mntu ywa Chohile ambasaga Eli na kumgamba, “Zumbe Chohile agamba vino, ‘Togola, miye selagisa pwilili kwa wantu we ikaya ya Haluni, wakale wako umo wendile watumwa wa Falao kweisi ya Misili? <verse eid="1SA 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 2:28" />Mwa amakabila yose ya Izulaeli simsagula Haluni na wantu we ikaya yakwe watende walavyantambiko wangu, wanisankanile mwe nchanja yo kulaviza ntambiko, wavunkize ubani na kuvala kasuche kakugubika ichifuwa kulongozi kwangu. Siwenka wantu we ikaya ya tati yako ntambiko zangu nilavizwe ni Waizulaeli kwa moto. <verse eid="1SA 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 2:29" />Kwambwani ukameila mate ntambiko zangu na malavyo yangu nilagize wantu wangu wanigaile? Togola, kwambwani kuwategeleza wanawo kujinka miye? Haluse mwenenefya wenye kwa kudya ntambiko zangu zilavigwe ni wantu wangu wa Izulaeli.’”<verse eid="1SA 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 2:30" />“Ivyo Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywa Izulaeli agamba vino, ‘Nasilonga kugamba wantu we ikaya yako na wantu we ikaya ya tati yako namnisankanile, mazuwa yose.’ Mna miye Zumbe Chohile nagamba vino, ‘Mbuli iyo saniidamanye naho mpwi.’ Naniwatunye wadya wakunitunya na niwabele wadya wakunibela. <verse eid="1SA 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 2:31" />Tegeleza mazuwa yeza yadya naniwakome wabwanga wenyu wose na wantu we ikaya yako na mo lukolo lwako, hahatende na mgosi yoyose akunga ekale kubula adalahalise. <verse eid="1SA 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 2:32" />Weye nokunte na kuwadila finju weyawo kwa ujimbiko wose hunga niwenke wantu watuhu wa Izulaeli, mna wantu we ikaya yako hahana akunga ekale kubula adalahalise. <verse eid="1SA 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 2:33" />Hata ivyo nanase mntu ywako yumwenga atende mjima, uyo nasankane mwe nchanja yangu yo kulaviza ntambiko. Miye nanimtule ameso, akaheza nasulumile na kukunta, mna welekwa wako nawakomwe vihiye.” <verse eid="1SA 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 2:34" />“Icho nachilaile kwa wanawo waidi we chilume, Hofini na Finehasi, nachitende chilagiso kwako. Wose waidi nawabanike mwe zuwa dimwenga. Chila chintu nilongile nachitende chindedi. <verse eid="1SA 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 2:35" />Vikaheza, nanesagwuile mlavyantambiko mtuhu mkanuni kwangu na kudamanya yadya hunga. Nanimtende atende na welekwa walozize, awo nawamsankanile seuta nanimsagule miye. <verse eid="1SA 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 2:36" />Yoyose akunga asigaile mwa awantu we ikaya yako nambase uyo mlavyantambiko na kumlombeza hela hegu nkande nakumgamba, ‘Hampu nika mwendima ya ulavyantambiko chani nipate nkande ya kudya.’ ”<verse eid="1SA 2:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1SA 3" />
  <para style="s">Zumbe Chohile amlaila Samwilu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 3:1" />Chipindi icho, umo mbwanga Samwilu akamsankanila Zumbe Chohile akalongozwa ni Eli. Ulosi na uwoni kulaila kwa Zumbe Chohile navikalaila nkanana njeche. <verse eid="1SA 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 3:2" />Eli endaga kadalahala ameso yakwe yendaga hayakuwona vyedi. Zuwa dimwenga nechilo akatenda kagona kwe chumba chakwe, <verse eid="1SA 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 3:3" />Samwilu naye nendile kagona mndani mwe Inyumba yo kumvikila Chohile hajihi ne Idihema Dikukile dya Zumbe Chohile. Izita mwe ichiya chakwe Zumbe Chohile nendile zichei zikaka kwaviya nendile hakunati kucha. <verse eid="1SA 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 3:4" />Ivyo, Zumbe Chohile niyo amwitanga Samwilu. Samwilu niyo etika, “Miye hano.” Kulawa 27:2. Walawi 24:20 <verse eid="1SA 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 3:5" />Akaheza Samwilu niyo aguluka ambasa Eli na kumgamba, “Miye siza, kwaviya kunitanga.” Mna Eli niyo amgamba, “Miye sikwitange, uya kagone.” Samwilu niyo auya akugona. <verse eid="1SA 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 3:6" />Zumbe Chohile niyo amwitanga vituhu, “Samwilu!” Samwilu niyo enuka, aita kwa Eli na kumgamba, “Miye siza, kwaviya kunitanga.” Mna Eli niyo amgamba, “Mwanangu, sikwitange, uya kagone naho.” <verse eid="1SA 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 3:7" />Samwilu nendile achei hanati kumanya akumwitanga ni Zumbe Chohile, kwaviya nendile henati kumanya idizwi dya Chohile akalonga naye.<verse eid="1SA 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 3:8" />Zumbe Chohile niyo amwitanga Samwilu nkanana ya katatu, Samwilu niyo enuka aita kwa Eli na kumgamba, “Miye siza, kwaviya kunitanga.” Aho Eli niyo abunkula kugamba Zumbe Chohile nuyo akumwitanga Samwilu. <verse eid="1SA 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 3:9" />Ivyo, Eli amgamba Samwilu, “Hita kagone, anakwitanga naho, mgambe vino, ‘Longa Zumbe Chohile, kwaviya mndima ywako netegeleza.’ ” Ivyo Samwilu niyo auya akugona ahantu hakwe. <verse eid="1SA 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 3:10" />Zumbe Chohile niyo eza nakuchimala aho, amwitanga saviya nkongo, “Samwilu!” “Samwilu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:10">Samwilu niyo amgamba, “Longa Zumbe Chohile, kwaviya miye mndima ywako nakutegeleza.”<verse eid="1SA 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 3:11" />Vikaheza, Zumbe Chohile niyo amgamba Samwilu, “Kaula, naunga nidamanye mbuli siku mwa Izulaeli, iyo chila naive nehelwe. <verse eid="1SA 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 3:12" />Mwe idizuwa idyo nanimdamanyize Eli na awantu we ikaya yakwe yadya yose nalongolaga kulonga. <verse eid="1SA 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 3:13" />Simgambila kale kugamba wantu we ikaya yakwe naniwakantile mazuwa yose kwa wihi wadamanye, kwaviya wanawe wa chilume wanihuluta miye, mna kadunduga kuwachinda. <verse eid="1SA 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 3:14" />Ivyo, nelisa mwa awantu we ikaya ya Eli, ‘Wihi we nyumba ya Eli haujeze kusigwa mpwi kwa ntambiko ya kutikimya hegu malavyo.’ ”<verse eid="1SA 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 3:15" />Samwilu niyo agona kubula mtondo, akaheza niyo enuka avugula izinyivi ze Inyumba ya Zumbe Chohile. Mna Samwilu kogoha kumgambila Eli chiya evile kulaila kwa Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="1SA 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 3:16" />Mna Eli niyo amwitanga Samwilu na kumgamba, “Samwilu mwanangu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:16">Samwilu niyo etika, “Sekulu ywangu miye ni hano.” <verse eid="1SA 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 3:17" />Eli niyo amuza, “Togola Zumbe Chohile kakugamba mbwani? Usekunifisa icho akugambile. Uneva unanifisa icho akugambile Zumbe Chohile nakukantile vitendese.” <verse eid="1SA 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 3:18" />Ivyo Samwilu niyo amgambila chila chintu, hehena kumfisa chochose. Ivyo Eli niyo amgamba, “Uyo ni Zumbe Chohile nadamanye chiya akuwona chikuwagila!” <verse eid="1SA 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 3:19" />Samwilu kajendeleza kukula, Zumbe Chohile niyo atenda hamwenga naye, yadya yose alongile hahana dihunguke hata dimwenga. <verse eid="1SA 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 3:20" />Wantu wose mwe isi yose ya Izulaeli kukongela Dani ntendele ya chenya kubula Bali Sheba ntendele ya kwamwenyemzi, niyo wamanya kugamba Samwilu ni muwoni mkanuni ywa Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="1SA 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 3:21" />Zumbe Chohile kajendeleza kwelagisa uko Shilo, uko kamlaila Samwilu na kulonga naye. Na Samwilu analonga chintu Waizulaeli wose wamwetegeleza.<verse eid="1SA 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1SA 4" />
  <para style="s">Shanduku dye idilagano dyatahigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 4:1" />Samwilu kawagambila Waizulaeli ulosi udya agambilwe ni Zumbe Chohile.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 4:1">Chipindi icho Wafilisiti waduganaga hamwenga wagombe nkondo na Waizulaeli. Waizulaeli waikaga lago dyawo uko Ebenezeli, Wafilisiti nawo waikaga lago dyawo uko Afeki. <verse eid="1SA 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 4:2" />Wafilisiti niyo wemalanya wawebunga Waizulaeli na kuwakoma, nkondo ize igombwe vitendese, Waizulaeli niyo wahudwa. Waizulaeli elufu nne wakomagwa kwe chiwasa che nkondo. <verse eid="1SA 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 4:3" />Wagomba nkondo wa Izulaeli wahonaga kwe nkondo weze wabule kwedilago, wadalahala wa Izulaeli niyo wawagamba, “Kwa mbwani Zumbe Chohile dyelo kachileka chihudwe ni Wafilisiti? Chiteni chikadiguhe idishanduku dye dilagano dya Zumbe kulaila Shilo, chani adahe kwita na suwe kwe nkondo na kuchikombola kulaila kwa wankondo wetu.” <verse eid="1SA 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 4:4" />Ivyo, niyo wasigila walosi waite uko Shilo, awo niyo wadiguha idishanduku dye dilagano dya Zumbe Chohile mta nguvu zose, uyo akwikala chiseuta mlanga mwe vyumbe vidi vina mawawa vikwitangwa makelubi. Wadya awana waidi wa Eli, Hofini na Finehasi, wendanga uko Shilo wezaga hamwenga na diya Idishanduku dye Idilagano dya Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="1SA 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 4:5" />Idishanduku dya Zumbe Chohile dize dibule kwe idilago, Waizulaeli wose niyo watula chizumo cha mbwedo uhosize isi yose yazingiza. <verse eid="1SA 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 4:6" />Wafilisiti weze weve ulwasu ulo niyo wauza, “Lwasu lose ulo kwe idilago dya Waebulaniya ni lwabwani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 4:6">Weze wamanye kugamba idishanduku dya Zumbe Chohile digalwa kwedilago dya Waizulaeli, <verse eid="1SA 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 4:7" />Wafilisiti niyo wengilwa ni nkama wagamba, “Chindedi milungu iza kwedilago dyawo.” Naho niyo wagamba, “Nachiluwone! Mbuli saino hainati ilaile.” <verse eid="1SA 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 4:8" />“Nachiluwone! Ni yuhi akunga achikombole kulaila mwe milungu ino ina nguvu? Iyo ni milungu iwakomile Wamisili kwa nkomano zesimile kudya kwe idijangwa. <verse eid="1SA 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 4:9" />Haluse nyuwe Wafilisiti mtoge! Mtende wakankalu mnasekutenda watumwa wa Waebulaniya, saviya wowo wendile watumwa wetu. Mtende wakankalu saviya wagosi naho mgombe nkondo!” <verse eid="1SA 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 4:10" />Ivyo, Wafilisiti wagomba nkondo na Waizulaeli, Waizulaeli niyo wahudwa chila mntu niyo agulukila kwe idihema dyakwe. Mwe idizuwa idyo wantu walozize wakomagwa, wakomwa wagomba nkondo elufu milongo mitatu wa Izulaeli wakujenda lwa viga. <verse eid="1SA 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 4:11" />Idishanduku dye Idilagano dya Chohile ditahigwa, na wana waidi wa Eli, Hofini na Finehasi, niyo wakomwa.<verse eid="1SA 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">File ya Eli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 4:12" />Mntu yumwenga kulaila mwe idikabila dya Benyamini niyo aguluka kulawa kwe ichiwasa che nkondo aita kubula Shilo idizuwa idyo, suche zakwe zikatenda zitatuka kuno analumbi ko mtwi wakwe kulagisa kugamba ana chinyulu. <verse eid="1SA 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 4:13" />Eli, akatenda kekala mwe idifumbi dyakwe akakaula, kwaviya nendile ana nkama momoyo wakwe akafanyanya Idishanduku dye Idilagano dya Chohile. Yudya mntu eze abule ko mzi na kutambalisa ulosi uwo, chila yumwenga niyo aila kwa nkama. <verse eid="1SA 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 4:14" />Eli eze eve izwi dye ndilo, niyo auza, “Wantu awo waila mbwani?” Yudya mntu kaguluka aita kwa Eli akumgambila mbuli zilaile. <verse eid="1SA 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 4:15" />Mazuwa ayo, Eli endaga na mihilimo milongo chenda na mnane na ameso yakwe yendaga hayakuwona. <verse eid="1SA 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 4:16" />Yudya mntu niyo amgamba Eli, “Miye silawa kwe nkondo ivino haluse, siguluka kulaila uko dyelo.” Eli niyo amuza, “Togola, mwanangu uko kulaila mbwani?” <verse eid="1SA 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 4:17" />Yudya mwigala ulosi niyo amgamba, “Waizulaeli wawasumka Wafilisiti. Kulaila file zilozize mwa Waizulaeli. Iviya, wanawo wose waidi, Hofini na Finehasi, wakomwa, ne Idishanduku dye Idilagano dya Chohile ditahigwa.” <verse eid="1SA 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 4:18" />Yudya mntu eze agambe Idishanduku dye Idilagano dya Chohile, Eli niyo agwa mangali kulaila mwe idifumbi dyakwe he hampezo he nchili. Eli eze agwe ivyo, isingo yakwe niyo yavunika, kwaviya endaga kadalahala naho kadamana, niyo abanika. Eli endaga mlamuzi ywa Izulaeli kwa mihilimo milongo mine.<verse eid="1SA 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">File ya mwasigwa ywa Finehasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 4:19" />Mkamwanawe dya Eli, kugamba mkaza Finehasi, endaga msoka naho nehaguhi na kwefungula. Eze eve kugamba Idishanduku dye Idilagano dya Chohile ditahigwa na kugamba mkwewe na mgosiwe wabanika, niyo atozwa nusungu na kwefungula. <verse eid="1SA 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 4:20" />Mna umo ehajihi na kubanika, wavyele wendaga wakamwambiza niyo wamgamba, “Usekogoha, kwaviya kwefungula mwana chilume.” Mna hawahitule chochose, naho hawetegeleze. <verse eid="1SA 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 4:21" />Niyo amwitanga mwanawe uyo Ikabodi akalagisa kugamba, “Ukuka wa Chohile usika mwa Izulaeli.,” Kugamba Idishanduku dye Idilagano dya Chohile nendile ditahigwa naho isevyala na mgosiwe, wose wabanika. <verse eid="1SA 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 4:22" />Niyo agamba, “Ukuka wa Chohile usika mwe isi ya Izulaeli, kwaviya Idishanduku dye Idilagano dya Zumbe Chohile ditahigwa.”<verse eid="1SA 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1SA 5" />
  <para style="s">Shanduku dye Idilagano kwa Wafilisiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 5:1" />Wafilisiti weze waditahe Idishanduku dye Idilagano dya Chohile, wadinula kulaila komzi wa Ebenezeli kubula komzi wawo wa Ashidodi. <verse eid="1SA 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 5:2" />Wadigala Idishanduku dya Zumbe Chohile kwe inyumba ya mnungu ywawo akwitangwa Dagoni na kudika hajihi ne iditukulu idyo. <verse eid="1SA 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 5:3" />Mtondo wakwe, wantu wo umzi wa Ashidodi weze wenuke, wawona iditukulu dya Dagoni digwa chifudifudi kulongozi kwe Idishanduku dya Zumbe Chohile. Niyo wadichimalisa vituhu iditukulu dya Dagoni na kudika naho ahantu hakwe. <verse eid="1SA 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 5:4" />Mna, zuwa ditimile mtondo wakwe weze wenuke, wawona kugamba iditukulu dya Dagoni digwa chifudifudi kulongozi kwe Idishanduku dye Idilagano dya Zumbe Chohile, mtwi ne iviga ne imikono vye idyo iditukulu vyose vikantika, vilambala hechifigwe cho ulwivi. Chiwiliwili che iditukulu dya Dagoni nichodu chisigaile. <verse eid="1SA 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 5:5" />Nivyo vikuleka kubula vino dyelo walavyantambiko wa Dagoni na wantu wose wakwingila kumvikila Dagoni uko Ashidodi wadalika ichifigwe che inyumba yo kumvikila Dagoni. <verse eid="1SA 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 5:6" />Zumbe Chohile kawakantila vitendese na kuwatisa awantu wa Ashidodi. Hata wantu wendile kumpezo kwa Ashidodi wose wakantilwa kwa kwigailwa unyonje wa maihu. <verse eid="1SA 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 5:7" />Wekazi wo mzi wa Ashidodi weze wawone mbuli zikuwabwila, niyo wagamba, “Chohile ywa Izulaeli achikantila vitendese suwe hamwenga na mnungu ywetu Dagoni. Shanduku dye Idilagano dya Zumbe Chohile hadikudaha kwikala kwetu.” <verse eid="1SA 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 5:8" />Ivyo, niyo wasigila walosi wawachisanya vilongozi wose wa Wafilisiti na kuwauza, “Togolani, dino Idishanduku dye Idilagano dya Zumbe Chohile ywa Izulaeli chiditende zeze?” Vilongozi awo niyo wahitula, “Shanduku idyo dya Chohile ywa Izulaeli digaleni komzi wa Gati.” Ivyo, niyo wadigala uko komzi wa Gati. <verse eid="1SA 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 5:9" />Mna weze wadigale uko komzi wa Gati, Zumbe Chohile niyo aukantila umzi, kahosa nkama ikulise mo umzi uwo, wagosi wo umzi uwo kawatowa, wabwanga kwa wadalahala wavambwa ni maihu. <verse eid="1SA 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 5:10" />Ivyo, Shanduku idyo dya Chohile niyo wadigala komzi wa Ekuloni. Mna Idishanduku idyo dize dibule uko, wantu wo mzi uwo niyo waguta wakagamba, “Wachigaila Idishanduku dya Zumbe Chohile ywa Izulaeli chani wachikome suwe na awantu wetu.” <verse eid="1SA 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 5:11" />Niyo wegala ulosi kwa vilongozi wa Wafilisiti wawagamba, “Divuzeni Idishanduku dya Chohile ywa Izulaeli ahantu hakwe chani dinase kuchikoma suwe na awantu wetu. Wadamanya ivyo kwaviya kwendaga na nkama nkulu momzi wose kwaviya Chohile nakawakantila vitendese” <verse eid="1SA 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 5:12" />Awo hewebanike wengilwa ni maihu, niyo wailila imilungu yawo yo ulanga iwambize.<verse eid="1SA 5:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1SA 6" />
  <para style="s">Shanduku dye Idilagano dyavuzwa Izulaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 6:1" />Elo, Idishanduku dye Idilagano dya Zumbe Chohile dyekalaga kweisi ya Wafilisiti kwa myezi mfungate. <verse eid="1SA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 6:2" />Wafilisiti niyo wawetanga walavyantambiko wawo na wasinya milamulo wawo na kuwauza, “Dino Idishanduku dya Zumbe Chohile chiditende zeze? Chigambileni chadigala na chintu chani ahantu hakwe.” <verse eid="1SA 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 6:3" />Awo niyo wahitula, “Mkadivuza Idishanduku dya Zumbe Chohile ywa Izulaeli, msekudivuza mikono bule. Umo mkadivuza kwa vyovyose igalani na malavyo ya kusa mlema, chani muse malema yenyu. Mnadamanya ivyo namhone, naho nammanye kwambwani kawakantilani ulo na ulo.”<verse eid="1SA 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 6:4" />Wafilisiti niyo wauza, “Nachigale malavyo yani ya kusa mlema?” Awo wahitula, “Matukulu mashano ya zahabu yadamanywe saviya maihu, na matukulu mashano ya zahabu yadamanywe saviya ngoso, chila dimwenga dyalagisa mkulu yumwenga ywa Wafilisiti, kwaviya unyonje wigalwe mwenyu ni saudya wigalwe mwa awakulu wenyu. <verse eid="1SA 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 6:5" />Mwaungwa mdamanye matukulu ya maihu na matukulu ya ngoso zenyu, vintu ivyo vikubalanga isi yenyu. Mwaungwa mumtunye Chohile ywa Izulaeli. Vyadahika naleke kuwakantilani nyuwe wenye ne imilungu yenyu neisi yenyu. <verse eid="1SA 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 6:6" />Ni mbwani mkutenda wankani saviya Wamisili na seuta ywa Misili? Togolani, umo Chohile eze awakantile Wamisili hawawalekile Waizulaeli wahalawe, nawo niyo wahalawa? <verse eid="1SA 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 6:7" />Elo, malanyani lingisha hya na mbuguma mbili zikukamwa hezinati kufungwa chintu chikwitangwa nila, zinyinyeni mwe idilingisha idyo, wadama wawo msekwita nawo, waseni mwe didewa. <verse eid="1SA 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 6:8" />Diguheni Idishanduku dya Zumbe Chohile na kudika mwe idilingisha idyo. Mpezo mwe Idishanduku ikani yadya amatukulu ye zahabu ayo mkumwigaila saviya malavyo ya kusa mlema wenyu. Mkaheza dilekeni dite uko nadihinge. <verse eid="1SA 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 6:9" />Mna mkaule, hegu idilingisha idyo dinatungata kuhinga kweisi yakwe, kugamba komzi wa Beti Shemeshi, aho nachimanye kugamba achigaile unyonje uwo ni Chohile ywa Izulaeli. Mna hadina hingile uko, aho nachimanye kugamba suyo uyo achikantile, mna file ino ichigwela du.”<verse eid="1SA 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 6:10" />Niyo wadamanya saviya wagambilwe. Waguha mbuguma mbili zikukamwa na kuzinyinya mwe idilingisha idyo, awadama niyo wawanyinya mwe didewa. <verse eid="1SA 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 6:11" />Idishanduku idyo dya Zumbe Chohile niyo wadikweza mwe idilingisha idyo hamwenga na ntangulu ichisanye amatukulu ye zahabu yakwinga saviya ngoso na maihu. <verse eid="1SA 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 6:12" />Mbuguma izo niyo zatungata kuhinga komzi wa Beti Shemeshi, hazipaguke kumoso hegu kulume, umo zikaita nazikaila. Wadya maseuta washano wa Wafilisiti wazitimila kubula komhaka na Beti Shemeshi.<verse eid="1SA 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 6:13" />Wantu wa Beti Shemeshi nendile wakavuna ngano kwedibwandasi. Weze wakaule kwenkweza niyo wadiwona Idishanduku dye Idilagano dya Zumbe Chohile, vyaleka welelwa vitendese. <verse eid="1SA 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 6:14" />Idilingisha idyo niyo dyahinga kwenkonde ya Yoshuwa, mwikazi ywa Beti Shemeshi. Dize dibule aho niyo dyachima hajihi na luwe lukulu. Wantu niyo wadibogozola diya idilingisha, niyo wazichinja ziya izimbuguma na kumlaviza Zumbe Chohile malavyo ya kutikimya. <verse eid="1SA 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 6:15" />Walawi nendile wadiseleza Idishanduku dya Zumbe Chohile ne intangulu yendile na amatukulu ye zahabu niyo wayaika hadya ho luwe ulukulu. Elo, zuwa idya wantu wa Beti Shemesi walavya malavyo na ntambiko za kutikimya na kumlaviza Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="1SA 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 6:16" />Wakulu wadya washano wa Wafilisiti wawonaga izimbuli izo, vikaheza niyo wauya komzi wa Ekuloni idizuwa idyo. <verse eid="1SA 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 6:17" />Wafilisiti wegala yadya amatukulu ye zahabu mashano yakwinga maihu kwa Zumbe Chohile yakatenda ni malavyo ya kusa mlema wawo, chila tukulu kwachausa cha mzi umwenga. Mizi iyo ni Ashidodi na mzi wa Gaza na mzi wa Ashikeloni na mzi wa Gati na mzi wa Ekuloni. <verse eid="1SA 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 6:18" />Iviya wegala matukulu mashano ya zahabu yakwinga ngoso kuligana na uwazwa we imizi yose ya Wafilisiti ilongozwe ni maseuta washano wa Wafilisiti. Mizi iyo yendaga na ngome na vijiji hevizengelwe viwambaza. Ludya uluwe ulukulu kwenkonde ya Yoshuwa mwikazi yo umzi wa Beti Shemeshi hantu wegalaga Idishanduku dya Zumbe Chohile, diyuko kubula vino dyelo dikatenda ni ukuzi wa mbuli zalailaga.<verse eid="1SA 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 6:19" />Zumbe Chohile akomaga wantu milongo mfungate kwaviya wasungilaga mndani mwe Idishanduku dye Idilagano. Wantu niyo walomboleza kwaviya Zumbe Chohile ahosaga file ikulise mgati mwawo.<verse eid="1SA 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shanduku dye Idilagano uko komzi wa Kiliyati Yealimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 6:20" />Vikaheza, wekazi womzi wa Beti Shemeshi niyo wagamba, “Ni yuhi akudaha kuchimala kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile, yuno Chohile mkuka? Nadigalwe kwa yuhi chani dikulawe mwetu?” <verse eid="1SA 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 6:21" />Ivyo, niyo wasigila walosi waite kwa awekazi wo umzi wa Kiliyati Yealimu wakagambe, “Wafilisiti wadivuza Idishanduku dya Zumbe Chohile selezani mwize mdiguhe.”<verse eid="1SA 6:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1SA 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 7:1" />Elo, wantu wa Kiliyati Yealimu niyo waita wakudiguha Idishanduku dya Zumbe Chohile na kudigala kwenyumba ya Abinadabu, uyo nendile akekala kwa magulu. Niyo wamsenta mwanawe ywa chilume akwitangwa Eliazali chani aditunduliye Idishanduku idyo.<verse eid="1SA 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samwilu alongoza isi ya Izulaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 7:2" />Idishanduku dya Zumbe Chohile dikala komzi wa Kiliyati Yealimu kwa chipindi chitali cha mihilimo milongo midi. Chipindi chose icho Waizulaeli nendile wakamwilila Zumbe Chohile chani awambize. <verse eid="1SA 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 7:3" />Samwilu niyo awagamba wantu wose wa Izulaeli, “Uneva mnamuwiya Zumbe Chohile kwa myoyo yenyu yose, mwaungwa muse milungu ya chijeni mgati mwenyu na matukulu ya Ashitaloti. Hingani kwa Zumbe Chohile kwa myoyo yenyu yose na kumsankani uyo du, uyo mwenye nawakomboleni kulawa mwa amasulumizo ya Wafilisiti.” <verse eid="1SA 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 7:4" />Ivyo, Waizulaeli niyo wayaduila hale amatukulu ya Mabaali na Mashitaloti, wamsankanila Zumbe Chohile uyodu.<verse eid="1SA 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 7:5" />Samwilu niyo agamba, “Waduganyeni Waizulaeli wose uko Misipa, miye naniwalombezezeni kwa Zumbe Chohile.” <verse eid="1SA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 7:6" />Ivyo, wantu wose wa Izulaeli niyo wadugana uko Misipa. Wateka mazi na kuyajida kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile saviya ntambiko, zuwa dyose idyo nendile wafunga, niyo wagamba, “Chikola masa kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile.” Samwilu endaga nuyo mlamuzi ywa Waizulaeli uko Misipa.<verse eid="1SA 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 7:7" />Wafilisiti weze weve kugamba Waizulaeli wadugana uko Misipa, wakulu washano wa Wafilisiti niyo waita wakuwebunga. Waizulaeli weze weve imbuli iyo niyo wafa chevu kwaviya nendile wakawogoha Wafilisiti. <verse eid="1SA 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 7:8" />Elo, Waizulaeli wamgamba Samwilu, “Usekuleka kumlombeza Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywetu, kwachausa chetu. Hikiliza kumwilila chani achambule kulaila mwa Wafilisiti.” <verse eid="1SA 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 7:9" />Ivyo, Samwilu niyo aguha kagoto kakonka amlaviza Zumbe Chohile saviya malavyo ya kutikimya. Samwilu niyo amwilila Zumbe Chohile kwachausa cha Waizulaeli. Zumbe niyo ahitula idilombezo dyakwe. <verse eid="1SA 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 7:10" />Umo Samwilu akalavya diya idilavyo dyo kutikimya, Wafilisiti nendile wasogela chani wawebunge Waizulaeli. Mna mwe idizuwa idyo Zumbe Chohile niyo awalulumila Wafilisiti kwa mlulumo mkulu, Wafilisiti niyo wagilwa vyaleka watimulwaganya ni Waizulaeli. <verse eid="1SA 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 7:11" />Waizulaeli walawa Misipa wawagulusa Wafilisiti kubula hajihi na umzi wa Beti Kali na kuwakoma.<verse eid="1SA 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 7:12" />Vikaheza Samwilu niyo aguha yuwe adichimalisa hagati ha Misipa na Sheni. Yuwe idyo niyo aditanga Ebenezali, kugamba, “Kubula haluse Zumbe Chohile kachambiza.” <verse eid="1SA 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 7:13" />Zuwa idyo Wafilisiti wahudwa, wadunduga kuyebunga isi ya Izulaeli, Zumbe Chohile niyo awachinda chipindi chose Samwilu emjima. <verse eid="1SA 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 7:14" />Mizi yose ya Waizulaeli yatahigwe ni Wafilisiti mgati mwa Ekuloni na Gati ivuzwa kwa Waizulaeli, Waizulaeli niyo waikombola isi yawo kulaila kwa Wafilisiti. Iviya kwatenda na utondowazi mgati mwa Waizulaeli na Waamoli.<verse eid="1SA 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 7:15" />Samwilu kajendeleza kutenda mlamuzi ywa Izulaeli mo ujima wakwe wose. <verse eid="1SA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 7:16" />Chila mhilimo Samwilu katalamkila imizi ya Beteli na Giligali na Misipa na kuwalamuila milosi yawo Waizulaeli milosi mwe imizi iyo yose. <verse eid="1SA 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 7:17" />Akaheza nendile akauya komzi wa Lama kwaviya nendile nuko kwekaya yakwe. Uko kawalamwila Waizulaeli na kumzengela Zumbe Chohile nchanja yo kulaviza ntambiko uko.<verse eid="1SA 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1SA 8" />
  <para style="s">Waizulaeli walombeza wenkigwe seuta Lukum. 17:14-20</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 8:1" />Samwilu eze adalahale, niyo aika wanawe wa chilume watende walamuzi wa Izulaeli. <verse eid="1SA 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 8:2" />Mwanawe ywa nkongo ywa chilume naketangwa Yoeli, ywa kaidi naketangwa Abiya. Wose waidi wendaga walamuzi uko Beli Sheba. <verse eid="1SA 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 8:3" />Mna wana awo hawatimile ulujendo lwa tati yawo. Mna welondela kufumbaswa matundu niyo wahituila viya vikuwagila. <verse eid="1SA 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 8:4" />Ivyo, wakulu wose wa Izulaeli niyo wadugana hamwenga wambasa Samwilu komzi wa Lama, <verse eid="1SA 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 8:5" />wamgamba, “Kaula weye vino haluse kudalahala na wanawo hawakutimila ulujendo lwako. Haluse chisaguile seuta ywa kuchilongoza saviya wakutenda wantu we izisi izintuhu.” <verse eid="1SA 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 8:6" />Mna ulosi uwo wa Waizulaeli wakunga wenkigwe seuta ywa kuwalongoza, haumwelele Samwilu. Naye Samwilu niyo amlombeza Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="1SA 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 8:7" />Zumbe Chohile niyo amgamba, “Tegeleza chila chintu wantu wakukugambila, kwaviya hawakulemele weye, mna wanilemela miye kutenda seuta ywawo. <verse eid="1SA 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 8:8" />Kukongela hadya niwalavizeni mweisi ya Misili, kubula vino dyelo, wanileka miye, wavikila milungu mituhu. Haluse mbuli ziya wanidamanyize miye nizo wakukudamanyiza weye. <verse eid="1SA 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 8:9" />Ivyo, wetegeleze, mna wafundise naho wagambile pwilili izimbuli izo seuta naunge kulawa mwawo umo akawalongoza.”<verse eid="1SA 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 8:10" />Elo, Samwilu niyo awagambila milosi yose ya Zumbe Chohile wadya awantu wendile wakaunga wenkigwe seuta. <verse eid="1SA 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 8:11" />Samwilu awagamba, “Vino nivyo seuta ywenyu nawalongoze nawatendeleni. Wenanyu we chilume nawatende wendeshe amalingisha yakwe, watuhu nawatende wakwela falasi wakwe, watuhu nawalongoile amalingisha yakwe vileke wamdime. <verse eid="1SA 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 8:12" />Wantu watuhu nawasagule watende masekulu wa amabunga yakwe ya wagomba nkondo walozese, watuhu nawasagule watende masekulu wa mabunga ya wantu milongo mishano wa nkondo. Watuhu nawatende walimizi kweizinkonde zakwe na kumvunila ulozo wakwe. Naho watuhu nawatende wamsanile viziha vya kugombela nkondo na watuhu wamsanile vimpandwa vya amalingisha yakwe. <verse eid="1SA 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 8:13" />Wachiche wenyu nawaguhe wamdamanyize mavuta ya kupwepweleka, watuhu nawatende wambisi na awatuhu woke migate. <verse eid="1SA 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 8:14" />Nkonde zenyu za senge ze izinkande na nkonde zenyu ze mizaituni na nkonde ze imizabibu naziguhe na kuwenka awandima wakwe. <verse eid="1SA 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 8:15" />Mafungu ya mlongo ye izimpuluzi zenyu na zabibu zenyu nayaguhe chani awenke masekulu na wandima wakwe. <verse eid="1SA 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 8:16" />Naguhe wandima wenyu wa chilume na wandima wenyu wa chiche na ng'ombe zenyu na mpunda zenyu naziguhe zimdamanyize ndima zakwe. <verse eid="1SA 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 8:17" />Mafungu ya mlongo yo uludimo lwenyu nayaguhe. Nyuwe wenye namtende watumwa wakwe. <verse eid="1SA 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 8:18" />Chipindi icho nyuwe namfuzume kwachausa cha amasulumizo mkwinkwa ni seuta ywenyu mwesaguile wenye. Mna Zumbe Chohile hawahituleni.”<verse eid="1SA 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 8:19" />Mna wantu hawamwetegeleze Samwilu, wagamba, “Bule! Suwe chaunga chitende na seuta akunga achilngoze, <verse eid="1SA 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 8:20" />chani suwe naswi chitende saviya wantu we izisi izintuhu. Seuta ywetu nachilongoze na kuchilamula na kugomba nkondo kwachausa chetu.”<verse eid="1SA 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 8:21" />Samwilu eze eve viya vyose wantu walongile, niyo amgambila Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="1SA 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 8:22" />Zumbe Chohile niyo amgamba Samwilu, “Wetegeleza wasaguile seuta.” Vikaheza Samwilu niyo awagamba Waizulaeli wauye kaya chila mntu aite komzi wakwe.<verse eid="1SA 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1SA 9" />
  <para style="s">Sauli adugana na Samwilu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 9:1" />Kwendaga na mntu yumwenga amanyikise mwe idikabila dya Benjamini akwitangwa Kishi. Uyo endaga mwanawe dya Abieli mwezukulu ywa Zelo chilembwe cha Bekolati, akulaila molukolo lwa Afiya ywe idikabila dya Benjamini.<verse eid="1SA 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 9:2" />Kishi endaga na mwana chilume akwitangwa Sauli. Sauli endaga mbwanga mtana, mweisi ya Izulaeli hakwendaga na mbwanga mtana akwinga Sauli. Sauli endaga mtali kujinka wantu wose mweisi ya Izulaeli.<verse eid="1SA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 9:3" />Zuwa dimwenga izimpunda za Kishi, tati yakwe dya Sauli nendile zaga. Elo, Kishi niyo amgamba Sauli, “Guha mndima yumwenga wite ukalonde izimpunda.” <verse eid="1SA 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 9:4" />Ivyo, niyo waita kweisi ya amagulu ya Efulaimu na mweisi ya Shalisha, mna uko hawaziwone. Niyo wabula Shalimu uko kose hawaziwone. Wazizungula kweisi ya Benjamini, mna hawaziwone. <verse eid="1SA 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 9:5" />Weze wabule kwesi ikwitangwa Sufu Sauli niyo amgamba mndima ywakwe, “Chuye kaya kwaviya tate naleke kufanyanya izimpunda, hantu hakwe natende na nkama mwetu.”<verse eid="1SA 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 9:6" />Yudya mndima niyo amgamba, “Goja hadodo, muno mo mzi mna mntu ywa Chohile akutunyiswa, chila mbuli akulonga yatenda chindedi. Haluse chimbase, mafani adaha kuchigambila ivyo intambo yetu naitende.”<verse eid="1SA 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 9:7" />Sauli amuza uyo mndima ywakwe, “Uneva chinaita chakumwinka mbwani uyo mntu? Nkande mwemikwiji yetu isila. Hachina majeleko yakumwinka uyo mntu ywa Chohile. China chibwani?”<verse eid="1SA 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 9:8" />Yudya mndima niyo amhitula Sauli, “Kaula, hano miye nna kahande ka chumbu. Miye nanimwinke uyo mntu ywa Chohile chani achigambile nikuhi chikudaha kuziwona izimpunda.”<verse eid="1SA 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 9:9" />Aho nkongo mwe isi ya Izulaeli hegu mntu akaunga amlombeze Zumbe Chohile, nakagamba, “Nikuhi nachiziwone izimpunda, Haya chite kwa mlotezi.” Kwaviya mntu akwitangwa muoni mazuwa yano aho nkongo nendile aketangwa mlotezi. <verse eid="1SA 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 9:10" />Sauli niyo amgamba, “Ivyo vibuka mwile, haliko chite.” Ivyo niyo waita komzi nendile akekala uyo mntu ywa Chohile. <verse eid="1SA 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 9:11" />Umo wakakweza ulugulu kuhinga komzi, niyo wadugana na wandele wakwita kuteka mazi. Niyo wawauza awo wandele, “Togolani mlotezi eyuko komzi?” <verse eid="1SA 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 9:12" />Wadya wandele niyo wahitula, “Heye, eyuko. Naho mwihaguhi naye, mnasunguza mwambwila. Kengila muno mo mzi dyelo, kwaviya dyelo wantu nawalavye ntambiko ahantu hokulaviza izintambiko. <verse eid="1SA 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 9:13" />Aho namwingile komzi, namumbwile henati kwita hantu ho kulaviza ntambiko chani akadye nkande. Kwaviya wantu hawadye kubula ajimbika intambiko. Nyumani wadya wagonekwe nawadye. Elo, sunguzani mwite namdugane naye.” <verse eid="1SA 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 9:14" />Ivyo Sauli na mndima ywakwe niyo waita komzi. Umo wakengila komzi, wamwona Samwilu alawa komzi aita uko kokulavi intambiko.<verse eid="1SA 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 9:15" />Gulo dyakwe, Sauli henati kubula aho homzi, Zumbe Chohile nendile kamgamba vino Samwilu, <verse eid="1SA 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 9:16" />“Luvi sazino, nahwigaile mntu kulaila kweisi ye idikabila dya Benjamini, weye mhake mavuta atende chilongozi mwa awantu wangu wa Izulaeli. Uyo nawakombole awantu wangu kulaila kwa Wafilisiti, kwaviya siwona amasulumizo ya awantu wangu naho ndilo yawo ya kunga wambizi inibwila.”<verse eid="1SA 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 9:17" />Samwilu eze amuwone Sauli, Zumbe Chohile amgamba, “Yuno nuyo mntu hugambile izimbuli zakwe. Uyo nuyo nalongoze awantu wangu.” <verse eid="1SA 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 9:18" />Vikaheza Sauli niyo aita kwa Samwilu endile haguhi ne inchili yo mzi, amgamba, “Nakweila nilagisa inyumba yo mlotezi.”<verse eid="1SA 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 9:19" />Samwilu amhitu, “Mlotezi ni miye. Longolani kuhinga ahantu ho kulaviza ntambiko kwaviya dyelo namdye hamwenga na miye. Luvi mtondo nahugamabile imilosi yako yose, vikaheza naniwaleke mwite zenyu. <verse eid="1SA 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 9:20" />Ziya izimpunda zagile mazuzi yajinkile, msekutenda na nkama nazo, ziwoneka kale. Mna ni yuhi Waizulaeli wakumungisa? Togola suyo weye na awantu wose we ikaya ya iso?”<verse eid="1SA 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 9:21" />Sauli ahitula, “Miye ni mntu ywa kabila dya Benjamini, kabila dodo kujinka amakabila yose ya Izulaeli. Naho mwe idikabila dyose dya Benjamini wantu we ikaya yangu nawo awadodo vitendese. Haluse ni mbwani ukulonga milosi saiyo mwangu?” <verse eid="1SA 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 9:22" />Vikaheza Samwilu niyo amwigala Sauli na mndima ywakwe kwechumba chikulu cha ntamulizi, awaika hantu ha ntunyo, hantu wakwikala wajeni wagonekwe. Kwendaga na wajeni milongo mitatu. <verse eid="1SA 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 9:23" />Samwilu niyo amgamba umwambisi, “Nigaila chiya ichihendo che nyama hwinkile hugambile uchike hankanda.” <verse eid="1SA 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 9:24" />Yudya mwambisi niyo aita egala idihazi ne idijumbulu dye inyama avika kulongozi kwa Sauli. Aho Samwilu amgamba Sauli, “Kaula chiya wikiwe, haluse chikigwa kulongozi kwako. Haluse udye kwaviya chikigwa kwachausa chako chani udye hamwenga na wajeni nigoneke.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 9:24">Ivyo, zuwa idyo Sauli niyo adya hamwenga na Samwilu. <verse eid="1SA 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 9:25" />Weze wauye komzi wakalawa hantu ho kulaviza ntambiko, Samwilu niyo atandikilwa hantu hakugona kwedihala dye inyumba agona uko.<verse eid="1SA 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samwilu amhaka mavuta Sauli atende seuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 9:26" />Mtondo chilochilo, Samwilu niyo amwitanga Sauli kulaila kwechilinge, “Inuka chani husindikize uye kaya.” Sauli niyo enuka, wose waidi Sauli na Samwilu walaila kuse na kuhalawa. <verse eid="1SA 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 9:27" />Weze wabule mo mhaka wo womzi, Samwilu amgamba Sauli, “Mgambe uyo mndima ywako achilongwele.” Uyo mndima eze ahalawe, Samwilu amgamba Sauli, “Hake goja hadodo naunga hugambile ivyo Zumbe Chohile alongile.”<verse eid="1SA 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1SA 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 10:1" />Ivyo, Samwilu niyo aguha kasupa kamavuta amjidila Sauli komtwi, amkubatila na kumgamba, “Zumbe Chohile kakuhaka mavuta ya mzaituni chani utende chilongozi mwa awantu wakwe wa Waizulaeli. <verse eid="1SA 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 10:2" />Dyelo chinaheza ukulagana, nodugane na wantu waidi hajihi ne imbila ya Laheli uko Selisa mweisi ya Benjamini. Awo nawakugambile kugamba ziya izimpunda nendile ukazungula ziwoneka kale. Iso kaleka kufanyanya izimpunda, mna ana nkama na weye, chila nkanana euza, ‘Hoi mwanangu miye nantende zeze?’ <verse eid="1SA 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 10:3" />Kulaila aho wite ubule ko mti ukwitagwa mwaloni wi Taboli, hantu aho nodugane na wagosi watatu mwesila waita wakumlaviza ntambiko Chohile uko Beteli. Yumwenga natende asaka wabuzi watatu, ywa kaidi kenula mabofulo matatu, ywa katatu natende kenula bete dya divai.<verse eid="1SA 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 10:4" />Nawakulamse wakaheza nawakwinke mabofulo maidi, yahokele. <verse eid="1SA 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 10:5" />Ukaheza aho hita Gibeya ya Chohile, hantu aho hana lago dya wagomba nkondo Wafilisiti, ukatende haguhi no umzi nodugane na bunga dya waoni. Waoni awo nawatende walaila hantu hokulaviza ntambiko kuno watowa magunda na miluli na filimbi na mazeze, naho nawatende walotela. <verse eid="1SA 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 10:6" />Muye wa Zumbe Chohile naukwebunge, weye naukonge kulotela hamwenga nawo, weye nohitukile na kutenda mntu esimile. <verse eid="1SA 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 10:7" />Umo izimbuli izo zikalaila damanya chintu chochose ukuwona ni chedi, kwaviya Chohile ehamwenga na weye. <verse eid="1SA 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 10:8" />Unilongoile kuhinga komzi wa Giligali, uko nahubwile na kulavya malavyo ya kutikimya na ntambiko za utondowazi. Unigoje aho kwa mazuwa mfungate kubula nize na kukulagisa izimbuli ukungwa udamanye.”<verse eid="1SA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 10:9" />Sauli eze ahituke chani amwase Samwilu, Chohile niyo ahituila umoyo wa Sauli. Mbuli zose agambilwe ni Samwilu zilaila mwe idizuwa idyo. <verse eid="1SA 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 10:10" />Umo Sauli na mndima ywake weze wabule uko Gibeya, wasingilwa ni bunga dya waoni. Chipumpa, Muye wa Chohile niyo wamwebunga, ahadya Sauli akonga kulotela hamwenga na waoni awo. <verse eid="1SA 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 10:11" />Wantu wammanyize Sauli aho nkongo, weze wamwone alotela, niyo wauzana, “Mwanangwa ywa Kishi kapatwa ni mbwani? Hegu Sauli naye ni yumwe mwa waoni?” <verse eid="1SA 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 10:12" />Mntu msiku, mwikazi ywa aho ahantu niyo agamba, “Togola tati yawo ni yuhi?” Ivyo niyo kwatenda na ulongi ukugamba, “Togola Sauli naye ni yumwe ywa waoni?” <verse eid="1SA 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 10:13" />Sauli eze aheze kulotela, niyo aita ahantu hokulaviza ntambiko.<verse eid="1SA 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 10:14" />Ise mdodo dya Sauli eze amwone Sauli na mndima ywakwe, niyo awauza, “Namwikuhi?” Sauli ahitula, “Nachita chakuzungula mpunda mna chize chiwone hachikuziwona, niyo chaita kwa Samwilu.” <verse eid="1SA 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 10:15" />Yudya ise mdodo dya Sauli niyo amgamba, “Hampu, nigambila icho Samwilu akugambile.” <verse eid="1SA 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 10:16" />Sauli niyo amhitula, “Kachigambila pwilili kugamba izimpunda ziwoneka.” Mna Sauli hamgambile kugamba Samwilu kamgamba natende seuta.<verse eid="1SA 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luhugu kugamba Sauli ni seuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 10:17" />Ivyo, Samwilu niyo awetanga wantu wose wadugane kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile uko Misipa. <verse eid="1SA 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 10:18" />Weze wabule, niyo awagamba, “Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywa Izulaeli agamba vino, ‘Siwalavya Waizulaeli kweisi ya Misili, siwambulani kulaila kwa Wamisili na iziseuta ntuhu ziwazileni.’ <verse eid="1SA 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 10:19" />Mna dyelo dino mnilemela miye Chohile ywenyu huwambulani mwe file na makunto yenyu, mna nyuwe mwagamba, ‘Bule! Chisaguile seuta achilongoze. Haluselo wose kwechisanyeni kulongozi kwangu mkatenda mwa amakabila yenyu na nkolo zenyu.’ ” <verse eid="1SA 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 10:20" />Vikaheza, Samwilu niyo ayegala amakabila ya Izulaeli yamsogeile, kabila dya Benjamini niyo dyasagulwa kwa tegatega. <verse eid="1SA 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 10:21" />Samwilu niyo adika kulongozi idikabila dya Benjamini kuligana ne izinkolo zawo, na lukolo lwa Matili niyo lwasagulwa. Vikaheza niyo awegala wana chilume wa Matili, Sauli mwana ywa Kishi niyo asagulwa kwa tegatega. Mna weze wamlonde hawamwone. <verse eid="1SA 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 10:22" />Ivyo, niyo wamuza Zumbe Chohile, “Togoloni, mntu uyo keza kale hano?” Zumbe Chohile niyo awahitula, “Heye, keza kale hano, mna kefisa hamabundu.”<verse eid="1SA 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 10:23" />Ivyo, niyo waguluka, wakumlonda Sauli na kumwigala kwa awantu. Sauli eze achimale mgati mwa awantu endaga mtali kujinka wantu wose. <verse eid="1SA 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 10:24" />Samwilu niyo awagamba wantu wose, “Yuno nuyo mntu asagulwe ni Zumbe Chohile mgati mwa awantu wose, hahana yoyose akuligana na yuno.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 10:24">Wantu wose niyo watula chizumo, “Seuta ekale mazuwa yose.”<verse eid="1SA 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 10:25" />Vikaheza, Samwilu niyo awagambila wantu uwagilwa we izindima za seuta akungwa adamanye, kaziwandika izindima izo niyo azika kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile. Samwilu niyo awalaga wantu wose chila mntu aite kwekaya yakwe. <verse eid="1SA 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 10:26" />Iviya Sauli naye niyo aita kwekaya yakwe uko Gibeya, hamwenga na wagomba nkondo wakankalu wadya Chohile alongile nawo mwe imyoyo yawo. <verse eid="1SA 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 10:27" />Mna wantu watuhu hewekwiva dya mntu, niyo wagamba, “Vino yuno mntu adaha kuchikombola?” Wambela Sauli naho hawamwinkile majeleko. Mna Sauli kenyamaila du.<verse eid="1SA 10:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1SA 11" />
  <para style="s">Sauli awahuda Waamoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 11:1" />Seuta Nahashi ywa Waamoni niyo aita autandama umzi wa Yabeshi Giliyadi. Wekazi wa Yabeshi Giliyadi niyo wamgamba Nahashi, “Damanya wivano na suwe, suwe nachikusankanile.” <verse eid="1SA 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 11:2" />Mna Nahashi niyo awagamba, “Nanidamanye wivano na nyuwe kwa mwiko umwenga du, kugamba chila yumwenga ywenyu nimng'ole idiziso dyakwe dya kulume vileke niwajele soni Waizulaeli mwa awantu we izisi izintuhu.” <verse eid="1SA 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 11:3" />Wadalahala womzi wa Yabeshi niyo wamgamba, “Chinke mazuwa mfungate chani chigale walosi mweisi yose ya Izulaeli. Hegu hamna mntu ywa kuchikombola suwe wenye nachuye nyuma kwako.”<verse eid="1SA 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 11:4" />Wadya walosi weze wabule komzi wa Gibeya uko Sauli nakekala, walonga ulosi uwo wantu wose niyo wakonga kuguta waila. <verse eid="1SA 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 11:5" />Sauli nendile akalaila kwenkonde akatenda ne izinjeku zakwe, awauza, “Wano wantu wana mbwani? Nimbwani waila?” Niyo wamgambila ulosi wigalwe ni wadya walosi walaile Yabeshi. <verse eid="1SA 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 11:6" />Sauli eze eve ulosi uwo, Muye wa Chohile niyo wamwebunga, engilwa ni maya yatendese. <verse eid="1SA 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 11:7" />Niyo aguha majeku maidi ayakanta kanta vihande hande, asigila walosi wavijise chila hantu mweisi ya Izulaeli wakagamba, “Mntu yoyose hana mtimile Sauli na Samwilu kwita kwenkondo, njeku zakwe nazidamanywe seivyo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 11:7">Wantu wa Izulaeli niyo wengilwa ni nkama kwachausa cha Zumbe Chohile kugamba adaha kudamanya seivyo. Elo, wose niyo wafosa chahamwenga. <verse eid="1SA 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 11:8" />Sauli eze awaduganye Waizulaeli uko Bezeki weze wawazwe wendaga na wantu elufu magana matatu kulaila Izulaeli na wantu elufu milongo mitatu kulaila Yuda. <verse eid="1SA 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 11:9" />Niyo wawagamba wadya walosi walaile Yabeshi, “Wagambileni wekazi wa Yabeshi Giliyadi, ‘Luvi umo zuwa dikalika, namtende mwambulwa kale.’” Wantu wa Yabeshi weze wagambilwe ulosi uwo niyo welelwe vitendese. <verse eid="1SA 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 11:10" />Ivyo niyo wamtila Nahashi, wamgamba, “Luvi nachuye nyuma kwako, weye nochidamanye ivyo ukuwona ni vyedi.”<verse eid="1SA 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 11:11" />Ichilo icho, Sauli niyo awasanga wantu mwe mabunga matatu. Chilochilo Waizulaeli wengila kwedilago dya wankondo wawo Waamoni na kuwebunga. Kubula nomsi wankondo walozize nendile wakomwa. Wadya wapalapuzwe nawakazagala du, chila yumwenga kaguluka ichedu.<verse eid="1SA 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 11:12" />Waizulaeli niyo wamgamba Samwilu, “Wadya wantu wagambile Sauli asekutenda seuta ywetu wekuhi? Chigaile awantu awo, chani chiwakome.”<verse eid="1SA 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 11:13" />Mna Sauli niyo awagamba, “Dyelo hahana mntu yoyose akunga akomwe, kwaviya mwe idizuwa dino, Zumbe Chohile awambulaga Waizulaeli.”<verse eid="1SA 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 11:14" />Samwilu niyo awagamba, “Wose chiteni Giligali, chikaike wivano uhya kugamba Sauli najendeleze kutenda seuta ywetu.” <verse eid="1SA 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 11:15" />Wantu wose niyo waita Giligali, weze wabule uko wamtenda Sauli seuta kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile. Uko wamlaviza ntambiko za utondowazi Zumbe Chohile. Sauli na wantu wose wa Izulaeli niyo welelwa vitendese.<verse eid="1SA 11:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1SA 12" />
  <para style="s">Samwilu awalaga wantu wa Izulaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 12:1" />Samwilu niyo awagamba Waizulaeli wose, “Yose mnigambile siyeva. Siwasaguilani seuta ywenyu. <verse eid="1SA 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 12:2" />Haluse mna seuta ywa kuwalongozani. Miye sidalahala simema fi, wanangu wa chilume mwihamwenga nawo. Sitenda chilongozi kukongela mo ubwanga wangu kubula haluse. <verse eid="1SA 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 12:3" />Miye nihano, hegu sidamanya mbuli yoyose ihiye, elo, tambalisani kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile na kulongozi kwa seuta ywakwe amsagule. Togolani sipempula njeku hegu mpunda ya mntu yoyose? Togolani simbunyanya mntu yoyose? Togolani simzila mntu yoyose? Togolani sifumbaswa ni mntu yoyose chani nisekukantila vikuwagila? Longani miye nanimvuzize.” <verse eid="1SA 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 12:4" />Wantu niyo wamhitula, “Bule, huchidantile naho huchibunyanye hegu kuguha chintu kwa mntu.” <verse eid="1SA 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 12:5" />Samwilu niyo ahitula, “Zumbe Chohile ni muukuzi mwetu na seuta ywakwe asagule dyelo ni muukuzi kugamba mniwona sina mlema.” Wowo niyo wahitula, “Uyo ni mukuzi.” <verse eid="1SA 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 12:6" />Samwilu niyo awagamba, “Zumbe Chohile nuyo amsagule Musa na Haluni na kuwalavya wababa zenyu kweisi ya Misili. <verse eid="1SA 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 12:7" />Haluse chimalani aho miye naniwalagise kwa ukuzi hawakumbusani mbuli nkulu za Zumbe Chohile adamanye kwenyu na kwa wakale wenyu.<verse eid="1SA 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 12:8" />Yakobo na wantu we ikaya yakwe waitaga Misili, Wamisili weze wawabunyanye, wababa zenyu wamwililaga Zumbe Chohile, uyo niyo awasigila Musa na Haluni awo niyo wawalavya wababa zenyu mweisi ya Misili na kuwatendani mwikale mwe isi ino. <verse eid="1SA 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 12:9" />Mna, wowo wamjalaga Zumbe Chohile, Choile ywawo, uyo nuyo awenkiza mwe mikono ya Sisela, sekulu ywa wagomba nkondo wa Hazoli na mwemikono ya Wafilisiti na mwemikono ya seuta ywa Moabu. Wantu we izisi izo wagomba nkondo na wababa zenyu, wababa zenyu niyo wahudwa. <verse eid="1SA 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 12:10" />Wababa zenyu niyo wamwilila Zumbe Chohile, wamgamba, ‘Chikola masa kwaviya chikuleka weye Zumbe Chohile na kusankanila milungu ya Mabaali na Maashitaloti. Haluse chambule kulaila mwa awankondo wetu, suwe naswi nachikusankanile.’ <verse eid="1SA 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 12:11" />Vikaheza, Zumbe Chohile niyo amwigala Yelubaali, akaheza amwigala Balaki. Akaheza amwigala Yefuta, na uhelo kanigala miye Samwilu. Chila yumwenga ywetu kawambulani kulaila kwa awankondo wenyu wawazungulukeni, nyuwe mwikala kwa utondowazi. <verse eid="1SA 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 12:12" />Mna, mwize mumwone seuta Nahashi ywa Waamoni keza kuwebungani, niyo mwamlemela Zumbe Chohile, uyo seuta ywenyu, mwanigamba, Bule! Chaunga chilongozwe ni seuta.<verse eid="1SA 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 12:13" />Haluse seuta mwesaguile ni yuno hano. Mumlombeza Zumbe Chohile awenkeni seuta, naye kawenkani. <verse eid="1SA 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 12:14" />Hegu mnamtunya Zumbe Chohile na kumsankanila na kwetegeleza mbuli akulonga, hehena kuleka malagizo yakwe, hegu nyuwe wenye na seuta akuwalongozani mnamzungula Zumbe Chohile, Chohie ywenyu, namchumilwe. <verse eid="1SA 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 12:15" />Mna hamnamtegeleze Zumbe Chohile, mnaleka kwitikila amalagizo yakwe, uyo nawasulumizeni hamwenga na seuta ywenyu. <verse eid="1SA 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 12:16" />Haluselo, nyamalani mkaule mbuli nkulu idya Zumbe Chohile nadamanye kulongozi kwenyu. <verse eid="1SA 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 12:17" />Togolani, haluse sicho chipindi cho uvuni we ngano, naho ni chizuwa? Mna miye nanimlombeze Zumbe Chohile egale mbaula na fula chani mbunkule na kuwona kugamba wihi wenyu mdamanye kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile kwa kweungila seuta ni mkulu.”<verse eid="1SA 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 12:18" />Ivyo, Samwilu niyo amlombeza Zumbe Chohile, niyo egala mbaula na fula mwe idizuwa idyo. Wantu wose niyo wamogohesa Zumbe Chohile na Samwilu. <verse eid="1SA 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 12:19" />Wantu wose niyo wamgamba Samwilu, “Hampu chilombezeze suwe wandima wako kwa Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywako, chinase kukomwa, kwaviya chidamanya masa kwa kweungila wenye seuta.”<verse eid="1SA 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 12:20" />Samwilu niyo awahitula, “Msekogoha hata hegu mdamanya wihi uwo wose, msekuleka kumtimila Zumbe Chohile, mna msankanileni kwa myoyo yenyu yose. <verse eid="1SA 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 12:21" />Msekutimila milungu yo udanti heikuwambizani chochose naho haikudaha kuwambulani, kwaviya milungu iyo haina chintu. <verse eid="1SA 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 12:22" />Kwa ntunyo ya zina dyakwe kulu, Zumbe Chohile hawadule wantu wakwe kwaviya kawaungani nyuwe mtende wantu wakwe. <verse eid="1SA 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 12:23" />Naho, kwangu miye havize vilaile nileke kuwalombezezani kwa Zumbe Chohile, ninadamanya ivyo nanikole masa kwa Zumbe Chohile. Nanijendeleze kuwahinyani sila yedi na ikuwagila. <verse eid="1SA 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 12:24" />Haluse, nyuwe mtunyeni Zumbe Chohile na kumsankanila kwa ukanuni na kwa myoyo yenyu yose. Kumbukani mbuli nkulu ziya awadamanyizeni. <verse eid="1SA 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 12:25" />Mna, mnajendeleza kudamanya yehiye, namkomwe pele hamwenga na seuta ywenyu.”<verse eid="1SA 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1SA 13" />
  <para style="s">Sauli awatowa Wafilisiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 13:1" />Sauli endaga na mihilimo milongo mitatu umo endaga seuta, ailongozaga Izulaeli kwa mihilimo milongo mine na midi. <verse eid="1SA 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 13:2" />Sauli asagulaga Waizulaeli elufu ntatu, mgati mwawo, wantu elufu mbili asigalaga nawo uko Mikimashi mweisi ya amagulu ya Beteli, na elufu imwenga wendaga na mwanawe Yonasani uko Gibeya, mwe isi ya Benjamini. Awantu wasigale kawagamba wauye kaya. <verse eid="1SA 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 13:3" />Yonasani niyo atowa idilago dya wankondo wa Wafilisiti uko Gibeya, Wafilisiti wose niyo weva imbuli iyo. Sauli niyo avila gunda mwe isi yose akagamba, “Waebulaniya weve.” <verse eid="1SA 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 13:4" />Waizulaeli wose weze weve kugamba Sauli katowa idilago dya wagomba nkondo wa Wafilisiti na kugamba Wafilisiti wawehiwa vitendese Waizulaeli, ivyo niyo wetangwa wakalungane na Sauli uko Giligali.<verse eid="1SA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 13:5" />Wafilisiti niyo wechisanya hamwenga wagombe nkondo na Waizulaeli. Wendaga na malingisha ya nkondo elufu milongo mitatu na wagomba nkondo elufu mtandatu wakukwela falasi na wagomba nkondo walozize hewekuwazika wakwinga msanga wa mpwani. Awo wose wakwelaga na kwika lago dyawo uko Mikimashi, ntendele ya ulailo wazuwa wa Besi Aveni. <verse eid="1SA 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 13:6" />Waizulaeli weze wawone wemwenkunto, kwaviya nawebungiswa, niyo wakonga kwefisa. Wamwenga niyo wefisa mwe mpanga na hasi mwe mabome hegu mgatigati mwe mayuwe hegu mwe malundu na mwe masima heyena mazi, <verse eid="1SA 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 13:7" />watuhu wadeluka umto wa Yolodani vyaleka wabula mweisi ya Gadi na mweisi ya Giliyadi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 13:7">Mna Sauli nendile achei eyuko uko Giligali na wantu wose wamtimile nawakazingiza. <verse eid="1SA 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 13:8" />Sauli niyo amgoja Samwilu kwa mazuwa mfungate, saviya Samwilu alongile. Mna Samwilu haitile uko Giligali na wantu niyo wakonga kumsumka Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 13:9" />Vikaheza Sauli niyo awagaxmba wantu, “Nigailani amalavyo yenyu yo kutikimya na yo wivano.” Naye niyo alavya amalavyo yo kutikimya. <verse eid="1SA 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 13:10" />Eze abinde ukulavya amalavyo ayo, Samwilu niyo abula. Sauli niyo amsingila na kumlamsa. <verse eid="1SA 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 13:11" />Mna Samwilu niyo amuza, “Kutenda mbwani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 13:11">Sauli amhitula, “Eze niwone kugamba wantu wanisumka, wenawe hukwiza mwa amazuwa yadya mfungate ulongile, nize niwone Wafilisiti wemalanya kwa nkondo uko Mikimashi, <verse eid="1SA 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 13:12" />niyo nafanyanya Wafilisiti weza kunebunga uko Giligali. Naho nendile sinati kulombeza mbazi kwa Zumbe Chohile. Ivyo niyo nalavya lavyo dya kutikimya.”<verse eid="1SA 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 13:13" />Samwilu niyo amhitula Sauli, “Kudamanya uhezi. Kulemela kumwiva Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywako. Hegu wamwivile nakakuleka weye na wezukuluwo nakawatenda muilongoze Izulaeli kalenakale. <verse eid="1SA 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 13:14" />Mna haluse useuta wako haujendeleze, kwaviya humwivile, Zumbe Chohile. Zumbe Chohile nesagwile mtu mtuhu akuuwagila umoyo wakwe, uyo nuyo asagule atende chilongozi ywa awantu wakwe.”<verse eid="1SA 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 13:15" />Samwilu niyo akulawa Giligali na kwita Gibeya mwe isi ya Benjamini. Sauli niyo awawaza wantu wendaga hamwenga naye, wendaga wantu magana mtandatu awodu. <verse eid="1SA 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 13:16" />Sauli na mwanawe Yonasani, hamwenga na wantu endaga nawo, wekalaga uko Gibeya mweisi ya Benjamini, na Wafilisiti waikaga lago Mikimashi. <verse eid="1SA 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 13:17" />Wafilisiti wafosaga kwedilago dyawo waita wakuwebunga wakatenda mwe mabunga matatu. Bunga idimwenga dihinga komzi wa Ofula mwe isi ya Shuali. <verse eid="1SA 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 13:18" />Bunga tuhu dihinga Beti Holoni, na bunga idituhu dihinga komhaka ukusinya kwedibwandasi dya Seboimu ikusinyana ne idijangwa.<verse eid="1SA 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 13:19" />Mazuwa ayo hakwendaga na mta kusana vyuma mweisi ya Izulaeli, kwaviya Wafilisiti nawakawachinda Waebulaniya wanase kwedamanyiza sime hegu maguha. <verse eid="1SA 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 13:20" />Chila Mwizulaeli nakaita kwa Wafilisiti chani akanoilwe majembe na sululu na hoya na nyengo. <verse eid="1SA 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 13:21" />Waizulaeli nendile wakaliha yombe kulu dya vihande vidi vya chumbu kwa kunoilwa jembe na sululu naho nawakaliha chihande chimwenga kulihila kunoilwa hoya na nyengo. <verse eid="1SA 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 13:22" />Ivyo, zuwa dye nkondo hahana mntu mgati mwawo wendaga na Sauli na Yonasani endaga na sime hegu guha ukaleka Sauli na mwanawe Yonasani. <verse eid="1SA 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 13:23" />Wafilisiti wegala bunga dya wagomba nkondo wakamile imikumbi ya Mikimashi.<verse eid="1SA 13:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1SA 14" />
  <para style="s">Ukankalu wa Yonasani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 14:1" />Zuwa dimwenga, Yonasani mwanawe dya seuta Sauli amgambaga mbwanga akumwinuila iviziha vyakwe, “Soo chideluke chite ntendele ya kaidi kwedilago dya Wafilisiti.” Mna Yonasani hamgambile ise Sauli, <verse eid="1SA 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 14:2" />uyo endile kaika lago hemti wa mkoma manga uko Migiloni, kuse komzi wa Gibeya akatenda hamwenga na wantu magana mtandatu. <verse eid="1SA 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 14:3" />Mgati mwa awantu awo endaga Ahiya nuyo nakavala kasuche kakugubika mwechifuwa kamlavyantambiko, uyo endaga mwanawe Ahitubu mlukolo ywa Ikabodi, wendaga wanawe dya Finehasi, uyo Ahiya endaga mwezukulu ywa Eli mlavyantambiko ywa Zumbe Chohile komzi wa Shilo. Wantu nendile hawamanyize kugamba Yonasani kahalawa.<verse eid="1SA 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 14:4" />Mwe chomboko aungigwe ajinkile Yonasani chani abule kwedilago dya Wafilisiti, kwendaga na mayuwe maidi yasongoke kuno na kuno. Luwe lumwenga naluketangwa Bosesi na ulutuhu naluketangwa Sene. <verse eid="1SA 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 14:5" />Luwe lumwenga lwendaga ntendele ya chenya yo mzi wa Mikimashi na ulutuhu na lukasinyana na ntendele ya kwamwenyemzi yo umzi wa Gibeya.<verse eid="1SA 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 14:6" />Yonasani niyo amgamba yudya mbwanga akumwinuila iviziha, “Soo chideluke chite ntendele ya kaidi kweidilago dya wano wantu hewejeligwe ngasu. Mafani Zumbe Chohile nachambize, kwaviya Zumbe Chohile hakumbula kuligana na kuloza kwa wantu hegu ujeche wa wantu.”<verse eid="1SA 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 14:7" />Yudya mbwanga niyo amgamba, “Damanya dyodyose ukunga, miye nihamwenga na weye, icho ukufanyanya nicho hufanyanya.”<verse eid="1SA 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 14:8" />Yonasani amgamba, “Nachideluke chiwabase wadya Awafilisiti chani wachiwone. <verse eid="1SA 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 14:9" />Uneva wanachigamba chiwagoje kubula weze hano chili, ivyo, nachichimale ahano chili hachiwabase. <verse eid="1SA 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 14:10" />Mna wachigamba chiwabase kudya weli, aho nachiwabase, kwaviya icho nachitende chilagiso kugamba Zumbe Chohile kachinka uhuda mwawo.”<verse eid="1SA 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 14:11" />Ivo, Yonasani na yudya mbwanga niyo walaila chani Wafilisiti wawawone. Weze wawawone wagamba, “Kaulani wadya Waebulaniya, walawa mwa malundu wefisize.” <verse eid="1SA 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 14:12" />Wafilisiti wendile kwedilago niyo wamwitanga Yonasani na yudya mbwanga akwinula iviziha, “Kwelani kuno kwetu, chani mluwone.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:12">Yonasani amgamba yudya mbwanga, “Nitimila, Zumbe Chohile nachambize chiwahude Wafilisiti.” <verse eid="1SA 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 14:13" />Ivyo, Yonasani niyo apalagata yudya mbwanga naye amtimila mnyuma. Yonasani niyo awebunga Wafilisiti akawagwisa hasi kuno yudya mbwanga atimila mnyuma akawakoma. <verse eid="1SA 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 14:14" />Mo kuwebunga uko kwe nkongo, Yonasani hamwenga na yudya mbwanga akumwinuila iviziha wakoma wantu wakubula milongo midi hantu hakwinga nusu ya eka. <verse eid="1SA 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 14:15" />Mmweisi yose ya Wafilisiti niyo waungumilwa, wagomba nkondo kwedilago, wantu kwezinkonde, kwengome, hata wadya wakuwebunga wazingiza, isi yose izingiza na wantu niyo waungumilwa.<verse eid="1SA 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhudwa kwa Wafilisiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 14:16" />Wapelembi wa Sauli uko Gibeya kweisi ya Benjamini wawona wantu walozize waguluka uko na uko. <verse eid="1SA 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 14:17" />Sauli niyo awagamba wantu wendile hamwenga nawo, “Hebu kwewazeni chani chimanye ni yuhi hehali.” Weze wewaze, wabunkula kugamba Yonasani na mbwanga akumwinuila iviziha hawahali. <verse eid="1SA 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 14:18" />Sauli niyo amgamba mlavyantambiko Ahiya, “Nigailani hano Idishanduku dya Chohile.” Mazuwa ayo Shanduku dye Idilagano dya Zumbe Chohile nendile dihamwenga na Waizulaeli. <verse eid="1SA 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 14:19" />Umo Sauli nendile achei akalonga na mlavyantambiko, kwedilago dya Wafilisiti ngavungavu nendile zikahimbisa. Sauli niyo amgamba mlavyantambiko Ahiya, “Leka usekunigaila Idishanduku dye Idilagano.” <verse eid="1SA 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 14:20" />Ivyo, Sauli na wantu wakwe wemalanya wagombe nkondo na Wafilisiti. Mna Wafilisiti niyo wakonga kwebungana wenye kwa wenye kwaviya waungumilwa. <verse eid="1SA 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 14:21" />Waebulaniya wadya wendile ntendele ya Wafilisiti kukongela chikale na wadya waitile nawo uko kwedilago, niyo wahituka wahangana na Waizulaeli wendile hamwenga na Sauli na Yonasani. <verse eid="1SA 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 14:22" />Iviya Waizulaeli watuhu wendile wefisa kweisi ya magulu ya Efulaimu, weze weve kugamba Wafilisiti wasumka, iviya nawo wawagulusa na kuwakoma. <verse eid="1SA 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 14:23" />Ivyo, Zumbe Chohile niyo awenka uhuda Waizulaeli. Nkondo yenela kujinka Beti Aveni.<verse eid="1SA 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulailo nkondo ize iheze</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 14:24" />Zuwa idyo, Waizulaeli nendile wasokelesa kwa kulumiswa ni sala, kwaviya Sauli nendile akawenka wantu cheliso akagamba, “Mntu yoyose na adye nkande zuwa hedinati kuhunga na sinati kulihiza chikoda kwa wankondo wangu mntu uyo aligitwe.” Ivyo zuwa dyose idyo hahana mntu adile nkande yoyose. <verse eid="1SA 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 14:25" />Wantu wose weze wabule hembago, wabwila uchi watweka chila hantu. <verse eid="1SA 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 14:26" />Wantu weze wabule kumbago na kubwila uchi watweka chila hantu, hahana mntu ajezize kudya uwo uchi kwaviya wogoha icheliso walisizwe.<verse eid="1SA 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 14:27" />Mna Yonasani nendile hevile icheliso ise awalisize wantu. Ivyo niyo achulusa inkome endile ananayo, atopola mwe chivuna cho uchi na kudya uchi uwo. Aho niyo engila nguvu.<verse eid="1SA 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 14:28" />Mna mntu yumwenga niyo amgamba, “Iso kawenka wantu cheliso, akagamba, ‘Mntu yoyose na adye nkande dyelo aligitwe!’” Nivyo vikuleka wantu wose wasokezwa ni sala.<verse eid="1SA 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 14:29" />Yonasani niyo agamba, “Tate awatumbwadisa wantu. Haluse miye sitenda na nguvu kwaviya sidya wazuchi. <verse eid="1SA 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 14:30" />Uneva du wagomba nkondo wetu wadahile kudya hadodo mwe vintu watahile kulaila kwa wankondo wawo, nachingila nguvu na kukoma Wafilisiti walozese.”<verse eid="1SA 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 14:31" />Zuwa idyo, Waizulaeli wawatowa Wafilisiti, kukongela Mikimashi kubula Aiyaloni. Chipindi icho Waizulaeli nendile wasokelesa. <verse eid="1SA 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 14:32" />Ivyo, niyo wagulukila kwe ivintu watahile kwa Wafilisiti, waguha wagoto na njeku na wadama wachinja na kudya inyama ne sakame. <verse eid="1SA 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 14:33" />Wantu watuhu niyo wamgamba Sauli, “Kaula wantu wakola masa kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile wadya nyama ina sakame.” Sauli niyo awagamba wantu, “Awo wabalanga umwiko. Fingilisani yuwe kulu dize hano hangu.” <verse eid="1SA 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 14:34" />Niyo awagamba, “Hitani kawagambileni wantu wanigaile hano ng'ombe hegu ngoto wazichinje na kuzidila ahano. Wasekumkola masa Zumbe Chohile kwa kudya nyama zina sakame.” Ivyo ichilo icho wantu wose niyo wegala ng'ombe hegu ngoto zawo wazichinjiza aho. <verse eid="1SA 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 14:35" />Ivyo, Sauli niyo amzengela Zumbe Chohile hantu hakulaviza ntambiko. Aho naho henkongo hokuvikila Sauli amzengele Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="1SA 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 14:36" />Sauli niyo awagamba wantu, “Dyelo nechilo chiteni chiwabase Wafilisiti, chikawebunge na kutaha ugoli wawo kubula mtondo, hachisigaze mtu yoyose akatenda mjima.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:36">Wantu wose niyo wamgamba, “Damanya chiya ukuwona chakuwagila.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:36">Mna mlavyantambiko niyo awagamba, “Chikonge kuza ulangilizi kwa Zumbe Chohile.”<verse eid="1SA 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 14:37" />Ivyo, Sauli niyo amuza Zumbe Chohile, “Togola, chite chikawebunge Wafilisiti? Togola nowenke uhuda Waizulaeli?” Mna zuwa idyo Chohile hahitule chintu chochose. <verse eid="1SA 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 14:38" />Ivyo, Sauli niyo awagamba, “Nyuwe vilongozi soni hano chikaule chikola masa yani dyelo. <verse eid="1SA 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 14:39" />Nelisa kwa Zumbe Chohile mta ujima uyo akuyambula Izulaeli, hata hegu ni mwanangu Yonasani, akomwe.” Mna hahana mtu alongile chintu chochose. <verse eid="1SA 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 14:40" />Ivyo, Sauli niyo awagamba, “Nyuwe nyose chimalani ntendele idya, vikaheza miye na mwanangu Yonasani nachichimale intendele ino.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:40">Wowo niyo wamgamba, “Damanya dyodyose ukuwona dyawagila.”<verse eid="1SA 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 14:41" />Sauli niyo agamba, “Weye Zumbe Chohile ywa Izulaeli, ni mbwani hunihitule miye mndima ywako? Weye Zumbe Chohile ywa Izulaeli, uneva mlema wi mwangu hegu kwa mwanangu Yonasani, chilamwile kwa yuwe dya Ulimu dikuziza uwagilwa wako. Mna hegu mlema uwo wi kwa wantu wako wa Izulaeli, chilamule kwa idiyuwe dya Sumimu.” Ivyo, Yonasani na Sauli wawoneka kugamba wana mlema, mna wantu nendile hawana mlema. <verse eid="1SA 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 14:42" />Sauli niyo agamba, “Towani tegatega mwangu na Yonasani.” Tegatega niyo dyamgwela kugamba ana mlema. <verse eid="1SA 14:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 14:43" />Aho, Sauli niyo amgamba Yonasani, “Nigambila icho udamanye.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:43">Yonasani niyo amhitula, “Nasidya wazuchi kwa nkome yangu. Miye hano hata hakomwa havina mbuli.”<verse eid="1SA 14:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 14:44" />Sauli niyo agamba, “Chohile anisulumize ivyo naunge, Yonasani nokomwe.”<verse eid="1SA 14:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1SA 14:45" />Mna wantu niyo wamgamba Sauli, “Ni mbwani Yonasani egale uhuda mkulu mwa Izulaeli akomwe? Mbuli iyo isekumgwela. Chelisa kwa Zumbe Chohile mta ujima, hata luvili mo mtwi wakwe halugwe hasi. Chino adamanye dyelo, kachidamanya kwa wambizi wa Zumbe Chohile.” Ivyo, wantu wamhonya Yonasani vyaleka hakomigwe.<verse eid="1SA 14:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1SA 14:46" />Vikaheza, Sauli niyo aleka kuwatimila Wafilisiti, awo Wafilisiti niyo wauya kwezikaya zawo.<verse eid="1SA 14:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulongozi wa Sauli na wantu we ikaya yakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="1SA 14:47" />Sauli eze atende seuta ywa Waizulaeli niyo agomba nkondo na wankondo wakwe chila ntendele, Wamoabu na Waamoni na Waedomu na maseuta wa Soba na Wafilisiti. Chila nkanana agombile nkondo nendile akahuda. <verse eid="1SA 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1SA 14:48" />Kagomba nkondo kwa ukankalu, niyo awahuda Waamaleki. Kawakombola Waizulaeli kulaila kwa wantu wose nendile wakawebunga.<verse eid="1SA 14:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1SA 14:49" />Wana wa chilume wa Sauli wendaga ni Yonasani na Ishivi na Maliki Shuwa. Wanawe wa chiche wendaga ni waidi. Ywankongo naketangwa Melabu na mvunawe naketangwa Mikali. <verse eid="1SA 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1SA 14:50" />Mkaziwe dya Sauli naketangwa Ahinoamu mchiche ywa Ahimaasi. Mkulu ywa wagomba nkondo wa Sauli naketangwa Abuneli, mwanawe dya Neli, endaga ise mdodo dya Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1SA 14:51" />Ise dya Sauli nendile aketangwa Kishi, na Ise dya Abuneli nendile aketangwa Neli, mwanawe dya Abieli.<verse eid="1SA 14:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1SA 14:52" />Chipindi chose Sauli endaga seuta nendile kukagombwa nkondo ikulise ya Waizulaeli na Wafilisiti. Sauli akawona mkankalu hegu mta nguvu nendile akamguha na kumwingiza mwe idibunga dyakwe dya wagomba nkondo.<verse eid="1SA 14:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1SA 15" />
  <para style="s">Nkondo na Waamaleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 15:1" />Samwilu amgamba Sauli, “Zumbe Chohile anisigilaga huhake mavuta utende seuta ywa wantu wakwe wa Izulaeli. Haluse kwetegeleza viya Zumbe Chohile akulonga. <verse eid="1SA 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 15:2" />Zumbe Chohile Mta udahi agamba vino, ‘Naniwakantile Waamaleki kwaviya wawatowaga Waizulaeli umo wakalaila kweisi ya Misili. <verse eid="1SA 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 15:3" />Haluse hita ukawebunge na kubalanga vintu vyose wananavyo. Usekuwafila mbazi, mna wakome wose. Wagosi kwa wavyele, wana wadodo na watiti, ng'ombe na ngoto na ngamiya na mpunda.’”<verse eid="1SA 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 15:4" />Sauli niyo awetanga wagomba nkondo wakwe, kawawaza uko komzi wa Telaimu. Kwendaga na wagomba nkondo laki mbili wakujenda lwa viga kulaila Izulaeli na elufu mlongo kulaila Yuda. <verse eid="1SA 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 15:5" />Akaheze, Sauli na wantu wakwe waita komzi wa Waamaleki wakanyatila kwe dikolongo. <verse eid="1SA 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 15:6" />Sauli niyo awagamba wantu nawakekala komzi wa Keni, “Hitani! Halaweni! Kwenegeni na Waamaleki, hegu sivyo nawakomani hamwenga nawo. Halaweni kwaviya nyuwe namdamanya mbuli zedi kwa Waizulaeli umo wakalaila Misili.” Ivyo, wekazi womzi wa Keni wenegana na Waamaleki.<verse eid="1SA 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 15:7" />Sauli kawahuda Waamaleki kukongela Havila kubula Shuli, ulailo wa zuwa wa Misili. <verse eid="1SA 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 15:8" />Kamtaha seuta Agagi ywa Waamaleki achei mjima, awantu wakwe kawakoma kwa kuwasenga kwa sime. <verse eid="1SA 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 15:9" />Mna Sauli na wantu wakwe hawamkomile Agagi ne izingoto zidamanise na ng'ombe zedi na wagoto na wadama na vintu vyose vyedi hawavibalange, wabalanga vintu vihiye na havine ndima.<verse eid="1SA 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sauli alemelwa kutenda seuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 15:10" />Vikaheza, Zumbe Chohile niyo amgamba Samwilu, <verse eid="1SA 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 15:11" />“Nasungulumanya kwambwani simwika Sauli atende seuta. Kanileka miye naho hatimile sigilizi zangu.” Samwilu eze eve ivyo niyo ehiwa, chilo chijima amwilila Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="1SA 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 15:12" />Samwilu eze eve kugamba Sauli keza komzi wa Kalimeli, naho kazengela mnala wa lukumbusa lwakwe, naho kaita Giligali. Elo, mtondo wakwe, Samwilu enukaga chilochilo kaita akadugane na Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 15:13" />Samwilu eze abule kwa Sauli, Sauli niyo amgamba Samwilu, “Zumbe Chohile akujimbike! Sidamanya amalagizo ya Zumbe Chohile.”<verse eid="1SA 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 15:14" />Samwilu niyo amuza, “Ni mbwani neva ngoto na ng'ombe zikwila?”<verse eid="1SA 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 15:15" />Sauli niyo amhitula, “Wantu wangu wasigaza ng'ombe na ngoto zidamanise watahile kwa Waamaleki chani chimlavize ntambiko Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywako, mna visigale vyose chivikoma.”<verse eid="1SA 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 15:16" />Samwilu niyo amgamba Sauli, “Nyamala! Hugambile ulosi nigambilwe ni Zumbe Chohile chilo cha dyelo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 15:16">Sauli amgamba, “Hake nigambila.”<verse eid="1SA 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 15:17" />Samwilu amgamba, “Hata hegu wewonaga humanyikise, togola hwi chilongozi ywa amakabila ya Izulaeli? Zumbe Chohile kakuhaka mavuta utende seuta ywa Izulaeli. <verse eid="1SA 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 15:18" />Aho Zumbe Chohile akusigile kakugambila, ‘Hita ukawakome pele Waamaleki kwaviya awo wose ni wata masa, gomba nkondo nawo kubula uwakome wose!’ <verse eid="1SA 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 15:19" />Haluse ni mbwani hutimile viya Zumbe Chohile alongile? Ni mbwani mgulukila kutaha vintu na kudamanya wihi kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile?”<verse eid="1SA 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 15:20" />Sauli ahitula, “Sidamanya viya Zumbe Chohile alongile. Sita kudya nisigilwe ni Zumbe Chohile, Simleta Agagi seuta ywa Waamaleki, naho Waamaleki siwakoma pele. <verse eid="1SA 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 15:21" />Mna wantu wataha ngoto na mbuzi na ng'ombe zidamane na vintu vyose vyedi vilavigwe vibalangwe chani chimlavize ntambiko Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywako, uko Giligali.”<verse eid="1SA 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 15:22" />Mna Samwilu niyo amgamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 15:22">“Togola, Zumbe Chohile aungisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 15:22">malavyo ya kutikimya na ntambiko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 15:22">ukaleka kutimila viya alongile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 15:22">Kaula, kutimila viya alongile kwawagila ukaleka malavyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 15:22">na kumwetegeleza ukaleka kumlaviza mavuta ya vulata. <verse eid="1SA 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 15:23" />Kumhituka Zumbe Chohile ni saviya masa ya kusinya mnamulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 15:23">na kweduvya ni saviya wihi na kuvikila matukulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 15:23">Kwaviya kulemela amalagizo ya Zumbe Chohile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1SA 15:23">naye kakulemela usekutenda seuta.”<verse eid="1SA 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 15:24" />Sauli niyo amgamba Samwilu, “Sikola masa. Sitimile amalagizo ya Zumbe Chohile na amalagizo yako, kwaviya sogoha wantu, niyo natimila viya walongile. <verse eid="1SA 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 15:25" />Mna haluse nakweila, nilekeila amasa yangu. Nileka nuye hamwenga na weye chani nidahe kumvikila Zumbe Chohile.” <verse eid="1SA 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 15:26" />Samwilu amhitula, “Sikujeza, sikudaha kuya hamwenga na weye. Weye kulemela amalagizo ya Zumbe Chohile, naye kakulemela weye usekutenda seuta ywa Izulaeli.” <verse eid="1SA 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 15:27" />Samwilu eze ahituke chani ahalawe, Sauli niyo atoza isuche ya Samwilu, niyo yamoloka. <verse eid="1SA 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 15:28" />Samwilu niyo amgamba Sauli, “Kukongela dyelo, Zumbe Chohile kausa useuta wa Izulaeli mwako, namwinke mntu mtuhu ehajihi na weye akuwagila kujinka weye. <verse eid="1SA 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 15:29" />Naho, Chohile mta nguvu ywa Izulaeli hakudanta, hegu kuhituila izifanyanyi zakwe. Uyo suyo mntu vikaleka ahituile izifanyanyi zakwe.” <verse eid="1SA 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 15:30" />Sauli amhitula, “Sikola masa. Mna haluse nifisiza soni kulongozi kwa wadalahala wa awantu wangu wa Izulaeli. Nileka nuye hamwenga na weye chani hamvikile Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywako.”<verse eid="1SA 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 15:31" />Ivyo, Samwilu niyo auya hamwenga na Sauli, Sauli niyo amvikila Zumbe Chohile.<verse eid="1SA 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 15:32" />Vikaheza, Samwilu niyo agamba, “Nigailani hano Agagi seuta ywa Waamaleki.” Agagi niyo ambasa Samwilu kuno amunyamunya, kwaviya nendile akafanyanya kugamba, “Usungu wa file ujinka.” <verse eid="1SA 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 15:33" />Samwilu niyo agamba, “Kwaviya sime yako ihosa wavyele walozize waswese wana, seivyo nyokwe naswese mwana mgati mwe wavyele.” Samwilu niyo amhanyahanya Agagi vihande hande kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile uko Giligali.<verse eid="1SA 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 15:34" />Vikaheza, Samwilu niyo aita komzi wa Lama, na seuta Sauli kauya kwekaya yakwe uko Gibeya. <verse eid="1SA 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 15:35" />Kukongela zuwa idyo, Samwilu hamuwone Sauli vituhu kubula abanika. Mna Samwilu kamlombolezeza Sauli. Zumbe Chohile niyo asungulumanya kwambwani kamtenda Sauli seuta ywa Izulaeli.<verse eid="1SA 15:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1SA 16" />
  <para style="s">Daudi ahakwa mavuta atende seuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 16:1" />Zumbe Chohile niyo amuza Samwilu, “Nojendeleze kumwilila Sauli kubula ini? Weye kuvimanya kugamba miye simlemela asekutenda seuta ywa Izulaeli. Haluse guha idihembe udimemeze mavuta uhalawe. Nahusigile kwa mntu akwitangwa Yese akwikala komzi wa Betelehemu. Kwaviya sepatila seuta mgati mwa wanawe.” <verse eid="1SA 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 16:2" />Samwilu amuza, “Nanite vivihi? Sauli aneva ulosi uwo, nanikome!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:2">Zumbe Chohile amhitula, “Guha moli wite nayo, ukabula uko mgambile, ‘Siza kumlaviza ntambiko Zumbe Chohile.’ <verse eid="1SA 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 16:3" />Mwentambiko iyo mgoneke Yese, miye nahugambile cho kudamanya. Na umhake mavuta kwachausa changu yudya hunga hulagise.”<verse eid="1SA 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 16:4" />Samwilu niyo adamanya saviya alagizwe ni Zumbe Chohile, kaita komzi wa Betelehemu. Wadalahala womzi niyo wafosa wamsingila kuno wazingiza, wamuza, “Welewe, togola kwiza kwa utondowazi?”<verse eid="1SA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 16:5" />Samwilu awahitula, “Siza kwa utondowazi. Siza nimlavive ntambiko Zumbe Chohile. Kwekukizeni nyuwe wenye chikaheza chiteni chikalavye ntambiko.” Samwilu niyo amkukiza Yese hamwenga na wanawe, niyo awagoneka kwe ntambiko.<verse eid="1SA 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 16:6" />Weze wabule, Samwilu niyo amuwona Eliyabu, niyo elongela chimoyomoyo, “Chindedi mhakwa mavuta ywa Zumbe Chohile ni yuno ekulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile!” <verse eid="1SA 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 16:7" />Mna Zumbe Chohile amgamba Samwilu, “Usekukaula isula yakwe na utali we ichimo chakwe. Miye simlemela kwaviya miye sikukaula mbuli wakukaula wantu wata kubanika. Wantu wakaula utana wa kuse, mna Zumbe Chohile akaula komoyo.” <verse eid="1SA 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 16:8" />Vikaheza, Yese niyo amwitanga Abinadabu amwigala kulongozi kwa Samwilu. Mna Samwilu niyo agamba, “Hata yuno hasagulwe ni Zumbe Chohile.” <verse eid="1SA 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 16:9" />Yese niyo amwigala mwanawe Shama. Sawilu niyo agamba, “Hata yuno hasagulwe ni Zumbe Chohile.” <verse eid="1SA 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 16:10" />Yese kawajisa wanawe wose mfungate kulongozi kwa Samwilu, mna Samwilu niyo amgamba, “Zumbe Chohile hasagule yoyose mgati mwa wano.” <verse eid="1SA 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 16:11" />Vikaheza, Samwilu niyo amuza Yese, “Wanawo wose wehano?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:11">Yese amhitula, “Bule, umdodo hano hahali, kaita kakudima ngoto.” Samwilu amgamba, “Sigila mntu akamwitange, suwe hachikale hasi chidye kubula eze hano.” <verse eid="1SA 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 16:12" />Ivyo, Yese niyo asigila mntu aite akamwitange. Mbwanga uyo nendile kajimbala, meso yakwe yapwiluka naho kawagizwa vidala. Zumbe Chohile niyo amgamba Samwilu, “Haikaa ni yuno, inuka umhake amavuta.” <verse eid="1SA 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 16:13" />Samwilu niyo aguha diya idihembe dina amavuta amjidila Daudi kulongozi kwa wakuluze. Ahadya Muye wa Zumbe Chohile niyo wamwebunga Daudi na kwikala naye. Vikaheza Samwilu niyo auya komzi wa Lama.<verse eid="1SA 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi mwechitala cha Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 16:14" />Vikaheza, Muye wa Zumbe Chohile niyo wamlawa Sauli, muye wihiye kulaila kwa Zumbe Chohile wamzaganya. <verse eid="1SA 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 16:15" />Wandima wa Sauli niyo wamgamba, “Chimanya kugamba muye wihiye usigilwe ni Zumbe Chohile wakuzaganya. <verse eid="1SA 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 16:16" />Haluse, weye sekulu ywetu, lagiza awandima wako walonde mtu akudaha kutowa limba, muye uwo wihiye kulaila kwa Zumbe Chohile ukakwizila, mntu uyo natowe limba, wenawe notende luhulwila.”<verse eid="1SA 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 16:17" />Sauli niyo awagamba awandima wakwe, “Nilondelani uyo mntu akudaha kutowa limba vyedi, mniletele.” <verse eid="1SA 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 16:18" />Mbwanga yumwenga mgati mwa awandima wakwe niyo agamba, “Siwona mbwanga yumwenga mwa wanawe dya Yese, akwikala komzi wa Betelehemu. Mbwanga uyo kadaha kutowa limba. Mbwanga uyo ni mkankalu kadahisa kugomba nkondo, milongele yakwe ni yedi naho ni mtana, Zumbe Chohile ehamwenga naye.”<verse eid="1SA 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 16:19" />Ivyo, Sauli niyo asigila ulosi kwa Yese, amgamba, “Nigaila mwanawo Daudi uyo umdimi ywa mbuzi na ngoto.” <verse eid="1SA 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 16:20" />Yese niyo amsigila Daudi aite kwa Sauli akatenda na mpunda inule mikate na bete dya divai na katogota. <verse eid="1SA 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 16:21" />Daudi eze abule kwa Sauli niyo akonga kumsankanila. Sauli kamungisa Daudi vyaleka amtenda mwinula viziha ywakwe. <verse eid="1SA 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 16:22" />Vikaheza, Sauli niyo asigila ulosi kwa Yese amgamba, “Daudi kaniwagila leka ekale hano anisankanile.” <verse eid="1SA 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 16:23" />Chila nkanana, muye wihiye kulaila kwa Zumbe Chohile ukamwingila Sauli, Daudi nendile akaguha idilimba dyakwe atowa, muye uwo wihiye wamlawa Sauli, vyaleka ata na luhulwila.<verse eid="1SA 16:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="1SA 17" />
  <para style="s">Goliyati awatila Waizulaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 17:1" />Wafilisiti nendile wachisanya wagomba nkondo wawo uko komzi wa Soko mweisi ya Yuda, wemalanya kwa nkondo. Waika lago dyawo hantu hakwitangwa Efesi Damimu hagatigati ha Soko na Azeka. <verse eid="1SA 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 17:2" />Sauli hamwenga na Waizulaeli wechisanya, waika lago dyawo kwe kagulu kakusinya kwe kolongo dikwitangwa Ela. Wemalanya chani wagombe nkondo na Wafilisiti. <verse eid="1SA 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 17:3" />Wafilisiti nendile wachimala kolugulu ntendele imwenga na Waizulaeli nendile wachimala ntendele intuhu, hagatigati hawo nendile hana kolongo.<verse eid="1SA 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 17:4" />Kulaila kwe idilago dya Wafilisiti, kalaila mkankalu yumwenga akwitangwa Goliyati, mwikazi ywa umzi wa Gati. Utali wakwe na ukenga futi chenda. <verse eid="1SA 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 17:5" />Mo mtwi nendile kavala kofiya dya shaba, mwe chifuwa kavala nchingo ya shaba ina uzami wa chilo milongo mishano na mfungate. <verse eid="1SA 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 17:6" />Iviya mweviga nendile kavika nchingo ya shaba mwa amayega yakwe nendile kahagata guha dya shaba. <verse eid="1SA 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 17:7" />Mhini we idiguha idyo wendaga saviya msomo, idipelege dye idiguha idyo dyendaga na uzami wa chilo mfungate. Inchinga yakwe nendile inulwa ni mntu mtuhu amlongoile. <verse eid="1SA 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 17:8" />Goliyati nendile akachimala na kuwagutila wagomba nkondo wa Izulaeli, awagamba, “Aho mwatenda mbwani? Togolani, mwiza mgombe nkondo? Miye ni Mfilisiti, nyuwe mwi watumwa wa Sauli. Sagulani mntu yumwenga mwenyu eze chitowane. <verse eid="1SA 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 17:9" />Ananihuda na kunikoma, suwe nachitende watumwa wenyu. Mna ninamhuda na kumkoma, nyuwe namtende watumwa wetu mchisankanile.” <verse eid="1SA 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 17:10" />Akaheza Mfilisiti uyo nendile akeduvya, “Nawahuluta wagomba nkondo wa Izulaeli, lavyani mntu yumwenga eze chitowane.” <verse eid="1SA 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 17:11" />Sauli na wagomba nkondo wakwe wose wa Izulaeli weze weve ulosi uwo wo Mfilisiti, niyo wazingiza na kogohesa.<verse eid="1SA 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi kwedilago dya Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 17:12" />Daudi endaga ni mwana ywa Yese, wo lukolo lwa Efulati kulaila komzi wa Betelehemu kweisi ya Yuda. Yese endaga na wana mnane wa chilume. Umo Sauli endaga seuta, Yese nendile kadalahalalisa, mgosingwa ywa chikulu. <verse eid="1SA 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 17:13" />Wana wakulu watatu wa Yese, ni Eliyabu mwelekwa ywa nkongo, atimila Abinadabu na ywa katatu ni Shama, awo nendile waita kwe nkondo hamwenga na Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 17:14" />Daudi nuyo ichiziwanda. Wadya awatatu awakulu nendile waita hamwenga na Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 17:15" />Chila nkanana, Daudi nendile akaita kwa Sauli, ahamwenga nendile akauya kukaya uko Betelehemu akadime izingoto za ise.<verse eid="1SA 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 17:16" />Kwa mazuwa milongo mine, mtondo na chisingi, Goliyati nakelaviza mo lumpe achimala na kuwatila wagomba nkondo wa Izulaeli.<verse eid="1SA 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 17:17" />Zuwa dimwenga, Yese kamgamba mwanawe Daudi, “Wegaile wakuluzo uno mkazingo chilo mlongo na mikate mlongo. Sunguza wegaile uko kwedilago dyawo. <verse eid="1SA 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 17:18" />Yudya sekulu ywawo ywe idibunga dya awagomba nkondo elufu mwigaile yano amabulugushu mlongo ya amabongo. Kawakaule wakuluzo ivyo weli hegu ni wedi, ukaheza wize unigambile.” <verse eid="1SA 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 17:19" />Ichipindi icho, seuta Sauli na wakuluze dya Daudi hamwenga na wagomba nkondo wose wa Izulaeli nendile wakagomba nkondno na Wafilisiti kwedikolongo dya Ela.<verse eid="1SA 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 17:20" />Zuwa ditimile, Daudi kenuka mtondo chilochilo, izingoto kamwasiza mdimi mtuhu. Kaguha izinkande saviya asigilwe ni ise Yese. Eze abule kwedilago dya Waizulaeli, awabwila wemalanya mwezintendele zawo zo kugombela nkondo, wagutila nkondo. <verse eid="1SA 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 17:21" />Wagomba nkondo wa Izulaeli na Wafilisiti wemalanya wagombe nkondo, wasinyana chimntu mntu. <verse eid="1SA 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 17:22" />Daudi niyo amwinka idya inkande mntu akutunduliya izimpamba, akaheza awagulukila wagomba nkondo, kaita kwa wakuluze na kuwalamsa. <verse eid="1SA 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 17:23" />Umo akalonga nawo, Goliyati yudya mkankalu ywa Wafilisiti kulaila Gati niyo alaila kulongozi kwa wagomba nkondo wa Izulaeli saviya azwele. Daudi kamwetegeleza vyedi vitendese. <verse eid="1SA 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 17:24" />Waizulaeli weze wamwone Goliyati, wamogohesa na kusumka. <verse eid="1SA 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 17:25" />Wagambana, “Togolani, yudya mntu alaile mumwona? Chindedi kalaila kuwatila Waizulaeli. Seuta Sauli namwinke ugoli ulozize mntu yoyose namkome yudya mntu. Ukaleka ayo, namloze mchiche ywakwe kwa uyo mntu. Vikaheza wantu we ikaya ya ise nawalekwe wasekuliha kodi.”<verse eid="1SA 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 17:26" />Daudi niyo awauza wadya wehaguhi naye, “Togolani, mntu namkome yudya Mfilisiti na kuikombola Izulaeli kulaila mwe ino isoni nadamanyizwe mbwani? Yuno Mfilisiti ni yuhi, mntu hejeligwe ngasu, akujeza kuwahuluta wagomba nkondo wa Chohile mta ujima?” <verse eid="1SA 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 17:27" />Awo niyo wamwivilikiza saviya walongile aho nkongo kumlanga mntu akunga amkome Goliyati.<verse eid="1SA 17:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 17:28" />Mna Eliyabu, mkuluwe ywa Daudi ywa nkongo eze amwive Daudi akalonga na awantu awo, niyo amwihiwa Daudi, amgamba, “Kuno kubasa mbwani? Ziya izingoto izinjeche kuzasa na yuhi kudya koluwala? Simanya uwefenyi wako na wihi wako. Kuno kuletwa ni lulimi ukaule nkondo.”<verse eid="1SA 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 17:29" />Daudi niyo amuza, “Sitenda mbwani? Hegu ukuza du sibalanga?” <verse eid="1SA 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 17:30" />Daudi niyo amhitukila mntu mtuhu amuza ulosi sauwo, chila akauza ahitulwa seiviya vya nkongo.<verse eid="1SA 17:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 17:31" />Wantu wasiku wamwivile Daudi ivyo alongile niyo wakumgambila Sauli. Sauli niyo asigila Daudi etangwe. <verse eid="1SA 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 17:32" />Daudi niyo amgamba Sauli, “Mntu yoyose asekumogoha yuno mntu, miye mndima ywako nanite hatowane na yuno Mfilisiti.”<verse eid="1SA 17:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 17:33" />Sauli amgamba Daudi, “Hukudaha kwita kutowana na yuno Mfilisiti, kwaviya weye wi mbwanga du, yuno ni mntu ywa nkondo kukongela ubwanga wakwe!”<verse eid="1SA 17:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 17:34" />Mna Daudi niyo amgamba Sauli, “Miye mndima ywako sizwela kudima izingoto za tate, kuna laila simba hegu dubu dyagwila ngoto mwe idifyo, <verse eid="1SA 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 17:35" />miye nadibalaza na kuditowa na kudihoka ingoto mo mlomo isekudigwa, simba hegu uzi dinanihitukila dinigwile nadijela lumelo, naditowa na kudikoma. <verse eid="1SA 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 17:36" />Miye mndima ywako sikoma simba zilozize na madubu yalozize. Haluse, yuno Mfilisiti hejeligwe ngasu akuwahuluta wagomba nkondo wa Chohile mta ujima natende saviya ayo. <verse eid="1SA 17:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 17:37" />Zumbe Chohile anambule kulaila mwe simba na madubu, iviya uyo nanambule kulaila mwa yuno Mfilisiti.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:37">Sauli niyo amgamba Daudi, “Ni vyedi, hita Zumbe Chohile atende hamwenga na weye.” <verse eid="1SA 17:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 17:38" />Vikaheza, Sauli niyo aguha izisuche zakwe za kugombela nkondona kumvisa Daudi, kamvika nkofiya ya shaba komtwi na nchingo ya mwechifuwa ya chuma. <verse eid="1SA 17:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 17:39" />Daudi niyo enyinya sime ya Sauli mwechigudi chakwe, niyo ajeza kujenda, mna kadunduga kwaviya nendile hazwele. Vikaheza, Daudi amgamba Sauli, “Sikudaha kugomba nkondo hatenda sivika izisuche zino, kwaviya sizizwele.” Daudi niyo azihambula. <verse eid="1SA 17:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 17:40" />Daudi kaguha inkome yakwe yo kudimila niyo alogota nkwalambunda shano zedi kulaila mwe kamto azijela mwedibete dyakwe, mo mkono wakwe umtuhu katoza nkumbayuwe, amsogeila Goliyati.<verse eid="1SA 17:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi amhuda Goliyati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 17:41" />Mfilisiti uyo niyo akonga kumsogeila Daudi, kuno kalongoilwa ni yudya akumwinuila ichinga yakwe. <verse eid="1SA 17:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 17:42" />Mfilisiti uyo niyo amsinya Daudi chila hantu, amwona kugamba ni mbwanga du, kadumila unkundu kawagizwa ni chobwanga, niyo ambela. <verse eid="1SA 17:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 17:43" />Goliyati niyo amuza Daudi, “Haluse iyo inkome yambwani? Wafanyanya kugamba miye ni kuli vikuleka wanibasa na nkome?” Mfilisiti uyo niyo amligita Daudi kwa milungu yakwe ya Chifilisiti. <verse eid="1SA 17:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 17:44" />Mfilisiti uyo amgamba Daudi, “Soo hano! Hukome ne ichimba chako naninke madege yo ulanga na makala yadye!” <verse eid="1SA 17:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1SA 17:45" />Mna, Daudi amgamba Goliyati, “Weye wanibasa na bamba na guha na sime. Mna miye nakubasa kwa zina dya Zumbe Chohile mta nguvu, Chohile ywa wagomba nkondo wa Izulaeli, uyo ukuhuluta. <verse eid="1SA 17:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1SA 17:46" />Zuwa dino dya dyelo, Zumbe Chohile naninke uhuda mwako. Nakugwisa hasi, mtwi wako naukanta na ivimba vya wagomba nkondo wa Wafilisiti naninke madege yo ulanga na makala ya kumbago yadye. Vikaheza, wantu wose mweisi nawamanye kugamba Izulaeli kuna Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="1SA 17:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1SA 17:47" />Wantu wose wadugane hano dyelo, nawamanye kugamba Zumbe Chohile hakwambula wantu kwa sime na maguha. Ino ni nkondo ya Zumbe Chohile, uyo nachinke uhuda mwenyu wose.”<verse eid="1SA 17:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1SA 17:48" />Goliyati niyo akonga vituhu kumbasa Daudi. Daudi ahindala nguluko aita akugomba nkondo na Goliyati. <verse eid="1SA 17:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1SA 17:49" />Daudi niyo ajela umkono mwedibete dyakwe, alavya nkumbayuwe imwenga aidula kwa supatu dyakwe, amtowa nayo Goliyati mwe chinengo chakwe, ngumbayuwe ififinya na kwingila kundani, Goliyati niyo agwa hasi chifudifudi. <verse eid="1SA 17:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1SA 17:50" />Vino, niyo Daudi amhudile Goliyati kwa nkumbayuwe, hena sime momkono wakwe. <verse eid="1SA 17:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1SA 17:51" />Ivyo, niyo ahindala nguluko akuchimala mlanga mwa Goliyati, asomola isime ya Goliyati mwe yala, amkanta isingo na kumkoma.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:51">Wafilisiti weze wawone mkankalu ywawo kakomwa, wahindala nguluko wasumka. <verse eid="1SA 17:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1SA 17:52" />Aho, wantu wa Izulaeli na Yuda niyo wakonga kuguta kwa uhuda, wawabalaza Wafilisiti kubula komzi wa Gati, kwezinchili za Ekuloni, Wafilisit walumizwe kwenkondo wazagala mwesila kukongela Shaalimu kubula Gati na Ekuloni. <verse eid="1SA 17:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1SA 17:53" />Umo Waizulaeli wakauya kulaila kokuwabalaza, niyo wataha idilago dya Wafilisiti. <verse eid="1SA 17:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1SA 17:54" />Daudi niyo enula umtwi wa yudya Mfilisiti Goliyati awigala komzi wa Yelusalemu. Mna iviziha vya Goliyati kavika kwedihema dyakwe.<verse eid="1SA 17:54" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi egalwa kwa Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1SA 17:55" />Sauli eze amwone Daudi akugomba nkondo na yuda Mfilisiti Goliyati, niyo amuza Abuneli, sekulu ywa wagomba nkondo wakwe, “Abuneli, yuno mbwanga ni mwana ani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:55">Abuneli amhitula, “Seuta, chindedi miye simanyize.”<verse eid="1SA 17:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1SA 17:56" />Seuta Sauli amgamba, “Haluse hita kauze uyo mbwanga ni mwana ani.”<verse eid="1SA 17:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="1SA 17:57" />Daudi eze auye kwedilago akatenda kaheza kumkoma Goliyati, Abuneli niyo amguha amwigala kwa Sauli, kuno Daudi akatenda katoza umtwi wa Goliyati mwemikono yakwe. <verse eid="1SA 17:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1SA 17:58" />Sauli niyo amuza Daudi, “We mbwanga wi mwana ani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:58">Daudi amhitula, “Miye ni mwana ywa Yese mndima ywako kulaila Betelehemu.”<verse eid="1SA 17:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="1SA 18" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 18:1" />Sauli eze aheze kulonga na Daudi, Yonasani mwanawe dya Sauli niyo atamilwa ni Daudi, vyaleka amkola umbuya saviya akweunga mwenye. <verse eid="1SA 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 18:2" />Kukongela zuwa idyo Sauli kamguha Daudi ekale kwenyumba yakwe, hamlekile auye kwekaya ya tati yakwe. <verse eid="1SA 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 18:3" />Kwaviya Yonasani nakamungisa Daudi saviya akweunga mwenye, niyo aika lagano naye. <verse eid="1SA 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 18:4" />Yonasani kamhambwila inkazu yakwe avikile niyo amwinka Daudi hamwenga na kasuche kakugubika mwechifuwa ne iviziha vyakwe na sime na uta na msipi wakwe. <verse eid="1SA 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 18:5" />Chochose Sauli amgambile Daudi adamanye, Daudi kachidamanya vitana. Ivyo Sauli niyo amtenda Daudi sekulu ywa wagomba nkondo wakwe. Mbuli iyo iwelela wantu wose, hata wandima wa Sauli.<verse eid="1SA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sauli amdila finju Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 18:6" />Umo wagomba nkondo wakauya kaya, kuno walongozana na Daudi amkomile yudya Mfilisiti, wavyele kulaila chila mzi mwe isi ya Izulaeli nawafosa waita wakumsingila seuta Sauli. Wavyele awo nendile wakachema nchemo za mbwedo, watowa wagoma na malimba. <verse eid="1SA 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 18:7" />Iviya nawakachema nchemo za kwisana, wagamba, “Sauli kakoma wagomba nkondo maelufu, mna Daudi kakoma wagomba nkondo milongo maelufu.” <verse eid="1SA 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 18:8" />Nchemo iyo Sauli haimwelele, vyaleka ehiwa vitendese. Agamba, “Daudi wamwinka milongo maelufu, mna miye waninka maelufu du. Chisigaile nikumwinka Daudi useuta.” <verse eid="1SA 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 18:9" />Kukongela idizuwa idyo, Sauli niyo atenda ana nkama na Daudi.<verse eid="1SA 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 18:10" />Zuwa ditimile, muye wihiye utumigwe ni Zumbe Chohile umwebunga Sauli chipumpa, ahonjomoka kwenyumbakwe saviya mchilalu. Daudi nendile akatowa limba saviya atendile amazuwa yose. Sauli nendile ana guha mo mkono wakwe. <verse eid="1SA 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 18:11" />Ivyo, Sauli niyo elongela mo umoyo, “Nanimtunge guha Daudi asigaile aho hechiwambaza, niyo adikunta chinguvu nkanana mbili.” Mna Daudi kenega nkanana zose mbili.<verse eid="1SA 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 18:12" />Sauli niyo amogoha Daudi kwaviya Zumbe Chohile nendile ehamwenga na Daudi, mna Zumbe Chohile kamwasa Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 18:13" />Ivyo, Sauli niyo amusa Daudi kulongozi kwakwe, amtenda chilongozi ywa wagomba nkondo elufu imwenga. Daudi kawalongoza vyedi kwenkondo. <verse eid="1SA 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 18:14" />Daudi kachumilwa mwe chila mbuli adamanye, kwaviya Zumbe Chohile nendile ehamwenga naye. <verse eid="1SA 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 18:15" />Sauli eze awone ivyo Daudi akuchumilwa, niyo amogoha Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 18:16" />Mna wantu wose wa Izulaeli na Yuda nendile wakamunga Daudi, kwaviya nuyo akuwalongoza vyedi kwenkondo na kuwavuza wakatenda wachumilwa.<verse eid="1SA 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi amsola mchiche ywa Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 18:17" />Sauli niyo amgamba Daudi, “Yuno hano ni mchiche ywangu ywa nkongo Melabu, nahuloze atende mkaziwo, mna nakwinka mwiko uno, utende mgomba nkondo ywangu mkankalu na kutimila yadya hulonga, ugombe nkondo ya Zumbe Chohile. Sauli nakafanyanya kugamba kwesila iyo Wafilisiti nawamkome Daudi, vileke mbuli iyo asekuidamanya yeye mwenye.”<verse eid="1SA 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 18:18" />Daudi niyo amuza Sauli, “Miye ni yuhi vileke seuta atende mkwangu? Lukolo lwangu lwenye na awantu we ikaya ya tate hawamanyikise mweisi ya Izulaeli.” <verse eid="1SA 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 18:19" />Ivyo, mazuwa ye inyinka ya Daudi kumsola Melebu mchiche ywa Sauli yeze yabule, Sauli hadamanye ivyo, mchiche uyo kamloza kwa mgosi mtuhu akwitangwa Adulieli kulaila komzi wa Mehola.<verse eid="1SA 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 18:20" />Hata ivyo, mchiche mtuhu ywa Sauli akwitangwa Mikali nakamunga Daudi. Sauli eze agambilwe niyo elelwa vitendese. <verse eid="1SA 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 18:21" />Sauli kelongela momoyo wakwe kugamba, “Leka nimloze mchiche ywangu kwa Daudi, chani atende mtego kwakwe. Hahana nkama Wafilisiti nawamkome.” Elo Sauli niyo amgamba Daudi nkanana ya kaidi, “Haluse nanitende mkweo.” <verse eid="1SA 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 18:22" />Vikaheza Sauli niyo awasigila wandima wakwe akawagamba, “Longani na Daudi kwa chinyele mumgambe, kaula seuta kawagilwa ni weye, na wandima wakwe wose wakunga. Haluse zumila utenda mkwelima ywa Seuta.”<verse eid="1SA 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 18:23" />Ivyo, wandima awo wa Sauli niyo wamgambila Daudi ulosi uwo kwa chinyele, Daudi awagamba, “Miye ni mntu mchiwa sing'ala pwii, sanidahe kuliha matundu yo kusoila. Togolani, mwafanyanya kugamba ni mbuli mpufu seuta atende mkwangu?”<verse eid="1SA 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 18:24" />Wandima wadya niyo wakumgambila Sauli viya Daudi alongile. <verse eid="1SA 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 18:25" />Sauli awagamba, “Mgambeni Daudi vino, ‘Mali akunga seuta yo mchiche ywakwe ni mazoba gana dimwenga ya Wafilisiti, chani alihize chikoda kwa wankondo wakwe.’” Uwo nuwo wendile umwalo wa Sauli, vileke Daudi akomwe ni Wafilisiti. <verse eid="1SA 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 18:26" />Wadya wandima weze wamgambile Daudi viya Sauli akunga, Daudi niyo elelwa kugamba seuta natende mkwewe. <verse eid="1SA 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 18:27" />Ivyo, zuwa dye inyinka hedinati, Daudi na awantu wakwe niyo waita na kuwakoma Wafilisiti magana maidi, mazoba yawo wayaguha wamwigaila seuta Sauli. Aho, Daudi kamuwaziza uwazwa ukungwa chani atende mkwewe. Sauli niyo amloza mchiche ywakwe Mikali kwa Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 18:28" />Mna Sauli eze awone pwilili kugamba, Zumbe Chohile ehamwenga na Daudi, na kugamba mchiche ywakwe Mikali amungisa Daudi, <verse eid="1SA 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 18:29" />Sauli niyo amogohesa Daudi. Sauli niyo atenda mnkondo ywa Daudi mazuwa yose.<verse eid="1SA 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 18:30" />Wagomba nkondo wa Wafilisiti niyo waita wakugomba nkondo na Waizulaeli, mna chila nkanana wakagomba nkondo, Daudi nendile akahuda kujinka wandima wa Sauli, ivyo zina dya Daudi niyo dyatogoleswa.<verse eid="1SA 18:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="1SA 19" />
  <para style="s">Sauli aunga amkome Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 19:1" />Sauli kamgambila mwanawe Yonasani na wandima wakwe wose mwalo wakwe wa kumkoma Daudi. Mna Yonasani mwanawe dya Sauli nakamungisa Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 19:2" />Ivyo, Yonasani niyo amfunda Daudi amgamba, “Tate aunga akukome. Haluse kaulisa. Luvi mtondo kwefise wikale aho. <verse eid="1SA 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 19:3" />Miye nanize na kuchimala haguhi na tate uko kwenkonde aho wefisize. Aho nanilonge naye mbuli zako, chintu chochose nanibunkule kulawa kwakwe nahugambile.”<verse eid="1SA 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 19:4" />Yonasani kamtogola Daudi na kumgambila ise, “Usekumdamanyiza wihi mndima ywako Daudi kwaviya uyo hadamanye wihi wowose mwako, mbuli zose akudamanyize nazikwambize weye. <verse eid="1SA 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 19:5" />Umo amkomaga yudya Mfilisiti Goliyati, kawambaza ujima wakwe, Zumbe Chohile niyo awenka uhuda mkulu Waizulaeli. Wize uwone imbuli iyo niyo welelwa. Ni mbwani waunga ukole masa kwa kumkoma Daudi hena mlema?”<verse eid="1SA 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 19:6" />Sauli kamwetegeleza Yonasani, akaheza niyo elisa, “Nelisa kwa Zumbe Chohile mta ujima, miye sanimkome Daudi.” <verse eid="1SA 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 19:7" />Ivyo, Yonasani niyo amwitanga Daudi na kumgambila mbuli izo zose. Yonasani niyo amwigala Daudi kwa Sauli, Daudi niyo amsankanila Sauli saviya nkongo. <verse eid="1SA 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 19:8" />Nyumani niyo kwatenda na nkondo vituhu mgati mwa Wafilisiti na Waizulaeli. Daudi niyo afosa atowana na Wafilisiti, kakoma Wafilisiti walozize na wadya wasigale niyo wasumka.<verse eid="1SA 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 19:9" />Zuwa dimwenga, muye wihiye kulaila kwa Zumbe Chohile niyo wamwebunga Sauli umo endile kekala kwenyumbakwe kuno katoza guha mo mkono, Daudi nendile akatowa limba. <verse eid="1SA 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 19:10" />Sauli nakaunga amtunge Daudi kwa idyo idiguha, mna Daudi kenega idiguha dya Sauli dyatunga kwechiwambaza. Ichilo ichoicho, Daudi niyo aguluka asumka.<verse eid="1SA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 19:11" />Chilo icho Sauli niyo asigila wantu kunyumba kwa Daudi wakamkaule hegu eyuko chani mtondo amkome. Mna Mikali mkaziwe dya Daudi amgamba, “Uneva hunagombele ujima wako ichilo chino luvi wakomwa.” <verse eid="1SA 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 19:12" />Ivyo, Mikali niyo amwambiza kumseleza Daudi mwe dilisha, Daudi niyo afosa asumka. <verse eid="1SA 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 19:13" />Akaheza Mikali niyo aguha tukulu adigoneza mo lusazi komtwi kadivika mazoya ya mbuzi niyo adigubika na shuka. <verse eid="1SA 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 19:14" />Sauli eze asigile wantu waite wakamgwile Daudi, Mikali niyo awagamba, “Daudi ni mnyonje.” <verse eid="1SA 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 19:15" />Vikaheza, Sauli niyo awasigila awantu awo wauye vituhu, awalagiza kugamba, “Hata hegu Daudi ni mnyonje mleteni hano hangu akatenda molusazi chani nimkome.” <verse eid="1SA 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 19:16" />Mna wadya wantu weze wengile kunyumba kwa Daudi wakaula mo lusazi wawona tukulu divikigwe mazoya ya mbuzi komtwi. <verse eid="1SA 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 19:17" />Vikaheza, Sauli niyo amuza Mikali, “Ni mbwani ukanidanta?” “Ni mbwani ukaleka mnkondo ywangu asumke?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 19:17">Mikali niyo amhitula Sauli, “Kanigamba, ‘Nileka nite nnase kukukoma.’”<verse eid="1SA 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 19:18" />Daudi eze asumke, kaita komzi wa Lama kwa Samwilu. Kamtambalisa Samwilu mbuli zose adamanyizwe ni Sauli. Ivyo, Daudi na Samwilu waita Nayoti iyo yendaga nyumba ya waoni wakwikala uko. <verse eid="1SA 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 19:19" />Nyumani Sauli niyo agambilwa kugamba Daudi eyuko Nayoti, uko komzi wa Lama. <verse eid="1SA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 19:20" />Sauli niyo asigila wantu waite wakamgwile Daudi. Mna wantu awo weze wabwile bunga dya waoni walotela wakalongozwa ni Samwilu, Muye wa Chohile niyo wawebunga awandima awo wa Sauli nawo wakonga kulotela kuno wavina naho watula lwasu. <verse eid="1SA 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 19:21" />Sauli eze agambilwe imbuli iyo, niyo asigila wandima watuhu, awo nawo niyo wakonga kulotela na kuvina naho watula lwasu. Ize ibule nkanana ya katatu Sauli niyo asigila wandima watuhu, nawo weze wabule uko niyo wakonga kulotela na kuvina naho watula lwasu. <verse eid="1SA 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 19:22" />Vyamleka Sauli mwenye aita komzi wa Lama. Eze abule kwesima kulu diyuko Seku, aho kabwila mntu msiku, niyo amuza, “Samwilu na Daudi wekuhi?” Uyo mntu amhitula, “Weyuko Nayoti komzi wa Lama.” <verse eid="1SA 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 19:23" />Ivyo, Sauli niyo aita uko Nayoti komzi wa Lama. Mna iviya Muye wa Chohile niyo wamwebunga, naye niyo akonga kulotele na kuvina naho atula lwasu akatenda emwesila kubula Nayoti komzi wa Lama. <verse eid="1SA 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 19:24" />Kahambula izisuche zakwe alotela kulongozi kwa Samwilu. Kekala ivyo chimbwigili msi mjima na chilo chijima. Wantu niyo wakonga kweuza, “Togolani, Sauli naye ni yumwenga ywa waoni?”<verse eid="1SA 19:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="1SA 20" />
  <para style="s">Yonasani amwambiza Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 20:1" />Vikaheza, Daudi kamsumka naho kulaila Nayoti uko Lama, kaita kubula kwa Yonasani, amuza, “Sitenda mbwani? Icho nibalange ni chihi? Simbalanga mbwani iso vikuleka aunga anikome?”<verse eid="1SA 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 20:2" />Yonasani amhitula, “Bule! Hokomwe. Tate hadamanye mbuli yoyose, itende nkulu hegu ndodo akaleka kunigambila. Hata imbuli iyo hakudaha kunifisa. Izimbuli ukulonga sicho chindedi.”<verse eid="1SA 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 20:3" />Mna, Daudi niyo elisa, “Chindedi, tati yako kamanya vyedi viya ukununga, naho afanyanya akufise imbuli ino chani usekwingila chihovu umo anaidamanya. Nelisa kwa Zumbe Chohile mta ujima, na weye ivyo wimjima, kugamba file yangu ihaguhi!” <verse eid="1SA 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 20:4" />Yonasani amgamba, “Dyodyose ukunga nidamanye nahudamanyize.”<verse eid="1SA 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 20:5" />Daudi amgamba, “Luvi ni ngasu ya kutontomoka kwa mnenge, nongigwa nidye nkande hamwenga na seuta. Mna nileka hefise uko kwenkonde kubula chisingi cha zuwa dya katatu. <verse eid="1SA 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 20:6" />Uneva iso hananiwone he nkande, anakuza mgambe, ‘Daudi kaneila nimleke aite komzi wakwe wa Betelehemu akatende ntambiko ikudamanyika chila mhilimo hamwenga na wantu we ikaya yakwe.’ <verse eid="1SA 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 20:7" />Uneva iso anazumila kugamba ni vyedi, aho, umanye kugamba hanikome. Mna hegu anehiwa umanye kugamba kekamba chani anikome. <verse eid="1SA 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 20:8" />Hampu nilagisa wedi kwaviya wako miye na weye chidamanya lagano dikukile kwa Zumbe Chohile chitende wambuya. Mna, hegu sikola masa, nikoma weye mwenye, ni mbwani unigale kwa iso akanikome?”<verse eid="1SA 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 20:9" />Yonasani niyo amhitula, “Bule, usekufanyanya ivyo! Hegu namanyize hata hadodo kugamba tate kekamba akukome, togola sakugambile?”<verse eid="1SA 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 20:10" />Vikaheza, Daudi amuza, “Nanimanye vivihi hegu iso kakuhitula chimaya maya?”<verse eid="1SA 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 20:11" />Yonasani amhitula Daudi, “Chite kwenkonde!” Ivyo wose waidi niyo waita kwenkonde. <verse eid="1SA 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 20:12" />Yonasani niyo amgamba Daudi, “Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywa Izulaeli, atende mukuzi ywetu. Luvi hegu chisindo, chipindi sachino nanimuze tate, mbuli akufanyanya mwako nahugambile. <verse eid="1SA 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 20:13" />Uneva Sauli aunga akukome miye nami sinakugambile chani wite hale kuntu nawikale mpeho, Zumbe Chohile nanikome. Zumbe Chohile atende hamwenga na weye saviya endaga na tate. <verse eid="1SA 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 20:14" />Uneva ninajendeleza kutenda mjima, hampu toza icheliso chetu chikukile naho utende mkanuni, uneva ninabanika, <verse eid="1SA 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 20:15" />usekuleka kuwadamanyiza wedi awantu we ikaya yangu mazuwa yose, hata hegu Zumbe Chohile nawabinde awankondo wako wose mweisi.” <verse eid="1SA 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 20:16" />Ivyo kweisila ino, Yonasani niyo adamanya lagano na wantu we ikaya ya Daudi agamba, “Zumbe Chohile awakome awankondo wa Daudi.”<verse eid="1SA 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 20:17" />Yonasani niyo amgamba Daudi avuzagize kwelisa kuligana na ungi wakwe kwakwe, kwaviya Yonasani nendile akamungisa Daudi saviya akweunga mwenye. <verse eid="1SA 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 20:18" />Vikaheza, Yonasani niyo amgamba Daudi, “Luvi ni ngasu ya kutontomoka kwa mnenge, wantu wanawona pwilili kugamba huhali, kwaviya idifumbi dyako hadikalwe ni mntu. <verse eid="1SA 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 20:19" />Kisindo zuwa dikahunga hita hadya ahantu wefisaga, ukefise kunyuma kwechisungu cha amayuwe. <verse eid="1SA 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 20:20" />Miye nanikunte mifulo mitatu mnkandankanda mwe idiyuwe idyo saviya nataila chintu. <verse eid="1SA 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 20:21" />Haheza nanimsigile mndima ywangu kugamba, ‘Hata ukailonde imifulo.’ Uneva ninamgamba, Kaula imiulo intendele yako, Nigaila hano, elo umanye chindedi saviya Zumbe Chohile mta ujima mbuli zichuma ntendele yako, fose uko wefisize, kwaviya notende mjima howambaze ujima wako. <verse eid="1SA 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 20:22" />Mna ninamgamba, ‘Kaula imifulo ikulongozi kwako,’ sumka wite, kwaviya Zumbe Chohile aunga wite hale. <verse eid="1SA 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 20:23" />Kuligana ne ndagano chikiye, Zumbe Chohile akaula mgati mwetu mazuwa yose vileke achintize.”<verse eid="1SA 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 20:24" />Elo, Daudi niyo efisa kwenkonde. Mwengasu yo kutontomoka umnenge, seuta Sauli ni ekela adye nkande. <verse eid="1SA 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 20:25" />Saviya vili mazwela yakwe, seuta Daudi niyo ekala mwe idifumbi dyakwe dyegamile mwechiwambaza. Yonasani niyo ekala akasinyana na seuta, Abuneli niyo ekala hajihi na seuta. Mna ahantu ha Daudi hahekalwe. <verse eid="1SA 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 20:26" />Zuwa idyo, Sauli halongile mbuli yoyose, kwaviya nakafanyanya kugamba mafani kuna chintu chimchindile Daudi, hegu vyadahika hakukile kwehanga mwe iyo ingasu. <verse eid="1SA 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 20:27" />Mna zuwa dya kaidi, dye ngasu ya kutontomoka umnenge ikajendeleza, hantu ha Daudi hasigaila hahana mntu ekale. Sauli niyo amuza mwanawe Yonasani, “Ni mbwani gulo na dyelo Daudi mwana ywa Yese hezile kudya nkande?”<verse eid="1SA 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 20:28" />Yonasani niyo amhitula, “Daudi kanilahiliza vitendese nimleke aite Betelehemu. <verse eid="1SA 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 20:29" />Kanigamba, ‘Nileka nite kwa wantu we ikaya yangu, kwaviya wadamanya ngasu ya ntambiko uko komzi, na mlukolo ywangu kanigamba nitendeke uko. Ivyo uneva vyadahika nileka nite kwa walukolo wangu.’ Nivyo vikuleka hano hokudya inkande ya seuta hahali.”<verse eid="1SA 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 20:30" />Aho, Sauli niyo amwimukila maya Yonasani, amgamba, “Weye mwana ywa mvyele mwihi na mnkani! Sivimanya kugamba kumsagula mwana ywa Yese kwa soni zako mwenye na kumjela soni mami yako! <verse eid="1SA 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 20:31" />Togola, humanyize kugamba Daudi akatenda mjima weye hodahe kupata luhenyo lwa kutenda seuta ywe isi ino? Haluse hita kamguhe wize naye hano hangu, chani nimkome.”<verse eid="1SA 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 20:32" />Yonasani niyo amhitula ise, “Kwambwani waunga umkome Daudi? Togola, kabalanga mbwani?”<verse eid="1SA 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 20:33" />Mna ahadya, Sauli niyo amkuntila guha Yonasani chani amkome. Yonasani niyo abunkula kugamba ise kekamba chani amkome Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 20:34" />Aho, Yonasani akatenda kemukiswa ni maya niyo asunguza kuhalawa hadya he nkande, vyaleka hadile nkande yoyose zuwa idyo dya kaidi dye ngasu yo kutontomoka umnenge. Yonasani kengilwa ni chinyulu vitendese mwa Daudi kwaviya ise nakamdamanyiza mbuli zikujela soni. <verse eid="1SA 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 20:35" />Mtondo zuwa ditimile, Yonasani niyo aita kudya kwenkonde akadugane na Daudi saviya walagane. Uko kaita na mbwanga yumwenga. <verse eid="1SA 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 20:36" />Eze abule uko niyo amgamba yudya mbwanga, “Guluka ukalogote imifulo hunga nikunte.” Umo yudya mbwanga akaguluka, Yonasani niyo akunta mfulo kumjinka uyo mbwanga. <verse eid="1SA 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 20:37" />Yudya mbwanga eze abule ahantu aho umfulo ulasize, Yonasani niyo amgamba, “Mfulo ulasa kulongozi kwako. <verse eid="1SA 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 20:38" />Sunguza usekuchimala ahantu aho.” Yudya mbwanga niyo alogota imifulo auya kwa Yonasani. <verse eid="1SA 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 20:39" />Mna yudya mbwanga hana icho amanyize mwe ichilagiso icho kugamba chalagisa mbwani. Yonasani na Daudi nawodu wamanyize. <verse eid="1SA 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 20:40" />Yonasani niyo amwinka iviziha vyakwe yudya mbwanga amgamba, “Uya, igala vino iviziha kaya.”<verse eid="1SA 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 20:41" />Yudya mbwanga eze ahalawe, Daudi niyo afosa hadya efisize hajihi ne chisungu cha amayuwe. Daudi kenama na kufika madi nkanana ntantu kulongozi kwa Yonasani kwa ntunyo. Wose waidi, Daudi na Yonasani wakubatilana waila. Mna Daudi nendile ana chinyulu vitendese kujinka Yonasani. <verse eid="1SA 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 20:42" />Vikaheza, Yonasani niyo amgamba Daudi, “Jenda mpeho. Chose waidi chika ndagano kwa Zumbe Chohile, kugamba chiwambuya. Zumbe Chohile akaula idilagano dwetu adichintize, na mwa welekwa wangu na welekwa wako mazuwa yose.” Daudi niyo enuka aita zakwe, Yonasani naye niyo auya komzi.<verse eid="1SA 20:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="1SA 21" />
  <para style="s">Daudi asumkila uko Nobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 21:1" />Daudi kaita kwa mlavyantambiko Ahimeleki uko Nobu. Ahimeleki kafosa vileke amsingile kuno azingiza, niyo amuza, “Ni mbwani kwiza hano ichedu? Kwambwani hulongozane na mntu mtuhu?”<verse eid="1SA 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 21:2" />Daudi amhitula “Siza hano kwa lagizo dya seuta. Kanigamba nisekugambila mntu yoyose chiya anisigile. Chivana na awantu wangu kugamba chidugane hantu hasiku. <verse eid="1SA 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 21:3" />Togola, una chintu chochose cha kudya? Nakulombeza uninke migate mishano hegu chochose unanacho.”<verse eid="1SA 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 21:4" />Mlavyantambiko Ahimeleki amgamba, “Hano mgate uzweleke hahana. Migate ihano nidya ikukizwe. Migate iyo mwadaha mwinkigwe hegu awantu wako hawagonile na wavyele mazuwa yano ya haguhi.”<verse eid="1SA 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 21:5" />Daudi amhitula, “Chindedi, wantu wangu hawagonile na wavyele kwa mazuwa matatu, hegu haita kwe ndima yesimile, wavyele hachina mbuli nawo! Hegu wandima wangu ni wakuka imili yawo mwe ndima za mazwela, togola havitendese mwe indima ino yesimile?”<verse eid="1SA 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 21:6" />Ivyo, mlavyantambiko Ahimeleki niyo amwinka imigate ikukizwe, kwaviya nendile hahana migate mituhu ukaleka iyo ilavigwe ntambiko kwe Idihema Dikukile kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile, niyo yahituilwa na migate mituhu kulawa kwediziko.<verse eid="1SA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 21:7" />Elo, zuwa idyo kwendaga na mndima yumwenga ywa Sauli etile kwe kuvika kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile. Mndima uyo naketangwa Doegi kulaila Edomu chilongozi ywa awadimi wa Sauli.<verse eid="1SA 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 21:8" />Elo, Daudi niyo amgamba Ahimeleki, “Togola, una sime hegu guha ukudaha kuninka? Kwaviya ndima aninkile seuta zinunga nisunguze kukulawa, ivyo siguhile sime yangu hegu chiziha chochose.”<verse eid="1SA 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 21:9" />Ahimeleki amhitula, “Sime ninanayo hano ni idya ya Goliyati yudya Mfilisiti ukomile kwedikolongo dya Ela, ikunyuma kwa akasuche kamwechifuwa ka mlavyantambiko, izingwa mwe chitambala. Uneva waunga iguhe iyo kwaviya hano hahana sime ntuhu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 21:9">Daudi amgamba, “Uneva hahana sime ntuhu ukaleka iyo, ninka iyo.” <verse eid="1SA 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 21:10" />Vikaheza Daudi kajendeleza kumsumka Sauli kaita kwa Akishi seuta ywa Gati. <verse eid="1SA 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 21:11" />Wandima wa seuta Akishi wamuza, “Yuno suyo Daudi seuta ywa Izulaeli? Togola, suyo yudya nendile wakachema wakaisana kuno wakavina ngoma, wakagamba, ‘Sauli kakoma maelufu mna Daudi kakoma milongo maelufu?’”<verse eid="1SA 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 21:12" />Daudi izimbuli izo kazika mo umoyo wakwe, vyaleka amogohesa Akishi seuta ywa Gati. <verse eid="1SA 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 21:13" />Ivyo, Daudi niyo etenda kawehuka kulongozi kwawo, ekala saviya mchilalu akwachula kwachula mwezinyivi zo mzi, nakaleka malovu yatwekele mwezindevu zakwe. <verse eid="1SA 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 21:14" />Akishi niyo awagamba awantu wakwe, “Mvimanya kugamba mntu yuno ni mchilalu, ni bwani mkamleta hano hangu? <verse eid="1SA 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 21:15" />Togolani, miye nongisa wachilalu? Ni mbwani mkunigaila mchilalu eze anitumbwadise kwa mbuli za chichilalu? Togolani, yuno mntu adaha kwingila kwenyumba yangu?”<verse eid="1SA 21:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1SA 22" />
  <para style="s">Sauli awakoma walavyantambiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 22:1" />Daudi niyo akulawa uko Gati asumkila kwe mpanga ihajihi nomzi wa Adulamu. Wakuluze na walukolo wakwe watuhu weze weve kugamba eyaho, wose niyo wambasa uko. <verse eid="1SA 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 22:2" />Wantu wose wendile na chinyulu na ntigizo na wadya nendile wakabunyanyanywa wambasa Daudi. Chahamwenga nawakenga magana mane, Daudi niyo atenda chilongozi ywawo.<verse eid="1SA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 22:3" />Kulaila uko, Daudi niyo aita Misipa kweisi ya Moabu. Niyo amgamba seuta ywa Moabu, “Nakweila, tate na mnala wekale hano hako kubula aho nanimanye icho Chohile nanidamanyize.” <verse eid="1SA 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 22:4" />Ivyo, Daudi niyo awasa welesi wakwe wekale hamwenga na seuta ywa Moabu, awo wekala na seuta mazuwa yose Daudi endaga kwe mpanga.<verse eid="1SA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 22:5" />Vikaheza muoni Gadi niyo amgamba Daudi, “Usekwikala kwe mpanga. Sunguza, halawe wite kweisi ya Yuda.” Ivyo Daudi niyo ahalawa, aita kwe mbago ya Heleti.<verse eid="1SA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 22:6" />Ivyo zuwa dimwenga, Sauli eze eve kugamba, Daudi na wantu wakwe wawoneka. Sauli nendile kekala hasi hemti wa mkwazu uko kwe inkweza ya Gibeya, kuno katoza guha na wandima wakwe nendile wamzunguluka. <verse eid="1SA 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 22:7" />Sauli niyo awauza, “Haluse nyuwe wantu we idikabila dya Benjamini kwetegelezeni! Togolani, yuno Daudi mwana ywa Yese adaha kuwenkani nkonde za nkande na nkonde za mizabibu nyuwe wose? Hegu mwafanyanya kugamba chila mntu natendwe mkulu ywa wagomba nkondo maelufu na mkulu ywa wagomba nkondo magana? <verse eid="1SA 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 22:8" />Ni mbwani nyuwe wose mnihituka? Hahana hata yumwe mwenyu anigambile ni ini umo mwanangu adamanye lagano na Daudi mwana ywa Yese. Hahana hata yumwenga anifile mbazi na kunigambila kugamba mwanangu amsonga maya mndima ywangu anicheseke savino vili vino dyelo?”<verse eid="1SA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 22:9" />Aho Doegu kulaila Edumu, uyo endile achimale na masekulu wa nkondo wa Sauli amgamba, “Nasimwona Daudi, mwana ywa Yese akeza Nobu kwa mlavyantambiko Ahimeleki, mwana ywa Ahitubu. <verse eid="1SA 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 22:10" />Ahimeleki kamlombezeza Daudi kwa Zumbe Chohile, kamwinka nkande ne isime ya yudya Mfilisiti Goliyati.”<verse eid="1SA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 22:11" />Ivyo, seuta niyo alagiza wantu wamwitange mlavyantambiko Ahimeleki mwana ywa Ahitubu, hamwenga na wantu wose we ikaya ya tati yakwe awo wendile walavyantambiko uko Nobu. Wose niyo waita kwa seuta Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 22:12" />Sauli niyo awagamba, “Haluse, tegeleza weye mwana ywa Ahitubu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 22:12">Ahimeleki amhitula, “Ni vyedi sekulu ywangu nakwetegeleza.”<verse eid="1SA 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 22:13" />Sauli amuza, “Ni mbwani weye na Daudi, mwana ywa Yese, mnihituka miye? Ni mbwani kumwinka migate ne isime, ukaheza wamlombezeza kwa Chohile? Kwachausa icho vino dyelo kanihituka naho kanekambila anikome.”<verse eid="1SA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 22:14" />Ahimeleki niyo amhitula seuta, “Mgati mwa awandima wako wose ni yuhi mkanuni kujinka Daudi? Uyo, ni mkwelima ywako weye seuta mwenye, chilongozi ywa awamizi wako wakukwamila weye na awantu we inyumba yako. <verse eid="1SA 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 22:15" />Togola, dyelo ni nkanana yangu ha nkongo kumlombezeza Daudi kwa Zumbe Chohile? Seuta bule, usekunizila mndima ywako hegu yoyose ywe ikaya ya tati yakwe, kwaviya miye mndima ywako sina icho nimanyize chidodo hegu chikulu.”<verse eid="1SA 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 22:16" />Mna seuta Sauli niyo amgamba, “Ahimeleki, chindedi nokomwe weye hamwenga na wantu we ikaya ya tati yako.” <verse eid="1SA 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 22:17" />Vikaheza Sauli niyo awagamba wamizi wakwe wendile hampezo hakwe, “Hitukani chani muwakome walavyantambiko wa Zumbe Chohile, kwaviya wevana na Daudi, naho wamanya kugamba kanisumka mna hawanigambile.” Mna wamizi awo hawenule mikono yawo kuwakoma walavyantambiko wa Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="1SA 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 22:18" />Vikaheza, seuta Sauli niyo amlagiza Doegi kulaila komzi wa Edomu, “Hituka weye chani uwakome awo walavyantambiko.” Doegi niyo ahituka aita na kuwakoma walavyantambiko wose. Zuwa idyo Doegi kakoma walavyantambiko milongo mnane na washano, awo nawakavala wasuche wang'aile wakugubika mwe vifuwa. <verse eid="1SA 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 22:19" />Akaheza niyo awakoma kwa sime awekazi wose womzi wa Nobu mzi wa walavyantambiko, wagosi kwa wavyele, wana wadodo na watiti na ng'ombe na mpunda na ngoto.<verse eid="1SA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 22:20" />Mna Abiatali, yumwenga ywa wana chilume wa Ahimeleki, mwana ywa Ahitubu, kachopoka niyo asumkila kwa Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 22:21" />Abiatali kamgambila Daudi kugamba Sauli kawakoma walavyantambiko wa Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="1SA 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 22:22" />Daudi niyo amgamba Abiatali, “Nasivimanya pwilili zuwa diya nimwone Doegi kulaila komzi wa Edomu, kugamba namgambile Sauli. Ivyo miye sihosa file ya awantu we ikaya ya iso. <verse eid="1SA 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 22:23" />Weye ikala hamwenga na miye, naho usekogoha. Kwaviya uyo akuzungula akukome iviya anizungula miye nami anikome. Unekala na miye nawikale mpeho.”<verse eid="1SA 22:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="1SA 23" />
  <para style="s">Daudi aukombola umzi wa Keila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 23:1" />Daudi niyo agambigwa, “Tegeleza Wafilisiti wawebunga umzi wa Keila naho wapolaganya ngano ihetigwe kweviwasa vyo kuhetela.” <verse eid="1SA 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 23:2" />Ivyo, Daudi niyo amuza Zumbe Chohile, “Togola, nite hawebunge wano Wafilisiti?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 23:2">Zumbe Chohile amhitula, “Heye, hita kawebunge na kukombola umzi wa Keila.”<verse eid="1SA 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 23:3" />Mna wantu wa Daudi niyo wamgamba, “Ivino chihano Yuda chogoha, navitende vivihi umo chinaita komzi wa Keila na kuwebunga wagomba nkondo wa Wafilisiti?” <verse eid="1SA 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 23:4" />Daudi niyo amuza vituhu Zumbe Chohile, Zumbe Chohile amgamba, “Seleza wite Keila, kwaviya nahwinke uhuda mwa Wafilisiti.” <verse eid="1SA 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 23:5" />Ivyo, Daudi niyo aita Keila hamwenga na wantu wakwe, uko niyo agomba nkondo na Wafilisiti, kawakoma Wafilisiti walozize na kutaha ng'ombe zilozize. Ivyo, Daudi kawakombola wantu wo umzi wa Keila.<verse eid="1SA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 23:6" />Abiatali mwana ywa Ahimeleki eze asumkile kwa Daudi uko Keila, nakaita na kasuche kang'aile kakugubika mwe chifuwa kaulavyantambiko.<verse eid="1SA 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 23:7" />Sauli eze agambilwe kugamba Daudi kabula kale komzi wa Keila, agamba, “Zumbe Chohile kaninka uhuda kwaviya kevugaila mwenye kwa kwingila mwe mzi una nchili ina mihindo.” <verse eid="1SA 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 23:8" />Ivyo, Sauli niyo awetanga wagomba nkondo waite komzi wa Keila chani wakamtandame Daudi na wantu wakwe.<verse eid="1SA 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 23:9" />Daudi eze eve imizungu ihiye ya Sauli mwakwe, niyo amgamba mlavyantambiko Abiatali, “Nigaila hano ako akasuche koulavyantambiko.” <verse eid="1SA 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 23:10" />Vikaheza, Daudi niyo alombeza, “Weye Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywa Izulaeli, chindedi miye mndima ywako, siva kugamba Sauli kekamba eze aubalange umzi wa Keila kwaviya miye nimuno. <verse eid="1SA 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 23:11" />Togola, wekazi womzi wa Keila nawanigale kwa Sauli? Togola, Sauli nasele chindedi saivyo miye mndima ywako nivile? Weye Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywa Izulaeli, nakulombeza unihitule miye mndima ywako.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 23:11">Zumbe Chohile niyo amhitula, “Sauli neze.”<verse eid="1SA 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 23:12" />Daudi niyo amuza vituhu, “Togola, wekazi wa Keila nawanigale kwa Sauli miye hamwenga na awantu wangu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 23:12">Zumbe Chohile niyo amhitula, “Heye, nawakwigale kwa Sauli.”<verse eid="1SA 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 23:13" />Vikaheza, Daudi na wantu wakwe wakwinga saviya magana mtandatu niyo wahalawa waite hohose wadahile kwita. Sauli eze eve kugamba Daudi kasumka kale kulawa Keila, niyo aleka imizungu yakwe yose.<verse eid="1SA 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sauli amzungula Daudi kweisi ya amagulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 23:14" />Ivyo, Daudi niyo asigaila kwengome uko kwedijangwa kweisi ya amagulu ye nyika ya Zifu. Chila zuwa Sauli nendile akamzungula Daudi, mna Zumbe Chohile hamlekile Daudi agwilwe ni Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 23:15" />Zuwa dimwenga Daudi akatenda ehaguhi na Holeshi niyo eva kugamba Sauli aita Zifu akumlonda chani amkome.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 23:15">Daudi kasigaila kwenyika ya Zifu uko Holeshi. <verse eid="1SA 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 23:16" />Yonasani mwana ywa Sauli niyo ambasa Daudi uko Holeshi, amjela moyo kugamba Chohile akwamila. <verse eid="1SA 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 23:17" />Yonasani amgamba, “Usekogoha, tate Sauli hakugwile. Weye notende seuta ywa Izulaeli, miye nanitende ywa kaidi ywako mo useuta. Hata tate Sauli imbuli ino kaimanya.” <verse eid="1SA 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 23:18" />Awo wose waidi, niyo wadamanya lagano kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile. Vikaheza, Daudi niyo asigaila komzi wa Holeshi, Yonasani niyo auya kokaya.<verse eid="1SA 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 23:19" />Umo Sauli echei uko komzi wa Gibeya, wekazi womzi wa Zifu, wambasa na kumgamba, “Daudi efisa mweisi yetu mwe ngome uko Holeshi kolugulu lwa Hakila wi ntendele ya kwamwenyemzi ya Yeshimoni. <verse eid="1SA 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 23:20" />Haluse, seuta sela chani udamanye chiya ukunga, suwe nachimgwile Daudi na kukwinka weye seuta.”<verse eid="1SA 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 23:21" />Sauli niyo awahitula, “Chindedi nyuwe mwanifila mbazi. Mjimbikwe ni Zumbe Chohile. <verse eid="1SA 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 23:22" />Hitani vituhu mkavuzagize kukaula chani mmanye aho akwefisa na uyo mntu amwone ahantu aho, kwaviya sigambilwa kugamba mntu uyo ni mbala vitendese. <verse eid="1SA 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 23:23" />Zuzisani chila ntendele chani mmanye ahantu akwefisa, mkaheza mwize mnigambile. Haheza nanite hamwenga na nyuwe, hegu ache yuko, miye nanimzungule mwe izinkolo zose zimweisi ya Yuda.”<verse eid="1SA 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 23:24" />Niyo wahalawa waita komzi wa Zifu, wamlongoila Sauli. Chipindi icho, Daudi na wantu wakwe nendile wekwenyika ya Maoni, kwedibwandasi dya Alaba ntendele ya kwamwenyemzi ya Yeshimoni. <verse eid="1SA 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 23:25" />Sauli na wantu wakwe niyo wakonga kumzungula Daudi. Mna Daudi eze eve imbuli iyo niyo akwefisa kwezinyuwe zendile kwenyika ya Maoni na kwikala uko. Sauli eze eve imbuli iyo, niyo akumzungula Daudi uko kwenyika ya Maoni. <verse eid="1SA 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 23:26" />Sauli na wantu wakwe nendile we ntendele imwenga yo lugulu lwa luwe, Daudi na wantu wakwe nendile we ntendele intuhu yo lugulu. Umo Daudi akaguluka kumsumka Sauli, Sauli nendile ehaguhi na kumgwila Daudi. <verse eid="1SA 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 23:27" />Aho, mntu yumwenga niyo ambasa Sauli amgamba, “Sunguza wize, Wafilisiti wayebunga isi.” <verse eid="1SA 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 23:28" />Ivyo, Sauli niyo aleka kumtimila Daudi, aita akutowana na Wafilisiti. Nivyo vikuleka hantu aho hetangwa Sela Hamahilekoti, nivyo kugamba, “Luwe lwa kusopana.” <verse eid="1SA 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 23:29" />Daudi niyo afosa ahantu aho, aita akwikala kwamafiso yo mzi wa Engedi.<verse eid="1SA 23:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="1SA 24" />
  <para style="s">Daudi aleka kumkoma Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 24:1" />Sauli eze auye akalaila kokugomba nkondo na Wafilisiti, niyo agambilwa kugamba Daudi ekwenyika ya Engedi. <verse eid="1SA 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 24:2" />Ivyo, Sauli niyo awaguha wagomba nkondo elufu ntatu wakankalu wadahise kugomba nkondo kulaila mweisi yose ya Izulaeli, niyo aita akumzungula Daudi na awantu wakwe kuntu kukwitangwa Mbuzi Luwala. <verse eid="1SA 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 24:3" />Sauli niyo abula mwempanga imwenga yendile hajihi na dewa dya ngoto dihampezo hesila, niyo engila umo mwempanga chani azunguluke. Daudi na wantu wakwe nendile wekala mndani mwe impanga iyo. <verse eid="1SA 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 24:4" />Wantu wa Daudi niyo wamgamba, “Zuwa diya akugambile Zumbe Chohile akugambilaga nakwinke uhuda mwa mnkondo ywako dibula, wenawe umdamanye viya ukuwona vyawagila.” Aho, Daudi niyo amnyatila Sauli kwa kunyuma na kukanta kalepe ke isuche yakwe. <verse eid="1SA 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 24:5" />Daudi niyo engilwa ni chihovu mo moyo wakwe kwaviya kakanta kwa chinyele kalepe ke isuche ya Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 24:6" />Niyo awagamba awantu wakwe, “Zumbe Chohile anichinde nisekumdamanyiza vituhu sekulu ywangu ahakigwe mavuta ni Zumbe Chohile mbuli saizo. Sanichuluse mkono wangu umtowe mntu asagulwe ni Zumbe Chohile kwa kuhakwa mavuta.” <verse eid="1SA 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 24:7" />Kwa kulonga ivyo, Daudi kawalemeza awantu wakwe wasekumtowa Sauli.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 24:7">Sauli eze aheze kuzunguluka achimala na kufosa umo mwe mpanga aita zakwe. <verse eid="1SA 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 24:8" />Nyumani, Daudi naye niyo achimala afosa umo mwe mpanga amwitanga Sauli, “Sekulu ywangu seuta!” Seuta Sauli eze ahituke kunyuma, Daudi niyo afika madi kubula hasi kwa kumtunya seuta. <verse eid="1SA 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 24:9" />Vikaheza Daudi amuza Sauli, “Ni mbwani ukuwetegeleza wantu wakugamba miye naunga hukome? <verse eid="1SA 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 24:10" />Haluse kaula mwenye, dyelo kuwona mwenye, umo wendile mwe mpanga Zumbe Chohile nendile kaninka uhuda mwako. Wantu wangu wasiku wanigamba hukome, mna miye sikufila mbazi. Segamba, sanichuluse mkono wangu nimtowe sekulu ywangu kwaviya uyo kasagulwa ni Zumbe Chohile kwa kuhakwa mavuta. <verse eid="1SA 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 24:11" />Tate kaula, kano akalepe ke isuche yako mwemikono yangu, kwa kukanta akalepe ke isuche yako mna sikukomile, haluse wadaha umanye chindedi miye sihiye naho sikudamanyize wihi wowose. Miye sikuhituke hata hegu weye wanihanga unikome. <verse eid="1SA 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 24:12" />Zumbe Chohile achikantile mwetu miye na weye. Uyo akulihize chikoda mna miye sahudamanyize yehiye. <verse eid="1SA 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 24:13" />Kumbuka ulongi wachikale ukugamba, ‘Kwa mtu mwihi kwalawa yehiye, mna sanichuluse mkono wangu sahudamanyize yehiye.’ <verse eid="1SA 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 24:14" />Haluse weye seuta ywa Izulaeli kaula mntu ukunga umkome! Togola, watimila yuhi? Wazungula kuli difile, hegu watimila bilu! <verse eid="1SA 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 24:15" />Ivyo, Zumbe Chohile natende mlamuzi mwetu, achikantile miye na weye. Uyo nakaule imbuli ino anigombele na kunikombola kulawa mwako.”<verse eid="1SA 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 24:16" />Daudi eze abinde ukulonga, Sauli niyo amuza, “Togola, idizwi idyo ni dyako mwanangu Daudi?” Vikaheza, Sauli niyo atula ndilo kwa chinyulu. <verse eid="1SA 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 24:17" />Akaheza amgamba Daudi, “Weye wiywedi kujinka miye, weye kunidamanyiza yedi, mna miye sikudamanyiza yehiye. <verse eid="1SA 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 24:18" />Dyelo kunilagisa ivyo wili ywedi kwangu, hunikomile hata hegu Zumbe Chohile kaninkiza mwako chani unikome. <verse eid="1SA 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 24:19" />Togola, mntu anamgwila mnkondo ywakwe amleka ajende mpeho? Kwa dino unidamanyize, Zumbe Chohile akudamanyize yedi! <verse eid="1SA 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 24:20" />Haluse simanya chindedi kugamba nautende seuta ywa Izulaeli, na useuta wa Izulaeli nautogezwe mwemikono yako. <verse eid="1SA 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 24:21" />Mna nelisiza kwa Zumbe Chohile kugamba welekwa we ikaya yangu howakome no ulukolo lwa tate.” <verse eid="1SA 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 24:22" />Daudi niyo elisa kulongozi kwa Zumbe Chohile kuno Sauli akawona. Vikaheza Sauli niyo auya kwenyumba yakwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 24:22">Mna Daudi na awantu wakwe waita ukudya kwamafiso.<verse eid="1SA 24:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="1SA 25" />
  <para style="s">File ya Samwilu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 25:1" />Ivyo, Samwilu niyo abanika, Waizulaeli wose niyo wechisanya vileke walomboleze ifile yakwe. Niyo wamhamba kwenyumbakwe uko Lama.<verse eid="1SA 25:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi na Abigaili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 25:2" />Kwendaga na mntu yumwenga uko komzi wa Maoni, uyo nendile akataga ngoto komzi wa Kalimeli. Uko Kalimeli nakafuga ngoto zakwe na kuzikanta amazoya. Endaga mgoli vitendese. Endaga na ngoto elufu ntatu na mbuzi elufu imwenga. <verse eid="1SA 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 25:3" />Mntu uyo naketangwa Nabali na mkaziwe naketangwa Abigaili. Abigaili endaga ni mvyele mta akili naho ni mtana. Mna Nabali nendile ni mtu mta maya naho hena mbazi, uyo Nabali alawaga molukolo lwa Kalebu. <verse eid="1SA 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 25:4" />Ivyo, Daudi umo endile uko kwenyika evaga kugamba Nabali akanta mazoya izingoto zakwe uko Kalimeli. <verse eid="1SA 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 25:5" />Ivo, Daudi niyo asigila wabwanga mlongo umwenga awagamba, “Hitani uko Kalimeli mkanilamsize Nabali. <verse eid="1SA 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 25:6" />Mgambeni Daudi akulamsa vino, ‘Wikale kwa utondowazi, weye hamwenga na awantu wose we ikaya yako ne ivintu vyose unanawo. <verse eid="1SA 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 25:7" />Siva kugamba wakanta izingoto zako amazoya, naunga umanye kugamba wadimi wako nendile wehamwenga na suwe, suwe hachiwadamanyize dyodyose dihiye. Naho mazuwa yose wekale hamwenga na suwe uko komzi wa Kalimeli, hawahungukilwe ni chintu. <verse eid="1SA 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 25:8" />Unawauza, nawakugambile. Haluse wafile mbazi awabwanga wangu kwaviya chiza zuwa dya ngasu. Hampu nakweila wenkage chochose unanacho wano awandima wako na miye mwanawo Daudi.’”<verse eid="1SA 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 25:9" />Wadya awabwanga wa Daudi wabula na kumgambila Nabali saviya wasigilwe ni Daudi. Wakaheza niyo wamgoja hadodo. <verse eid="1SA 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 25:10" />Vikaheza Nabali awahitula awandima wa Daudi, “Togola, Daudi ni yuhi? Togola, Mwana ywa Yese ni yuhi? Mazuwa yano kuna wandima walozize wakuwasumka masekulu wawo. <verse eid="1SA 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 25:11" />Togolani, miye niguhe mikate yangu na mazi na nyama niwachinjize wakanta mazoya we izingoto zangu, niwenke wantu simanyize uko walaile?”<verse eid="1SA 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 25:12" />Ivyo wadya wabwanga wa Daudi niyo wauya kwa Daudi na kumgambila ivyo Nabali awahitule. <verse eid="1SA 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 25:13" />Daudi eze eve ivyo, niyo awalagiza awantu wakwe, “Chila yumwenga asomeke isime yakwe mwe yala yakwe ainyinye mwechigudi!” Chila yumwenga niyo asomeka isime yakwe, iviya Daudi naye niyo asomeka isime yakwe, na wantu wakwinga magana mane wamtimila Daudi na wantu wakwinga magana maidi wamila amabundu.<verse eid="1SA 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 25:14" />Mndima yumwenga ywa Nabali niyo amgamba mkaza Nabali akwitangwa Abigaili, “Welewe kwiva? Daudi asigilaga walosi wakwe kulaila kwenyika kumlamsa sekulu ywetu, mna niyo awahuluta. <verse eid="1SA 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 25:15" />Mna awantu awo wachidamanyizaga yedi, hawachidamanyize yehiye, naho mazuwa yose chendaga nawo uko kwenyika, hahana chintu chochose chibaigwe. <verse eid="1SA 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 25:16" />Wachidima chilo na msi mazuwa yose umo chendaga chikadima izingoto zetu. <verse eid="1SA 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 25:17" />Hampu fanyanyanyisa imbuli ino ukaule dyo kudamanya. Imbuli ino yadaha ichigaile nkondo kwa sekulu ywetu na wantu wose we ikaya yakwe. Nabali ni mntu aihise naho hahana mntu akudaha kutamwila naye!”<verse eid="1SA 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 25:18" />Abigaili niyo asunguza, aguha mikate magana maidi na wabuyu waidi wa divai na ngoto shano zimalanywe vyedi na chilo mlongo umwenga na mfungate za lukazingo na wakocha gana dimwenga wa zabibu zinyaile na mikate idamanywe kwa tini magana maidi, vintu vyose ivyo niyo avikweza mwe mpunda. <verse eid="1SA 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 25:19" />Akaheza, Abigaili niyo amgamba yudya mbwanga, “Longola! Miye nakutimila.” Mna hamgambile dyodyose mgosiwe.<verse eid="1SA 25:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 25:20" />Umo akasela mwe mpunda na kuchindwa nu lugulu ntendele imwenga, chipumpa niyo adugana na Daudi hamwenga na awantu wakwe wakatenda waseleza kudya akulawa. <verse eid="1SA 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 25:21" />Daudi nendile akafanyanya, “Miye nahadima ugoli wose wa Nabali kwenyika vya bule naho hahana chintu chagile, mna kaniliha wihi kwavino vyose vyedi nimdamanyize! <verse eid="1SA 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 25:22" />Chohile anikome uneva sina wakomile awagosi mgati mwa awantu wakwe wose luvi hekunati kucha!”<verse eid="1SA 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 25:23" />Abigaili eze amwone Daudi, niyo asunguza kusela mwe mpunda na kufunama kubula hasi. <verse eid="1SA 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 25:24" />Kedula he viga vya Daudi, na kumgamba, “Sekulu ywangu, mlema nautende mwangu du. Nakulombeza unetegeleze miye mdima ywako, nilonge na weye. <verse eid="1SA 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 25:25" />Usekumfanyanya Nabali kwaviya uyo ni mntu ehiye saviya vili idizina dyakwe, nivyo eli. Uyo etangwa Nabali, naho chindedi ni mhezi vitendese. Sekulu ywangu, wadya wabwanga wako usigile, miye mndima ywako siwawone. <verse eid="1SA 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 25:26" />Haluse sekulu ywangu, nelisa kwa Zumbe Chohile mta ujima, na viya weye wimjima, kugamba kwaviya Zumbe Chohile kakuchinda usekuliha chikoda kwa kwitila sakame na kwingila mlema, waleke wankondo wako na wadya wose wakukungila yehiye watende wahezi saviya Nabali. <verse eid="1SA 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 25:27" />Sekulu ywangu nakulombeza hokela dino idijeleko hwigaile, nakuwenka awo wabwanga ukutimilana nawo. <verse eid="1SA 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 25:28" />Nakulombeza nilekeila miye mndima ywako. Zumbe Chohile nakutende seuta weye na awantu we ikaya yako yose, kwaviya weye sekulu ywangu wagomba nkondo ya Zumbe Chohile. Mazuwa yose yo wikazi wako usekubwilwa ni kwang'a dyodyose. <verse eid="1SA 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 25:29" />Kunalaila mntu akukwebunga na kunga kukukoma, Zumbe Chohile nahonye uwikazi wako hamwenga na wata ujima. Mna wikazi wa wankondo wako nauduile hale saviya mntu akudula nkumbayuwe. <verse eid="1SA 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 25:30" />Umo Zumbe Chohile nakudamanyize yose yedi saviya akugambile na kukusagula utende seuta ywa Izulaeli, <verse eid="1SA 25:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 25:31" />weye sekulu ywangu, hotende na luhosa lwa kungumilwa hegu chihovu kulawana na kukoma kwa kuwadamanyiza yehiye. Mna sekulu ywangu, Zumbe Chohile anakudamanyiza wedi uwo, nakweila usekunijala miye mndima ywako.”<verse eid="1SA 25:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 25:32" />Daudi niyo amgamba Abigaili, “Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywa Izulaeli ajimbikwe, uyo akusigile uchintane na miye vino dyelo. <verse eid="1SA 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 25:33" />Namtogola Zumbe Chohile akwinkile ubala wa kunichinda nisekwita kwitila sakame na kulihiza chikoda miye mwenye. <verse eid="1SA 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 25:34" />Kwa ukanuni, Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywa Izulaeli, kanichinda nisekukudamanyiza dihiye. Hegu hwasunguze kwiza kuchintana na miye, chindedi luvi mtondo hakwasigale mtu yoyose mjima, Nabali na awantu wakwe wose.” <verse eid="1SA 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 25:35" />Akaheza, Daudi niyo ahokela ivintu vyose ivyo egailwe ni Abigaili, Daudi niyo amgamba “Abigaili, Uya mpeho kwekaya yako. Kaula, miye mbuli zose ulongile siziva, nanidamanye yadya yose ulongile.”<verse eid="1SA 25:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 25:36" />Abigaili niyo auya kukaya, ambwila Nabali adamanya ngasu nkulu kunyumba kwakwe saviya ngasu ya chiseuta. Nabali nendile kelelwa vidala mo moyo wakwe kwaviya nendile kakoleswa. Ivyo, Abigaili hamgambile dyodyose Nabali kubula mtondo. <verse eid="1SA 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 25:37" />Mtondo wakwe, Abigaile eze awone mgosiwe kaleukwa ni idivai, niyo amgambila izimbuli zose, ahadya Nabali niyo etuka na kuholomala saviya yuwe. <verse eid="1SA 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 25:38" />Mazuwa mlongo yatimile Zumbe Chohile niyo amtowa Nabali vyaleka abanika.<verse eid="1SA 25:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 25:39" />Daudi eze eve kugamba Nabali kabanika, niyo agamba, “Atogolwe Zumbe Chohile uyo amlihize chikoda Nabali kwa kunihuluta miye. Zumbe Chohile kamkantila Nabali ko wihi wakwe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 25:39">Vikaheza, Daudi niyo asigila wantu wakalavye wamlombele Abigaili atende mkaziwe. <verse eid="1SA 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 25:40" />Wandima wa Daudi weze wabule kwa Abigaili uko Kalimeli, wamgamba, “Daudi kachisigila chikuguhe utende mkaziwe.”<verse eid="1SA 25:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 25:41" />Abigaili niyo achimala, enema kubula hasi kulongozi kwawo agamba, “Miye ni mndima du, semalanya kuzumila kulombwa ni sekulu ywangu.” <verse eid="1SA 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 25:42" />Abigaili niyo asunguza, enuka na kukwela impunda yakwe, atimilana na wandima wakwe washano wa chiche, waita na wandima wa Daudi, Abigaili niyo atenda mkaza Daudi.<verse eid="1SA 25:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 25:43" />Iviya, Daudi niyo amsola Ahonoamu kulaila komzi wa Yezileeli. Ivyo awo wose waidi niyo watenda wakazize. <verse eid="1SA 25:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 25:44" />Chipindi icho, Sauli nendile kamloza mchiche ywakwe Mikali, uyo endile mkaza Daudi kwa Paliti mwana ywa Laishi kulaila komzi wa Galimu.<verse eid="1SA 25:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="1SA 26" />
  <para style="s">Daudi aleka kumkoma vituhu Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 26:1" />Wantu wasiku kulaila komzi wa Zifu wambasaga Sauli uko Gibeya na kumgambila kugamba, Daudi kefisa mwe mpanga kolugulu lwa Hakila lukusinyana no mzi wa Yeshimoni. <verse eid="1SA 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 26:2" />Vikaheza, Sauli niyo asagula wagomba nkondo wakankalu elufu ntatu mweisi ya Izulaeli waita kwenyika ya Zifu wakamzungule Daudi, <verse eid="1SA 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 26:3" />Sauli na wagomba nkondo wakwe waika lago dyawo mnkanda mwesila ya kolugulu lwa Hakila. Mna Daudi endaga achei kwenyika, eze abunkule kugamba Sauli keza chani amzungule, <verse eid="1SA 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 26:4" />niyo egala wapelembi, niyo agambilwa nichindedi Sauli kabula kale. <verse eid="1SA 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 26:5" />Daudi niyo afosa aita hantu Sauli ekiye idilago. Niyo abunkula ahantu aho Sauli na Abuneli mwana ywa Neli, sekulu ywa wagomba nkondo wa Sauli, nendile kagona hajihi na Sauli. Sauli nendile kagona hagatigati hedilago kuno kazungulukwa na awagomba nkondo wakwe.<verse eid="1SA 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 26:6" />Akaheza, Daudi niyo amuza Ahimeleki endaga Mhiti, na Abishai endaga mkuluwe dya Yoabu mami yawo naketangwa Seluya, “Niyuhi nalongozane na miye kwita kwe dilago dya Sauli?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:6">Abishai amhitula, “Miye nanite hamwenga na weye.”<verse eid="1SA 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 26:7" />Ivyo umo nechilo Daudi na Abishai niyo wengila mwe dilago dya Sauli, wambwila Sauli kagona hagatigati he dilago ne diguha dyakwe ditungwa hasi haguhi no umtwi wakwe. Abuneli hamwenga na wagomba nkondo nendile wagona wamzunguluka. <verse eid="1SA 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 26:8" />Abishai niyo amtakalisa Daudi, “Ichilo chino, Chohile kamwinkiza mwako. Haluse goja nimtunge lumwenga du vileke idiguha dilaiile, sanivuzagize kaidi!”<verse eid="1SA 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 26:9" />Mna Daudi niyo amgamba Abishai, “Usekumkoma! Zumbe Chohile namkantile mntu yoyose na chuluse umkono wakwe amkome mndima ywakwe asagule kutenda seuta kwa kumhaka mavuta.” <verse eid="1SA 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 26:10" />Daudi niyo agamba, “Nelisa kwa Zumbe Chohile mta umjima, Zumbe Chohile mwenye namkome Sauli, umo chipindi chakwe cho kubanika chikabula hegu naite kwenkondo na kubanikila uko. <verse eid="1SA 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 26:11" />Mna Zumbe Chohile anilemeza nise kujeza kumlumiza mntu yudya Zumbe Chohile asagule atende seuta! Mna chiguhe idiguha dyakwe na kuguha idibuyu dyakwe dya amazi, chikaheza chihalaweni.” <verse eid="1SA 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 26:12" />Ivyo, Daudi niyo aguha idiguha na kuguha idibuyu dya amazi haguhi no mtwi wa Sauli, wahalawa na Abishai. Hahana mntu hata yumwenga awone hegu abunkule imbuli iyo ivyo itendeke hegu enuke, kwaviya Zumbe Chohile awatendaga wose wagonese.<verse eid="1SA 26:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 26:13" />Akaheza, niyo Daudi aita adeluka intendele ya kaidi ye idibwandasi idyo na kukwela kolunenengwa lo lugulu, hale ne idilago dya Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 26:14" />Vikaheza Daudi niyo awetanga awagomba nkondo wa Sauli na Abuneli mwana ywa Neli, akagamba, “Welewe Abuneli waniva?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:14">Abuneli amhitula, “Weye wiyuhi ukumwitanga seuta?”<verse eid="1SA 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 26:15" />Daudi amuza, “Togola, weye wi mkankalu? Togola, ni yuhi akuligana na weye mweisi ya Izulaeli? Ni mbwani humwamile sekulu ywako seuta? Mntu yumwenga kulaila mwetu keza niyo engila aho chani amkome sekulu ywako seuta. <verse eid="1SA 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 26:16" />Abuneli ino imbuli ukudamanya siyo yedi. Nelisa kwa Zumbe Chohile mta ujima, weye na awantu wako mwaungwa mkomwe, kwaviya hamumwamile sekulu ywenu. Haluse kaulani aho mwili, idiguha dya seuta dikuhi na akabuyu ka amazi vyendile hajihi no umtwi wakwe vikuhi?” <verse eid="1SA 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 26:17" />Sauli niyo abunkula idizwi dya Daudi na kumuza, “Togola, idizwi idyo ni dya mwanangu Daudi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:17">Daudi amhitula, “Heye, sekulu ywangu idizwi idyo ni dyangu.” <verse eid="1SA 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 26:18" />Niyo ajendeleza kulonga, “Mna ni mbwani sekulu ywangu uchei kunitimila, miye mndima ywako? Sitenda mbwani? Sibalanga ulosi wani? <verse eid="1SA 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 26:19" />Haluse sekulu ywangu, nitegeleza ivyo hunga nilonge. Uneva ni Zumbe Chohile akugambile wize unikome, ahokela lavyo nadimtende ahitwile izifanyanyi zakwe chani uleke kunitimila, mna uneva ni wantu wakuluvize, Zumbe Chohile awaligite awantu awo, kwaviya wanibalaza mwe ulisi we isi idya Zumbe Chohile aninkile, wakagamba, ‘Hita ukaisankanile milungu mituhu ya chijeni.’ <verse eid="1SA 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 26:20" />Unase kunasa hakomelwa mwesi ya chijeni, hale na Zumbe Chohile. Ni mbwani weye seuta ywa Izulaeli ukunicheseka saviya mntu akucheseka nkwale ya kolugulu?”<verse eid="1SA 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 26:21" />Akaheza Sauli amhitula, “Miye sibalanga. Uya, Mwanangu, Daudi! Sahulumize vituhu, kwaviya mwechilo cha dyelo kunileka mjima. Miye ni hezi vitendese! Sidamanya mbuli ihise!”<verse eid="1SA 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 26:22" />Daudi amhitula, “Weye seuta idiguha dyako dino dihano, sigila mgomba nkondo ywako yumwenga eze adiguhe. <verse eid="1SA 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 26:23" />Zumbe Chohile amjeleka chila mntu mo uwagilwa wakwe adamanye na ukanuni wakwe. Dyelo Zumbe Chohile kakwinkiza mwangu, mna miye sikomile kwaviya Zumbe Chohile kakusagula weye utende seuta kwa kukuhaka mavuta. <verse eid="1SA 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 26:24" />Saviya vino dyelo sikukomile namlombeza Zumbe Chohile anambule mwe izinkunto zose!”<verse eid="1SA 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 26:25" />Sauli niyo amgamba Daudi, “Mwanangu Daudi Chohile akujimbike! Wenawe nodamanye mbuli nkulu nawe nohude!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:25">Ivyo Daudi niyo ahalawa, na Sauli niyo auya kwe kaya yakwe.<verse eid="1SA 26:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="1SA 27" />
  <para style="s">Daudi ekala kwa Wafilisiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 27:1" />Daudi niyo elongela mwenye, “Zuwa dimwenga Sauli nanikome. Mbuli yedi kwangu ni kusumkila kweisi ya Wafilisiti. Sauli nengile chevu kunizungula mndani na mwe mihaka ye isi ya Izulaeli, miye nanikale mpeho.” <verse eid="1SA 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 27:2" />Ivyo, Daudi na wantu wakwe magana mtandatu waita kwa Akishi mwana ywa Maoki, seuta ywa Gati. <verse eid="1SA 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 27:3" />Daudi na wantu wakwe hamwenga na wantu we ikaya yakwe wekala na Akishi uko komzi wa Gati. Daudi endaga na wavyele waidi, Ahinoamu kulaila Yezileeli na Abigaili mvyele abanikilwe ni mgosiwe Nabali kulaila komzi wa Kalimeli. <verse eid="1SA 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 27:4" />Sauli eze eve kugamba, Daudi kasumkila komzi wa Gati, hamzungule vituhu.<verse eid="1SA 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 27:5" />Zuwa dimwenga, Daudi niyo amgamba Akishi, “Hegu kuniumila nakulombeza ninka mzi umwenga mweisi yako chani hatende ni hantu hangu hakwikala. Havikuwagila miye nikale na weye muno mo mzi ukwikala weye seuta.” <verse eid="1SA 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 27:6" />Zuwa idyo, Akishi niyo amwinka Daudi umzi wa Sikilagi. Ivyo kukongela zuwa idyo mzi wa Sikilagi utenda wa maseuta wa Yuda. <verse eid="1SA 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 27:7" />Daudi ekalaga mweisi ya Wafilisiti kwa mhilimo umwenga na myezi mine.<verse eid="1SA 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 27:8" />Mwa amazuwa ayo yose, Daudi na wantu wakwe wawebunga Wageshuli na Wagilizi na Waamaleki, awo wendaga nawo wekazi we imizi iyo kukongela chikale. Kawebunga mweisi yawo kubula Shuli mo mhaka na Misili. <verse eid="1SA 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 27:9" />Daudi katowa imizi awantu wa Wageshuli na Wagilizi na Waamaleki hasigaze hata mntu yumwenga akatenda mjima, atende mgosi hegu mvyele, kataha ngoto na ng'ombe na mpunda na ngamiya na suche, akaheza niyo auya abula kwa Akishi. <verse eid="1SA 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 27:10" />Akishi eze amuze Daudi, “Dyelo kuwebunga wahi?” Daudi kazigiliza kugamba, “Siyebunga ntendele ya kwamwenyemzi ya Yuda, hegu ntendele ya kwamwenyemzi wakwikala Wayelimeli hegu ntendele ya kwamwenyemzi wakwikala Wakeni.” <verse eid="1SA 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 27:11" />Daudi hasigaze mntu yoyose mjima, atende mgosi hegu mvyele chani egalwe komzi wa Gati, nendile kafanyanya mwenye, kugamba, “Wadaha watambalise mbuli zetu wakagamba, ‘Daudi kadamanya vino na viya.’ Nivyo Daudi azwelaga kudamanya mazuwa yose nendile akekala kweisi ya Wafilisiti.” <verse eid="1SA 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 27:12" />Ivyo, Akishi niyo amzumila Daudi, akelongela mwenye, akagamba, “Waizulaeli weyawe wamwihiwa vitendese, ivyo, nanisankanile miye mo wikazi wakwe wose.”<verse eid="1SA 27:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="1SA 28" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 28:1" />Chipindi chisiku chize chijinke, Wafilisiti niyo wachisanya wagomba nkondo na Waizulaeli. Akishi amgamba Daudi, “Waungwa uvimanye kugamba weye hamwenga na wagomba nkondo wako mwaungwa mwambizane na miye chiwebunge wano Waizulaeli.” <verse eid="1SA 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 28:2" />Daudi amhitula Akishi, “Ni chindedi, miye ni mndima ywako nowone ivyo hunga ni wadamanye.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:2">Akishi amgamba, “Ni vyedi! Miye nahutende utende mwamizi ywangu mwenye mazuwa yose.”<verse eid="1SA 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sauli akusinya mnamulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 28:3" />Ivyo, Samwilu eze abanike, Waizulaeli wose wamomboleza na kumhamba uko Lama kwe kaya yakwe. Sauli niyo awabalaza wazuza na wasai wose mweisi ya Izulaeli.<verse eid="1SA 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 28:4" />Wafilisiti niyo wechisanya na kuzenga lago dyawo haguhi no mzi wa Shunemu, Sauli naye niyo awachisanya Waizulaeli wose na kuzenga lago dyawo kolugulu lwa Gilibowa. <verse eid="1SA 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 28:5" />Umo Sauli eze awone awankondo wa Wafilisiti, niyo ogoha na kuzingiza kwa nkama nendile ananayo mo moyo wakwe. <verse eid="1SA 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 28:6" />Sauli niyo amlombeza ulangilizi Zumbe Chohile, mna Zumbe Chohile hajezize kumhitula mpwii, vikatenda kwa sozi hegu kwa mayuwe ya tegatega yakwitangwa Ulimu hegu kwa wawoni wakwe. <verse eid="1SA 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 28:7" />Akaheza, Sauli niyo etanga awandima wakwe, “Nizungwilani mvyele akudaha kutowa mnamulo, chani nite akanikawile.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:7">Wandima wakwe niyo wamhitula wamgamba, “Uko kwekaya ya Endolo kuna mvyele yumwenga akusinya mnamulo.”<verse eid="1SA 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 28:8" />Ivyo Sauli niyo ehitula avika suche ntuhu chani asekumanyika kugamba ni seuta, kaita hamwenga na wantu wakwe waidi. Wabula kwa uyo mvyele na kagogoza, Sauli eze bule amgamba, “Nikawila kwa wazimu, unigaile mntu yoyose huzungula.”<verse eid="1SA 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 28:9" />Uyo mvyele niyo amgamba, “Chindedi weye kuvimanya ivyo seuta Sauli adamanye, kawabalaza mweisi ya Izulaeli wadya wose wata mpepo za uzuza. Nimbwani wanitegela chani unikome?”<verse eid="1SA 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 28:10" />Vikaheza, Sauli niyo elisa kwa zina dya Zumbe Chohile akagamba. “Nelisa kwa zina dya Zumbe Chohile mta ujima kugamba hahana nkanto yoyose nokantilwe kwa dino nodamanye.”<verse eid="1SA 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 28:11" />Vikaheza, uyo mvyele amuza, “Ni yuhi ukunga hwitangile kulawa uko kwedibome hedine uhelo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:11">Sauli amhitula, “Nigaila Samwilu.”<verse eid="1SA 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 28:12" />Yudya mvyele eze amuwone Samwilu niyo aguta lukunga amgamba Sauli, “Ni mbwani ukanidanta? Weye ni seuta Sauli!”<verse eid="1SA 28:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 28:13" />Seuta Sauli amgamba, “Usekogoha! Wawona chibwani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:13">Yudya mvyele amhitula, “Nawona mzimu ukulawa mwe sanga.”<verse eid="1SA 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 28:14" />Sauli amuza, “Uwo wikala vivihi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:14">Yudya mvyele niyo amhitula, “Ni mgosi mdalahala akwela kulanga kavala juba.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:14">Vikaheza Sauli niyo abunkula kugamba ni Samwilu, Sauli niyo afunamila hasi kubula kwe isanga kwa kumtunya.<verse eid="1SA 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 28:15" />Samwilu amgamba Sauli, “Ni mbwani ukunitubwadisa kunigala kuno kweisi kulawa kwedibome hedine uhelo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:15">Sauli niyo amhitula, “Miye nina nkunto zikulise, Wafilisiti wagomba nkondo na miye, naho Zumbe Chohile kanasa. Hakunihitula vituhu kwa sila ya waoni hegu sozi. Nivyo vikuleka sikwitanga unigambile dyo kudamanya.”<verse eid="1SA 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 28:16" />Samwilu amuza, “Ni mbwani ukunga ulangilizi mwangu kuno Zumbe Chohile akulekile naho kakutenda mnkondo ywakwe? <verse eid="1SA 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 28:17" />Zumbe Chohile kakutendela chiya akugambile kujinkila kwangu. Zumbe Chohile kausa useuta mwako na kumwinka Daudi ahantu hako. <verse eid="1SA 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 28:18" />Kwaviya weye hutimile isigilizi ya Zumbe Chohile yakuwakoma Waameleki. Nivyo vikuleka vino dyelo Zumbe Chohile kakujeseza yano. <verse eid="1SA 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 28:19" />Zumbe Chohile nakwike weye hamwenga na Waizulaeli wose mwemikono ya Wafilisiti. Luvi weye na wanawo namtende hamwenga na miye, iviya, Zumbe Chohile nawatende awagomba nkondo wa Izulaeli wahudwe ni Wafilisiti.”<verse eid="1SA 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 28:20" />Aho Sauli niyo ogoha kuno akazingiza agwa hasi kubula mwe sanga kwachiya Samwilu alongile. Sauli nendile kasokela, kwaviya hadile chintu chochose chilo na msi. <verse eid="1SA 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 28:21" />Yudya mvyele niyo amsogeila Sauli amwona azingiza na kumgamba, “Hampu, sekulu ywangu, miye mndima ywako sihosa ujima wangu kwa kudamanya chiya unigambile. <verse eid="1SA 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 28:22" />Haluse hampu damanya viya hulombeze. Goja hwambikile nkande udye, chani utende na nguvu za kujendeleza ne intambo yako.”<verse eid="1SA 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 28:23" />Mna Sauli kalemela na kumgamba, “Sanidye.” Mna awandima wakwe hamwenga na yudya mvyele wamhembeleza chani adye. Niyo awazumila vyaleka adya. Ivyo niyo azumila enuka kulawa hadya hasi ekala mo lusazi. <verse eid="1SA 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 28:24" />Yudya mvyele endaga na kadama kakwe kadamane niyo asunguza kukachinja. Akaheza aguha unga we ngano autonyanga, na koka mkate heugwaduswe. <verse eid="1SA 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 28:25" />Kamwigaila Sauli na awandima wakwe, nawo niyo wadya. Weze wakaheza niyo wahalawa ichilo icho.<verse eid="1SA 28:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="1SA 29" />
  <para style="s">Daudi alemelwa ni Wafilisiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 29:1" />Wafilisiti nawachisanya wagomba nkondo wawo wose uko Afeka na Waizulaeli nawaika lago dyawo kwe sokwe ye idikolongo dya Yezileeli. <verse eid="1SA 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 29:2" />Umo amasekulu washano wa wagomba nkondo wa Wafilisiti wakajinka na amabunga yawo ya wantu magana na maelufu, Daudi akatenda na wantu wakwe hamwenga na Akishi nendile wakawatimila mnyuma. <verse eid="1SA 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 29:3" />Masekulu wa awagomba nkondo wa Wafilisiti niyo wauza, “Wano Waebulaniya hano watenda mbwani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 29:3">Akishi niyo awahitula awo masekulu wa Wafilisiti, “Yuno ni Daudi mndima ywa Sauli seuta ywa Izulaeli, yuno kekala na miye mihilimo ilozize. Kukongela aho asumkile hano hangu kubula vino haluse simuwone na lema dyodyose.”<verse eid="1SA 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 29:4" />Mna masekulu wa wagomba nkondo wa Wafilisiti niyo wamwonela maya Akishi, wamgamba, “Mvuze aite ahantu umwinkile ekale. Asekujeza kwita kwenkondo hamwenga na suwe, hegu sivyo umo nkondo ikagombwa adaha achihituke na kutenda mnkondo ywetu. Hukuwona kugamba mntu yuno adaha kupata sila yedi ya kwivana na sekulu ywakwe vikaheza atenda mnkondo ywetu kwenkondo? <verse eid="1SA 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 29:5" />Togola, yuno mntu gamba nuyudya Daudi mbuli zakwe zichemigwe ni wavyele umo wakavina, ‘Sauli kakoma maelufu mna Daudi kakoma milongo maelufu.’”<verse eid="1SA 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 29:6" />Akishi niyo amwitanga Daudi na kumgamba, “Nelisa kwa Zumbe Chohile mta ujima, kugamba weye kutenda mkanuni mwangu. Nendile ni mbuli ikuwagila mwangu chitanye kwenkondo, kwaviya siwone mbuli yoyose ihiye mwako kukongela zuwa diya wizile hano hangu kubula vino dyelo. Mna masekulu wa nkondo wana nkama na weye. <verse eid="1SA 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 29:7" />Ivyo, haluse uya kaya. Jenda mpeho vileke usekuwajela maya amasekulu wa Wafilisiti.”<verse eid="1SA 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 29:8" />Daudi niyo amuza Akishi, “Icho nibalange ni chihi? Seivyo ukulonga kugamba huniwone na lema dyodyose kukongela zuwa diya nikongile kukusankanila kubula dyelo, ni bwani nisekwita hagombe nkondo na wankondo wa sekulu ywangu seuta?<verse eid="1SA 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 29:9" />Sivimanya kugamba huna lema kulongozi kwangu saviya mndima ywa kwembingu ywa Chohile. Mna masekulu wa nkondo wa Wafilisiti wagamba, ‘Asekujeza kwita kwenkondo hamwenga na suwe.’ <verse eid="1SA 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 29:10" />Haluse, luvi mtondo weye hamwenga na awandima wa sekulu ywako Sauli wihamwenga nawo, inukani mhalawe umo kukacha.”<verse eid="1SA 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 29:11" />Ivyo, mtondo zuwa ditimile, Daudi hamwenga na awantu wakwe niyo wahalawa na kuya kweisi ya Wafilisiti. Mna Wafilisiti awo niyo waita Yezileeli.<verse eid="1SA 29:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="1SA 30" />
  <para style="s">Daudi awahuda Waamaleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 30:1" />Mazuwa matatu yeze yomboke, Daudi na wantu wakwe niyo wauya kwe kaya ya Sikilagi. Waamaleki nendile wayebunga intendele ya kwamwenyemzi ya Sigiligali ya Yuda niyo waitimpa moto. <verse eid="1SA 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 30:2" />Wataha wavyele na wantu wose wendile momzi uwo, wakulu kwa wadodo. Awo watahigwe hawakomigwe, mna wahalawa nawo wakatenda wajima, hawakomile mntu yoyose. <verse eid="1SA 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 30:3" />Daudi na awantu wakwe eze wabule Sikilagi, wabwila umzi wose utimpwa moto naho wavyele wawo na wana wawo wachilume na wachiche watahigwa. <verse eid="1SA 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 30:4" />Daudi na awantu wakwe niyo watula ndilo, hawanyamale kubula wahwa. <verse eid="1SA 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 30:5" />Wakaza Daudi wose waidi, Ahinoamu kulaila Yezileeli na Abigaili mwasigwa ywa Nabali kulaila komzi wa Kalimeli iviya wose nendile watahigwa.<verse eid="1SA 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 30:6" />Daudi endaga mwe nkunto ikulise kwaviya wantu wakwe wendaga na chinyulu mwe myoyo yawo kwaviya waza wana wawo, ivyo wamtisa kumtowa mayuwe. Mna Daudi kenka moyo kwa kumwikiya msuhi Zumbe Chohile, Chohile ywakwe. <verse eid="1SA 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 30:7" />Daudi niyo amgamba Abiatali, mlavyantambiko, mwana ywa Ahimeleki, “Hampu kalete akasuche koulavyantambiko.” Abiatali niyo amwigaila. <verse eid="1SA 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 30:8" />Daudi niyo amuza ulangilizi Zumbe Chohile, “Togola! Bunga idyo dya amanakwili niditimile? Togola nanidibwile?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 30:8">Zumbe Chohile niyo amhitula, “Watimile, kwaviya nowabwile na kuwambula awantu awo watahigwe.”<verse eid="1SA 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 30:9" />Ivyo Daudi niyo ahalawa hamwenga na wadya awantu magana mtandatu endile nawo. Weze wabule kwakamto ka Besoli, wamwenga wawo wasigala aho. <verse eid="1SA 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 30:10" />Mna Daudi niyo ahikiliza kuditimila diya idibunga akatenda na wantu magana mane, wantu magana maidi wasigaila aho, kwaviya nawasokelesa, wadunduga kudeluka kadya akamto ka Besoli. <verse eid="1SA 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 30:11" />Wadya awantu wendaga na Daudi wambwilaga mntu yumwenga Mmisili kwenyika niyo wamwigala kwa Daudi. Mntu uyo nendile hadile chintu chochose hegukunywa kwa mazuwa matatu, chilo na msi. <verse eid="1SA 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 30:12" />Ivyo niyo wamwika mkate na mazi, iviya wamwinka kabesu kamkate wa tini na vikocha vidi vya zabibu zinyaile. Eze aheze ukudya niyo apata nguvu. <verse eid="1SA 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 30:13" />Daudi amuza, “Sekulu ywako ni yuhi? Naho kulaila kuhi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 30:13">Niyo awahitula, “Miye ni mbwanga ywa Misili. Ni mndima ywa Mwamaleki yumwenga. Sekulu ywangu kanasa kunyuma mazuwa matatu yajinkile kwaviya nendaga mnyonje. <verse eid="1SA 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 30:14" />Suwe nachiyebunga imizi ya Wakeleti intendele ya kwamwenyemzi yaa Yuda hamwenga ne ntendele ya kwamwenyemzi ye imizi wakwikala ulukolo lwa Kalebu. Niyo chautimpa moto umzi wa ntendele ya kwamwenyemzi Sikilagi.”<verse eid="1SA 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 30:15" />Daudi niyo amuza, “Togola, wadaha kunigala kwedibunga idyo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 30:15">Mbwanga uyo niyo amhitula, “Heye nadaha hwigale uko weli, mna ndakwelisa kwa zina dya Zumbe Chohile kugamba honikome hegu kuninkiza kwa sekulu ywangu.” <verse eid="1SA 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 30:16" />Yudya mbwanga niyo amlongoza Daudi kubula uko dili idibunga dya amanyakwili.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 30:16">Eze wabule uko wawabwila watahi wazagala chila hantu, kwaviya nendile wakadya na kunywa kwachausa cha viya watahile kulaila mweisi ya Wafilisiti na mweisi ya Yuda navilozesa. <verse eid="1SA 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 30:17" />Daudi kagomba nkondo kukongela mtondo chilohilo kubula chisingi. Hahana mgosi yoyose ahonile ukaleka wabwanga magana mane wakweile ngamiya na kusumka. <verse eid="1SA 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 30:18" />Daudi kahonya chila chintu chitahigwe ni Wameleki, hamwenga na wakazize waidi. <verse eid="1SA 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 30:19" />Hahana chintu chochose chagile chikatenda chikulu hegu chidodo, mwana ywa chilume hegu ywa chiche, Daudi kavyambula vyose. <verse eid="1SA 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 30:20" />Iviya, Daudi kayavuza amafyo yose ye izingoto ne izing'ombe na awantu wakwe wakatenda wasaka uludimo ulo wakawalongoza wadya awanyama, kuno wantu awatuhu wakagamba, “Vino nivyo vitahigwe vya Daudi!”<verse eid="1SA 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 30:21" />Akaheza, Daudi niyo awawiya wadya awantu magana maidi wendile wasigwa kwa kamto ka Besoli kwaviya nendile wasokela kumtimila. Wadya wantu weze wamwone Daudi hamwenga na awantu endaga nawo niyo waita wakumsingila. Daudi eze abule hajihi na awantu awo niyo awalamsa. <verse eid="1SA 30:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 30:22" />Mna wantu wasiku wendile wehi na wakwakwa waitaga na Daudi niyo wagamba, “Hachiwenke chochose mwe vino chitahile kwaviya wowo hawaitile hamwenga na suwe. Nawaguhe awavyele wawo na awana wawo wauye kwezikaya zawo.”<verse eid="1SA 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 30:23" />Daudi niyo awagamba, “Siyo ivyo walukolo weyangu. Hamkudaha kudamanya ivyo kwachiya Zumbe Chohile achinkile. Zumbe Chohile kachamila vyedi niyo achinka uhuda mwe idibunga dizile kuchebunga. <verse eid="1SA 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 30:24" />Hahana mntu nalungane ne zifanyanyi zenyu! Yudya aitile kwenkondo na yudya asigale na amabundu yetu, chila yumwenga nenkigwe hantu hakuligana na aweyawe.” <verse eid="1SA 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 30:25" />Kukongela zuwa idyo Daudi nakadamanya ulamuzi uwo utende sigilizi na malagizo mweisi ya Izulaeli kubula vino dyelo.<verse eid="1SA 30:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 30:26" />Daudi eze auye Sikilagi kawegaila wambuyaze awo awadalahala wa Yuda hantu he ivintu vitahigwe akagamba, “Nawegaila majeleko kulaila mwe vintu vitahigwe kulaila kwa wankondo wa Zumbe Chohile.” <verse eid="1SA 30:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 30:27" />Majeleko ayo yendaga kwachausa cha awekazi wa Beteli na awekazi wa Lamoti mwesi ya ntendele ya kwamwenyemzi ya Yuda na awekazi wa Yatili, <verse eid="1SA 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 30:28" />wekazi wa Aloeli na wekazi wa Sifomosi na wekazi wa Eshitemoa, <verse eid="1SA 30:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 30:29" />wekazi wa Lakali na wekazi wa mizi ya Wayelameeli na wekazi wa mizi ya Wakeni, <verse eid="1SA 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 30:30" />wekazi wa Holima na wekazi wa Bolashani na wekazi wa Ataki, <verse eid="1SA 30:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 30:31" />na wekazi wa Hebuloni. Iviya Daudi nakawegaila hamwenga wekazi we mizi yose kudya yeye na wantu wakwe watalamkile.<verse eid="1SA 30:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="1SA 31" />
  <para style="s">File ya Sauli na wanawe 1Mihi 10:1-12</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 31:1" />Ivyo, Wafilisiti niyo wagomba nkondo na Waizulaeli kolugulu lwa Gilibowa, Sauli na wanawe na Waizulaeli watuhu niyo wawasumka Wafilisiti. <verse eid="1SA 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 31:2" />Mna Wafilisiti niyo wamtandama Sauli na wanawe, wakaheza wamkoma Yonasani na Abinadabu na Malikishuwa wanawe dya Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 31:3" />Nkondo naitendesa nkulu kwa Sauli. Wakutaila mifulo weze womwone niyo wamkuntila Sauli imifulo yawo na kumlumiza vihiye. <verse eid="1SA 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 31:4" />Aho, Sauli niyo amgamba yudya mntu akumwinuila iviziha, “Somola isime yako unitunge nibanike, vileke wano wantu hewevinilwe wanasekwiza kunikoma kwa sime na kunitila” Mna uyo amwinuile iviziha kalemela kwaviya kogohesa. Elo, Sauli niyo aguha isime yakwe etunga. <verse eid="1SA 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 31:5" />Yudya akumwinuila iviziha eze awone Sauli kabanika, iviya naye niyo etunga ne isime yakwe, naye niyo abanika saviya Sauli. <verse eid="1SA 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 31:6" />Ivyo nivyo Sauli abanike hamwenga na wanawe watatu na yudya mntu nendile akamwinuila iviziha hamwenga na wantu wakwe wose mwe idyo idizuwa dimwenga. <verse eid="1SA 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 31:7" />Waizulaeli wendile hampezo mwedibwandasi na wadya wendile ntendele ya kaidi yo mto wa Yolodani weze wawone wagomba nkondo wa Izulaeli wasumka naho Sauli na wanawe wakomwa, waisama mwe imizi yawo na kusumka. Wafilisiti niyo waita wakwikala mwe imizi iyo.<verse eid="1SA 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 31:8" />Zuwa ditimile Wafilisiti umo wakaita kuguha ivintu vya wadya wakomile, wabwila ivimba vya Sauli na wanawe watatu wabanika kolugulu lwa Gilibowa. <verse eid="1SA 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 31:9" />Wasenga isingo ya Sauli niyo wamhambula iviziha vyakwe, wakaheza wasigila walosi kweisi yawo yose ya Wafilisiti wagonekeze ifile ya Sauli mwezinyumba za amatukulu yawo na kwa wantu wawo. <verse eid="1SA 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 31:10" />Iviziha vyakwe niyo wavika mwenyumba ya mnungu akwitangwa Mashitoleti, mwili wa Sauli ukatenda usigwa umtwi niyo wauhasika mwe ichiwambaza chomzi wa Beti Sheani. <verse eid="1SA 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 31:11" />Mna wekazi womzi wa Yabeshi Giliyadi weze weve chisimo Wafilisiti wamdamanye Sauli, <verse eid="1SA 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 31:12" />wakankalu wose niyo wafosa, watamba chilo chijima wausa umwili wa Sauli ne imili ya wanawe mwe ichiwambaza cha Betisheani, waita nayo kubula Yabeshi, uko niyo watikimya ivimba ivyo. <verse eid="1SA 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 31:13" />Wakaheza niyo waguha amavuha yawo wayahamba hasi hemti wa mkwazu uko Yabeshi, wakaheza niyo wafunga kwa mazuwa mfungate.<verse eid="1SA 31:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 31" />
</usx>